{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/60177-ic-exalted-gunstar-to-boldly-go","id":60177,"title":"(IC)(Exalted Gunstar) To Boldly Go...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-28T15:27:33-08:00","id":60177,"title":"(IC)(Exalted Gunstar) To Boldly Go...","content":"After receiving the communique from Admiral Invictus Gladians Hime, you all enter<i> Radical Mendicant Zekka's</i> bridge. The viewscreen is filled with the forward fleet of the Gunstar Defense Line, as it prepares to transit into battle. All around you, you see crew members busy at work preparing for flight themselves. <br /> <br /> An attractive, green haired woman, her name plate announcing her to be Cynis Lydia, Commissariat Division, approaches you with a pict-caster, and announces, &quot;My lords, the Factory Cathedrals are loaded and stored properly. However, Fire Control is announcing that the storing of the shells is taking longer than projected. Rest assured, I will ensure that all explosives are stored properly prior to our transit.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Lords,Captain Kana Kleiner of the <i>Mercury's Delight</i> is announcing her readiness, and Admiral Invictus is announcing that Fleet Transit will occur in one Standard Day's time. If you'd like to tour the ship, now would be the time, &quot; a white, haired, gaunt man, his nameplate and epaulets marking him as Ledaal Sato Hoshi, Comms Divison, said, saluting crisply. <br /> <br /> What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T16:17:22-08:00","id":60212,"title":"","content":"Pellias returned the salute and forced a weak smile in response to both Cynis Lydia and Ledaal Sato Hoshi. He was, at the moment, only half-heartedly interested in the ship they were on and more piqued by the forward fleet shown on the viewscreen. He assumed this would be the last he would see of the those travelling to the South Spiral for quite some time, if ever. It wasn't as if he'd ever really fought alongside them before, or knew many members outside of the Celesials that were there, but he admired the bravery of the feint they were about to undertake on the <i>Zekka's </i>behalf.<br /> <br /> He turned back to lock eyes with Ledaal Sato Hoshi after a moment. &quot;How are my boys and girls in the DelArm attachement settling in? Not often we get a trip aboard this size of a vessel. I'd very much like to see where they've been stowed away.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T16:46:19-08:00","id":60224,"title":"","content":"&quot;The Deliberative Army detail is stationed on deck 14-A. They're currently running through drills, I believe,&quot; Sato Hoshi replied, giving Pellias a pict-caster with a map of the ship, and the Army's location. <br /> <br /> After a short elevator trip, Pellias finds a group of Dragonbloods going through combat drills. At one end, is a mountain of a man roaring orders to the others, as a short woman with cropped red hair laughs at the unfortunates as another line of soldiers enters the fray. The giant notices Pellias, and barks an order to the detail, who all snap to attention.<br /> <br /> &quot;Milord, It's an honor to meet you. I am Granite-Boar Feiyan, Shield Division Commander,&quot; he says, as the woman hops from her perch and delivers an airy salute herself.<br /> <br /> &quot;Haze-Cobra Airi, Siege Division Commander,&quot; she says gruffly.<br /> <br /> &quot;Is he here? Welcome, sir! I am Polestar Ryuka, Scouting Division and Intelligence,&quot; a wispy voice say behind you. Turning around, you find a white-haired young woman in jade power armor. With that, another two individuals rush in. One, a stocky man with frazzled blue hair and a young man, barely a boy, with long, green hair salute as well.<br /> <br /> &quot;Sorry, Sir! We were assisting Fire Control in stowing the shells. I'm Still-Jelly Toki, Aquatics Divison, and this here is Shine-Archen Hyui, Medical Division,&quot; the blue-haired man says, as his comrade waves.<br /> <br /> &quot;Pleased to meet you, sir,&quot; Hyui manages, cracking a wide grin.<br /> <br /> Well, now that everyone's acquainted, what next?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T18:44:05-08:00","id":60295,"title":"","content":"Standing on the bridge in full combat gear Amelia was an imposing figure despite her small frame, listening to both dragon-blooded while watching the crew working with her cold stare to make sure that everything was in order.The crew was already falling behind on one schedule.She sighted and turned towards both dragon-blooded .<br /> <br /> &quot;Thank you Miss Cynis, I'm sure you will but these delays will be unacceptable once we have departed the fleet, keeping to our schedule will most likely mean life or death on our mission, is that clear ? I expect you to pass this warning to all the different departments of the ship, Mr Hoshi&quot;<br /> <br /> Giving them a few second to assimilate her words before continuing.<br /> <br /> &quot;Now to the matter at hand I will need a full report of our offensive and defensive capabilities as well as the average time for the crew to respond to emergency situation, before we leave the fleet. I would also like to meet with the flight leaders of fighter squadrons, now&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 01-28-2014, 10:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T21:25:08-08:00","id":60430,"title":"","content":"Lydia mumbled a rushed apology, and then went back to her work, as Hoshi saluted and barked orders over the intercom.<br /> <br /> &quot;Your Wing commanders are coming, Lord. In the meantime, all weapons are powered up and serviced. Fire Control is indicating that they've stowed the last of the shells, and their small arms and armories are all checking out. We have proper kit for an Imperial legion, but the projections, according to what I know, isn't to arm the populace, but to maintain fighting ability until the Fleet can catch up with us, once we touch down,&quot; Hoshi said, as five individuals arrived at the bridge.<br /> <br /> The first was short, made of muscle and poorly shaven. He reeked of cheap liquor, but also had sharp eyes, like a hawk. He glared at Amelia, as though she'd interrupted something far more important.<br /> <br /> &quot; Cathak Toven, Sir, Call-sign is Maniac,&quot; he said, &quot; Wing Leader of Wood Squad,&quot;<br /> <br /> (Note: Unless someone seriously objects, I'm going along with the Anglosphere military custom of treating &quot;Sir&quot; as a gender-neutral term.)<br /> <br /> &quot;Nellens, Sir, Nellens Jenna, Call-sign is Angel,&quot; his companion, a thin woman with auburn hair, continued,&quot; I command Fire Squad.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm V'Neef Czasi, Call-sign is Big Boss,&quot; another of the five, a woman of average build but with long bluish-black hair tied back into a braid called, &quot; My squad's Earth.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The name's Ferem Max, Sir. My Call-sign is Reaper,&quot; the youngest of the five said, an effeminate man with bobbed sky blue hair, &quot; I command Water Squad, and this here is Royhanz Fokker, Call-sign of Majestic. commander of Air Squad. I apologize in advance for him, Sir, He's a little...&quot; Max said, motioning at a grizzled blonde man leaning back on the bulkhead, chewing a blade of grass.<br /> <br /> Fokker looked up at the glaring solar, and bowed deeply, &quot;Grretings, Sir. I'm Fokker, called the Majestic. I have fifty confirmed kills, and I command the meanest sumbitches this side of the Gunstar. Pleased to make your acquaintance.&quot;<br /> <br /> Well, that was a lot. What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T23:14:36-08:00","id":60509,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'll try to live up to the hype&quot; he replied to the youngest member. &quot;At ease everyone, I'm not here to interrupt. Hell, as far as I'm concerned this is the best thing to be doing right now. Let the crew do their thing, and help out where you can,&quot; he said giving a nod to the blue and green-haired boys, &quot;but remember that it isn't our job to fly this thing. Our job is for when we get off again, and I don't want any of you feeling less than ready. As far as I'm concerned, warm-up time started when we got on board and doesn't end until our first touchdown.&quot;<br /> <br /> He looked to Feiyan and gave a knowing nod. &quot;Keep them all trim and ready. This is our big shot people, the stuff everyone back home has dreamt of for centuries: time to take it to the enemy on their turf.&quot; With a salute, he looked to the group. &quot;As you were. I want to watch for a while before I have to take my place on the bridge again.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T01:34:35-08:00","id":60563,"title":"","content":"CLANG! CLANG! CLANG! As the Wing Commanders were reporting in, three loud, reverberating clangs echoed across the bridge, seeming to come from an open access hatch in the ceiling overhead. A few moments of silence, then a loud BANG followed by a trickle of purple smoke. &quot;OK, try it now, Hoshi,&quot; a clear feminine voice called down through the hatch, unaffected by the smoke. &quot;That ought to clear up the problem with the comms and get us back on schedule. Good thing, too; I hear the Air Group Commander we got stuck with is a real hard ass. Nothing worse than a bad first impression,&quot; the voice continued, oblivious to Amelia's presence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T07:54:38-08:00","id":60765,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very good, Sir. Engage the Jylis field, let's show him what we can do!&quot; Feiyan barked, as his troops lined up. One the other side was Airi's heavily armed troops. The two sides were still for a moment, then madness. Airi's siege troops pummeled the Shieldbearers with shellcasters, bombs, and essence weaponry, but sure enough, they held strong. Slowly, the Shieldbearers advanced towards the siege line, and engaged them, while the siege division tried to scatter, to a degree of success. Several siege soldiers began to produce flame gouts out of their palms that exploded when they came into contact with their opponents. However, the Shieldbearers' advance was inexorable, until Airi leapt into the air. <br /> <br /> &quot;Secret Attack: Smoke Cobra Sheds Its Skin,&quot; She says calmly, as she tugs on her back, seemingly producing a dummy out from behind the back of her neck, and tossing it down at the Shieldbearers below. The shieldbearers, clearly aware of something Pellias isn't, finally break ranks at this, expanding their column as they try to get away. However, this is to naught, as the dummy explodes as it hits the ground, blasting everyone to the ground. <br /> <br /> &quot;You win again, technically, cousin,&quot; Feiyan says, getting to his feet, &quot; If this had been real combat we'd have you court martialed for killing your own troops.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Maybe so, but if it came to that, I'd have the Shieldbearers to assist,&quot; Airi grumbled, as the soldiers picked themselves up, waves of Wood essence from the Jylis field rapidly healing their injuries and renewing their kit to working order. Up next, stepped Toki and Ryuka's troops, and the tests continued.<br /> <br /> (Meanwhile on the bridge)<br /> <br /> Hoshi grimaced, as his eyes darted from Amelia to Enterprise. <br /> <br /> &quot;Thanks to you, Milady. The Comms seem to be operating at peak efficiency. I--uh, the main relay dish. I'll go and ensure that it's in working order, &quot; he says, and excuses himself, as Fokker cackled to himself. However, a hand slammed Fokker onto the ground, and laughed. The hand belonged to a tall man in black leather, with expressionless, pupiless eyes, with steely skin and hair not unlike the cables Enterprise had been fiddling with before. <br /> <br /> &quot;Kyahahahahaha! THAT was funny. What have I told you before, Fokker? If you laugh, make sure no one can kick your ass while you do it! Ah, hey, sweet-cheeks,, how's it going?&quot; the Alchemical new-comer aked, as Lydia turned bright crimson.<br /> <br /> &quot;U-um, Lord Zekka, w-well,&quot; she stammered, as he frowned.<br /> <br /> &quot;No, no, no, not you, Cynis-duckling, I mean the little girl in the armor playing like she's a tough shit. You're gonna protect me, eh? What's your name?&quot; Zekka asked, grinning a shark-toothed grin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T09:24:28-08:00","id":60836,"title":"","content":"&quot;What would your Sifu say, Airi?&quot; Jin says. He arrived on the deck during the drills, and had not yet spoken, &quot;Valiar Jintus Tertius, Director of the Operations Stealth and Security division. Now, Airi,&quot; Jin affects an imitation of Peerless Ocelot, his old, regrettably deceased, Sifu, &quot;What is the philosophy of the Smoking Cobra?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T11:55:57-08:00","id":60958,"title":"","content":"Airi, abandons her earlier gruff demeanor, and snaps to attention, &quot;The essence of Smoking Cobra is reckless action. You become the double edged sword that both strikes down your opponent, while striking yourself down, Sir.&quot;<br /> <br /> At this, Feiyan and the other division commanders quickly run towards Jin and bow deeply.<br /> <br /> &quot;Senior, It's good to see you. How goes your journey along the Lotus of Understanding, &quot;Feiyan asks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T14:37:15-08:00","id":61070,"title":"","content":"&quot;Thank you Mr Hoshi, you do not have to worry, I have no intention to wage war while we are on this mission, but if we have to fight I want to know what we are capable of&quot;<br /> <br /> Going into the Spiral with only a fraction of the intended personnel was bad enough not say that the idea of waging war was almost unthinkable, almost... Lost in her thoughts she barely noticed the arrival of the flight leaders and Hoshi's words made her snap back to the present, she listened to them present themselves and she was about to introduce herself when one hell of a racket came from the ceiling followed by a woman's voice, as she walked to the hatch in the ceiling from where it came from.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yeah she is, I assume that you're unaware that I am on the bridge, why don't you come down so that we can talk face to face&quot;<br /> <br /> Before she could hear a reply her attention had shifted to the tall alchemical that had arrived on the bridge. Radical Mendicat Zekka in the flesh well so to speak. His way of speaking lack some finesse but warship where entitle to some quirk she assumed.<br /> <br /> &quot;So big bad alchemical need little me to protect himself hein ? But I digress I am Amelia Blitzfire, commander of the air group. Flight leaders now that the presentations are made I will speak to you later, dismiss !! &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 01-29-2014, 08:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T15:35:09-08:00","id":61113,"title":"","content":"&quot;That is correct,&quot; Jin says, &quot;Now, how can you strike yourself down when you cower behind your men? Ponder this, and you may take another step towards mastery of your Style.&quot;<br /> <br /> Jin returns the division commanders' salute, &quot;My journey goes well, cousin. Don't let my presence disturb you; continue with your demonstration. Your commander,&quot; he waves to Pellais, &quot;will need to know what you're capable of.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T18:12:16-08:00","id":61203,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/60177-ic-exalted-gunstar-to-boldly-go?p=61070#post61070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Radical Mendicat Zekka &quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"http://s30.postimg.org/gz4d1wbw1/4087036_m.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> I know that'a a typo, but that put a smile on my (And Zekka's) face. I may have to draw Radical Cat Zekka later.<br /> <br /> \u200b(On the bridge)<br /> <br /> Zekka chortles in his baritone voice, &quot;I was waging war and burning planets when your mother's mother was a twinkle in some courtesan's eye. If anything you need protecting, but be that as it may, Amdiral Hime won't let me fight this on my own. Something about &quot;Not enough strategic firepower.&quot; Bullshit, I say. I'll show her some firepower. Anyways, well met, little Bronze Tiger. Hopefully you do well. I'd hate to have to drag your corpse to Hime with a &quot;Told you so,&quot; and with that, Zekka walks off, cackling to himself.<br /> <br /> The Wing Commanders all salute to Amelia and walk off, save Fokker, who Max has to bodily carry off, knocked out cold by Zekka's blow. This leaves Amelia and Enterpise with Lydia and a handful of mortal technicians on deck at present.<br /> <br /> (in the DelArm Bay)<br /> <br /> The Division Commanders all salute at Jin's words of wisdom and return to their drills. This time, it is Ryuka and Toki are up to their drills. Ryuka and her scouts are blindingly fast and they bring with them a deep chill, while Toki and his troops seem to possess unusual flexibility and incredibly long range with their ability to clinch opponents. Despite their speed, Toki's forces win out the day, as they manage to incapacitate the majority of the scouts. <br /> <br /> The final exercise is Hyui's medics, as they rush to the fore, and all four of the other commanders approach them. The ensuing battle is a brutal affair, as the Division Commanders all let into the medics, while the medics all coutnerattack with reckless abandon, the attacks of the other Commanders being sloughed off like so much dead bark off a tree. In the end, all of the Commanders are tossed out of the battle area, and the exercise is called.<br /> <br /> &quot;Bloody Immortal Archen. It's damn near impossible to put them down for any amount of time,&quot; Airi grumbles. <br /> <br /> &quot;Is there anything else you'd like us to do, Sir?&quot; Feiyan asks Pellias, with an eye on Jin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T18:55:35-08:00","id":61238,"title":"","content":"Pellias shakes his head with a satisfied look on his face. &quot;Don't stop your training schedule&quot; he says plainly as he looked around the drill room. &quot;I will critique you later after I've had some time to watch.&quot; With that, he flexed his hand and concentrated for a moment, a small shimmer in the air precipitating soon after in his right palm and vanishing. Smiling, he slowly closed his hand a short moment later and gave a parting salute.<br /> <br /> Turning to the Sidereal, Pellias gave a simple and small bow of his head. &quot;Master Valiar, a respectful hello. Do you know what provisions have been given to onboard security? While I realise this isn't a usual vessel, I doubt that even <i>Zekka </i>himself has every corner and nook covered. Maker help us if we're caught with our pants down and get boarded without a plan on hand.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Anyone with dematerialized vision on, just set out an eye via <i>Thousand-Watchful Eye Bauble</i>).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T19:51:26-08:00","id":61253,"title":"","content":"Watching the Alchemical leave the bridge Amelia sighted a breath of relief &quot;Well I'm never gonna get along with that guy that's for sure, Miss Lydia could you have someone show me to the DelArm detachment is stationed, I would like to have a few words with their officer's before we leave for our mission and have my quarters prepared I have a few thing coming on board for me could you make sure they arrive at the right place&quot; (Mostly furniture and other stuff)<br /> <br /> She needed to move a bit stretch her leg and something about Zekka made her nervous maybe because he was very old or just the fact they are standing inside of him she couldn't tell right now that and she didn't want people to know that the old alchemical got to her more then he might have wanted &quot;that's why I hate old exalted always think their all that and shit...&quot; she mumbled to herself on more about things like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T21:16:54-08:00","id":61292,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jotun</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/60177-ic-exalted-gunstar-to-boldly-go?p=61238#post61238\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pellias shakes his head with a satisfied look on his face. &quot;Don't stop your training schedule&quot; he says plainly as he looked around the drill room. &quot;I will critique you later after I've had some time to watch.&quot; With that, he flexed his hand and concentrated for a moment, a small shimmer in the air precipitating soon after in his right palm and vanishing. Smiling, he slowly closed his hand a short moment later and gave a parting salute.<br /> <br /> Turning to the Sidereal, Pellias gave a simple and small bow of his head. &quot;Master Valiar, a respectful hello. Do you know what provisions have been given to onboard security? While I realise this isn't a usual vessel, I doubt that even <i>Zekka </i>himself has every corner and nook covered. Maker help us if we're caught with our pants down and get boarded without a plan on hand.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Anyone with dematerialized vision on, just set out an eye via <i>Thousand-Watchful Eye Bauble</i>).</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Please, call me Jin. As my old Sifu once told me, my terrestrial heritage is useful when dealing with the Dragon-blooded, its not something I should remain too attached to myself. And I believe you misunderstand the purpose of my division. We're <i>Operational </i>Stealth and <i>Operational </i>Security. Intelligence and Counter-intelligence. Though, between you and me...&quot; Jin continues in hushed tones, &quot;I did manage to get a handful of Fate Weavers and Pattern Spiders to help with Zekka's maintenance and Causality Enforcement. They'll let me know if they find any stowaways.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T21:22:39-08:00","id":61296,"title":"","content":"Lydia draws up a map on her pict-caster, and says, &quot; Lady Blitzfire, if you follow Crewman Himes here,&quot; directing to a short man with an impressive, frizzy beard, &quot;He can show you the way to the Deliberative Army bay. Once you're finished with your inspection, the officer's quarters are on Deck 7-F. Don't worry about your baggage. We of the Commissariat Division will stow it neatly and properly,&quot; she said<br /> <br /> &quot;If you get lost, don't hesitate to hail me on any of the terminals, and I will direct you,&quot; she says, bowing.<br /> <br /> After a short elevator ride in silence with the statue-like Himes, Amelia approaches the bays of the Deliberative Army, seeing Pellias and Jin standing there, as Feiyan, Hyui, and Ryuka were lecturing the others <br /> <br /> &quot;Polestar Wolf, Immovable Boar, Smoking Cobra, Immortal Archen, and Ephemeral Octopus. These are our martial traditions, and our lifeline. We're here to fight any Maker-borne horror Zekka comes across so the engineers and colonists can set up the base. If we need to lay down our lives to do so, then so be it, We'll be rewarded in the next by the Maidens for our heroism. NO SMILING, BAT! This is important! I swear!&quot; Ryuka said, as she rattled off dates, important battles, and various tactics. The impressive lineage of these Dragonbloods is illuminated, and after nearly ten minutes of constant talking, Ryuka says, finally, &quot; Alright, with that in mind, go over entry protocols again,&quot; and the divisions return to their drills once more, simulating an entry on an unknown planet.<br /> <br /> Ryuka nods with stern approval, but flashes a swift salute at the sight of Amelia, with a harsh, &quot;Officer on deck!&quot;<br /> <br /> The gang is getting back together it seems, what will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T22:00:49-08:00","id":61313,"title":"","content":"~~ON THE BRIDGE~~<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, you'll get used to him,&quot; that same female voice called out of the overhead hatch again. After a moment, and some clanging, a head and shoulders emerge from the open hatch. With her flawless skin of pale grey with starmetal highlights, she is clearly an alchemical. Her princess cut sapphire soulgem shone in the center of her forehead, and though her eyes were covered by a shimmering crystal essence visor, her face was still smiling brightly as she hung upside-down. Bright silver hair, long enough to just barely brush her shoulders if she were upright, fell straight down instead, though some of it was held in place with an adamant hairband with a beautifully carved flower on one side, above her right ear. A smudge of purple oil marred her left cheek, and the light blue jumpsuit she seemed to be wearing also appeared to bear some recent purple stains, though it is hard to tell with only the shoulders showing. &quot;He's just grumpy because we're still in spacedock. He hates being stuck in one place, but there's just too much work to do. A lot of specialized charms needed to be installed... well, invented, then built, then installed, for this mission. And, to be frank, they're playing havoc with his systems. For example, apparently the Spiral-Scanning Infinite Argus Array breaks down when exposed to the field from the Paramagnetic Ramjet Apparatus. And it turns out that Glorious Inertial Dampening Compensator interferes with our new Void-Spanning Ansible Transmitter. Or, at least it did. Fixed now. Here, Hoshi, can you have someone take that down to recycling for me?&quot; She casually drops a large piece of shattered crystal through the open hatch down to the communications officer. &quot;Thanks,&quot; she says, turning her attention back to Amelia. &quot;The truth is, we really need another week in spacedock at least to prepare. Maybe two. Why the Deliberative is insisting we get underway so quickly, I can't understand, but I got told rather firmly that it's not my place to ask.&quot; Her smile dissolved into a grimace of dissatisfaction for a moment before returning.<br /> <br /> &quot;But, I suppose that's neither here nor there. I'm <i>Righteous Common Enterprise</i>. I'm Chief Engineer of this ship, and also the Primary Architect of the expedition. It's a pleasure to meet you. Oh, and sorry I called you a hard ass, but you <i>do</i> have a reputation.&quot; She says all this with a confident smile, still hanging upside down through a hatch in the ceiling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T08:00:36-08:00","id":61547,"title":"","content":"(Okay, I'm getting a little confused. Amelia, you gotta decide, are you on the Bridge or down on the DelArm Bay?)<br /> <br /> Lydia picks up the crystal shard, and hands it to a roving cylinder on spidery legs, &quot;CRaSH, can you dispose of this?&quot; as the cylinder swiftly catches the crystal and then shoves it into its interior.<br /> <br /> &quot;Processing material for recycling,&quot; the machine spirit chirps, and wanders off, continuing its routine.<br /> <br /> Lydia looks up at Enterprise, &quot;Um, Lady Enterprise, Mr. Hoshi isn't--&quot; just as Hoshi stormed into the room, his face even more pale than usual, utter panic written all over. He jumped into his seat, and began to bark into the intercom.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://youtu.be/hsZqXdPZb8s?t=2m40s\" target=\"_blank\">http://youtu.be/hsZqXdPZb8s?t=2m40s</a> (Some mood music for ya)<br /> <br /> &quot;All personnel, repeat, all personnel, enemy fleet sighted, mark eight, House of Ewers, Repeat, enemy fleet sighted, mark eight, House of Ewers. This is NOT a drill!&quot; he roars, and then begins to adjust the viewscreen, zooming far abreast what was seen before. In the far distance, one can see a massive entourage of ships, zeppelins, and sundry floating beasts and beings. Upon one particularly large ship is the banner &quot;Death to Traitors&quot; written, while on another particularly large vessel is the banner commanding to &quot;Burn the Dissenters,&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I know those ships. Those are the Regional Shoguns, Theion's most trusted military leaders. Those seem to be Hieronymus Escka and Triumphant Sky, the Southern and Eastern Shoguns, judging from their heraldry. Oooooh, I think Hime bite off more than she can chew, kyahahahahahahahahaha!&quot; Zekka's voice reverberated through the bridge.<br /> <br /> &quot;How long until the fleet comes into firing range?&quot; Lydia asks Hoshi.<br /> <br /> &quot;Approximately 6 hours,&quot; Hoshi says, wiping sweat off his brow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-30-2014, 01:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T08:52:18-08:00","id":61575,"title":"","content":"(Well I am on the DelArm deck but not for long, sorry NutiketAiel but I don't consider you're post valid since the ST posted before you that I was already in the army bay, again sorry)<br /> <br /> Just as Amelia was saluting back Hoshi's voice boomed in the intercom system &quot;Oh shit, sorry but this will have to wait&quot; Then stormed off the bay towards the elevator, after the short ride that seemed to take hours she entered the command deck. &quot;Mr hoshi what is the status of the enemy forces ?, Miss Lydia get me the admiral on the comm right now !!&quot;<br /> <br /> That didn't bode well for this mission if they where attacked before even leaving, moving toward the view screen to watch and take as mush information as she could while waiting for Hoshi's report and her transmission to the admiral. &quot;Tell the air group to get my voidfighter ready and that all flight leaders get their men ready to go out but to stay put for the time being, nobody is going out there until I say so understood ? &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 01-30-2014, 12:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T09:15:50-08:00","id":61584,"title":"","content":"Hoshi nodded to Amelia, and barked orders to the Wing Commanders over the intercom. He then fiddled with his terminal, and a tall, stern, blonde woman is staring down at you.<br /> <br /> &quot;Zekka, this better be important. I have three hundred enemy vessels bearing down on me, and it looks like two of my old nemeses are ready for a rematch, so make it quick,&quot; Hime said curtly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T09:25:50-08:00","id":61588,"title":"","content":"&quot;Sorry to disturb you sir, this is Commander Blitzfire, does our mission take priority or do we engage the enemy with you and the rest of the fleet ? we are standing ready to engage the enemy or to launch sir&quot; Lets hope I don't get chewed out by the admiral for this she thought.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T13:25:50-08:00","id":61695,"title":"","content":"&quot;WHAT!? Do not engage! Your mission is more important than dealing with the entirety of Theion's Navy! This changes nothing! Once we engage, you are to break off, and travel across your planned mission path. If you so much as even redirect yourself to engage, I'll have all your heads! Got it?&quot; Hime growled, and the Comms channel was cut.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hoho! Quite the firecracker, that one,&quot; Zekka calls, and the floor lights up with a chart of the surrounding area. The Gunstar fleet is arrayed in an arrow head formation, while the approaching enemy fleets are in twin walls, approaching you head on.<br /> <br /> While this is happening, the bridge personnel shuffle in, a thin boy with fiery hair; his nameplate labeling him as Cathak Cherekos, assumes Fire Control, as a blue haired man of indiscernible years, named Nellens Sullust, assumes Navigation.<br /> <br /> &quot;patching in Mission flight plan,&quot; intones Sullust, pattering away at his terminal, as Cherekos calls, &quot;No enemies within local voidspace. All weapons ready!&quot;<br /> <br /> (Meanwhile in the DelArm bays)<br /> <br /> The division commanders bark at their troops, as they assume boarding stations, readying their kits if and when the call for action is sounded.<br /> <br /> What will you do now, then?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":".  Oramus stole the commas. All forty of them. And that's terrible. 01-30-2014, 06:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T13:49:35-08:00","id":61724,"title":"","content":"Jin hurries as quickly as he can to the Bridge. Once there, he hurries over to Navigation and tells Nellens Sullust, &quot;Mr Nellens, once we reach here,&quot; Jin points to the point on the navigation plot where the ship begins its long burn to the Spiral, &quot;inform me at once. Mercury'll show us the right way to go.&quot;<br /> <br /> Once Zekka gets into proper position, Jin will activate Yellow Path (<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4385435\" target=\"_blank\">2 sux</a>) to decrease our travel time to 75%.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T15:52:16-08:00","id":61798,"title":"","content":"The waiting is maddening, however, you see Admiral Hime's noble warstrider, the Invincible God of Gold, Baldiguin, rise out of her battleship, and the shooting starts. Streams of essence, venom, volleys of missiles collide as the two sides seemingly crash into one another. <br /> <br /> However, with Jin's use of Yellow Path, Zekka speeds off, <i>Mercury's Delight</i> following not far behind.<br /> <br /> &quot;No signs of enemy activity following us. We're in the clear....Wait a minute....&quot; Hoshi says, as Zekka growls.<br /> <br /> &quot;What do you mean, &quot;Wait a minute,&quot; boy. Spit it out,&quot; Zekka commands.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, Lord Zekka, there was an unusual essence pattern for a second right behind us. But it disappeared.It must have been caused by the Fate-weaving of Lord Jin's charm,&quot; Hoshi replied.<br /> <br /> &quot;Speaking of which, I'm detecting a large wave of wyld energy right ahead,&quot; He says. <br /> <br /> &quot;I don't see anything on scanners,&quot; Hoshi replied.<br /> <br /> &quot;Zoom out, idiot&quot;<br /> <br /> Hoshi did so, and gasped. The chart on the floor now revealed a large pink smudge of unidentified energy right ahead, blocking Zekka's path. The viewscreen zoomed in on it, revealing it to be a large cloud, sprouting rainbows, much as a fertile garden might sprout flowers.<br /> <br /> &quot;We can go around, and potentially alert the enemy flanks to our purpose, or we can go through. What say you, officers?&quot; Zekka rumbled.<br /> <br /> What will you do? Go around or through it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T15:52:58-08:00","id":61799,"title":"","content":"Well this is gonna be boring she thought &quot;hey Zekka, is she always like that ? and after that they I'm a hard ass&quot; says Amelia as she goes to a seat that is out of the way to watch the show, when it comes to navigation and such its not really her thing. &quot;Mr Hoshi tell the air group to stand down nobody his going hunting today, the fleet will cover us from what I gather&quot; she says with a disappointed look her eyes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T15:59:57-08:00","id":61803,"title":"","content":"&quot;Not always. When she was younger, she was more wide-eyed and liked to go on expeditions with the Sun Dragon and myself. Now she's more jaded. Get a few drinks in her, though, and she lightens up. Don't tell her I said that, though, or I'll twist your head off, &quot; Zekka says conversationally, &quot;We still need to make p our minds about the Wyld storm ahead of us. Move aside or crash through? What will we do?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T16:10:00-08:00","id":61807,"title":"","content":"&quot;Mercury lead us right to it,&quot; Jin says to the Alchemical, &quot;I say we head in. We should be able to loose our pursuers inside.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T16:12:42-08:00","id":61810,"title":"","content":"&quot;Any record of previous attempts to fly through Wyld storms?&quot; Pellias asked as he calmly walked onto the bridge. &quot;Just asking as a point of interest, mind you. I don't see us as having any other choice given that stealth and misdirection are primary objectives of this mission.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T16:24:45-08:00","id":61816,"title":"","content":"Amelia takes a few to think moment before speaking &quot;The Sun Dragon ? who is that ? Never mind, it is not the time for these kind of things, I agree with the sideral (haven't met yet so Amelia doesn't know his name) when the maidens guides us it is wise to follow their indication, I say we go through it. We will most likely loose our pursuers in it&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T16:34:56-08:00","id":61821,"title":"","content":"&quot;You boys don't know me very well, do ya? (And not knowing the Sun Dragon, little Bronze Tiger? For shame. Buy me a drink, and I'll tell you some tales that'll put some hair on yer chest) A little thing like this? If I were smaller, I'd have smashed it with my Dragon-Slaying Fist. Sadly, Hime'd yell at me if I used that. But, rest assured, I got ya covered,&quot; the elder Alchemical muttered, as rumblings within the ship erupted. Through the viewscreen, the Circle can see Zekka's gigantic arms moving through a short kata before thrusting forward.<br /> <br /> &quot;Void-Shielding Stance,&quot; intones Zekka, and a large oscillating field of bluish-green essence flows out from his hands.<br /> <br /> &quot;There, now, for the time being, no one can be affected by the Wyld, so long as you stay within me,&quot; Zekka said. If you want to go out, though, well...&quot;<br /> <br /> With that, Zekka's starship body surges through the swirling waves of rainbows and clouds before him, until a great roaring, completely unlike before rocks the ship, and Zekka howls a curse.<br /> <br /> &quot;What in blazes? THIS IS SOLID?&quot; he roars, and the ship stops.<br /> <br /> &quot;Checking status,&quot; Hoshi says, &quot;Engineering is reporting that apart from the armor of the arms being damaged, all systems are operating. We musta struck something within the storm. Maybe an errant shard of Creation?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Whatever it is, unless you all get me up, we can't leave,&quot; Zekka grumbles.<br /> <br /> &quot;Scanning for hostile Fae activity,&quot; Hoshi calls, as the viewscreen shifts to cameras around the ship. The view seems to be the same pink-purple clouds as before, but now, gaggles of beings, as though someone had a rough idea of a person, and made it out of fog, appear pausing and chattering to one another, pointing at the ship.<br /> <br /> Well, this is a thing. What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-31-2014, 10:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T16:38:49-08:00","id":61824,"title":"","content":"&quot;Scan for Primordial Essence!&quot; Jin shouts to Hoshi, &quot;This could be one of Hegra's weapons!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T16:44:22-08:00","id":61827,"title":"","content":"Hoshi begins to type furiously at his terminal before turning to Jin, &quot; Energy readings around us don't match Hegra's. This is something unknown. Something not Wyld, either...&quot; he says. <br /> <br /> &quot;How's that? My charm is still in effect!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Then how are they climbing on you?&quot; Hoshi asked, pointing to the viewscreen, where several of the cloudfolk were tapping and examining the superstructure with great interest.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T16:55:37-08:00","id":61832,"title":"","content":"(I think I might have to change my anima banner now :P) &quot;Zekka are they trying to get in ? Mr Hoshi make sure to record every readings we get from the sensors&quot; as she approach the view screens to see the coudfolks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T17:08:13-08:00","id":61847,"title":"","content":"Segments of armor snap out of Pellias' cowl like an unfolding telescope and cover his face, a small blueish glow the only discernable feature remaining. &quot;Unless there are any objections, I'll be treating anything that boards us as hostile&quot; he said in an electric tone as readied one of the blasters at his side.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T17:45:10-08:00","id":61864,"title":"","content":"&quot;They don't appear to be aggressive,&quot; Jin mumbles, &quot;And they're nothing we know off...&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm going out,&quot; Jin declares, &quot;Intelligence is my department, and let's face it, with my armor and Charms, I have the best chance of getting back to the ship if things go badly.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T18:09:30-08:00","id":61884,"title":"","content":"As Jin suits up and leaves the ship, he finds the ground to be springy, and the cloudfolk begin to cluster around her, chittering to one another. Their touch is light and cool, like that of air. As they congregate on Jin, a large, portly individual makes their way through the crowd.<br /> <br /> &quot;One side, one side, make way. Very important person coming through,&quot; it calls, as it approaches. Upon closer inspection, it is a short human-shaped being, covered in blue fur, with a small, beady eyes. Wearing a large grey-blue coat, and a jovial top hat, it bows, and pulls out a massive book from a pocket. <br /> <br /> &quot;Greetings and salutations, Sirrah. I am Jellivens, the Easer of the Ways. I am the Herald of this Fine Being we call home. May I know you name?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T18:18:22-08:00","id":61893,"title":"","content":"Surprised by this turn of events, Jin makes a formal salute to Jevillens, bowing slightly. &quot;Greetings. My name is Valiar Jintus Tertius, though most call me Jin. I apologize on behalf of this vessel and its crew if we're trespassing. We are were being followed, and entered here to shake our pursuers, thinking this a Wyld Storm. Might I know the name of our host?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T18:24:51-08:00","id":61896,"title":"","content":"&quot;Wyld Storm? Hohohoho! Good sir! You are most confused. We are within the World of Palanmas, the Rainbow of Passions Wrought, We are as real and as stable as the Greater Realm ruled by my Greater Self's elders in the center of this land. I can understand, and am most sorry for any misgivings that our course has given you and your people. My Greater Self has some...eclectic company, and I can't say I agree with them, but that is not up to me. That's up to Keirren, and she's not here at present. Is there anything else I may assist with?&quot; he asks, shooing away a cloudfolk.<br /> <br /> &quot;Don't mind the Beriberiis. They're curious, but harmless,&quot; Jellivens says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T18:28:14-08:00","id":61898,"title":"","content":"Amelia readies her Autoklave, the chain blade roaring to life as she unsheathe it &quot;I believe Mr Pellias that I'll help you if anything come on board I may not be DelArm anymore but that doesn't that I can't fight&quot; as she winks at him. &quot;Mr Hoshi is there a way to hear what is happening outside from where our friend is ?&quot; Her helmet closes as the the face plate slides from the back of her head to cover the front and seals itself with a hissing sound, two slits where her eyes should be starts glowing red just as the HUD of the helmet comes to life.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 01-30-2014, 09:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T18:33:00-08:00","id":61902,"title":"","content":"&quot;We're within a Primordial?&quot; Jin says, shocked, &quot;That ... explains a lot. Perhaps I, and a few of my companions, could go and visit upon your Greater Self?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T18:33:50-08:00","id":61903,"title":"","content":"Hoshi nods, and presses a button. A small levitating drone pops out of the floor, and zooms out to Jin's side.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, hello! And who might you be, &quot;Jellivans asks, taking off his hat to the newcomer.<br /> <br /> Being brought abreast, Jellivans nods and smiles.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-30-2014, 09:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T18:39:07-08:00","id":61907,"title":"","content":"Jin will com back to the bridge, appraising them of the situation, and suggesting that the Celestial exalts meet with him to speak to the Primordial.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T18:43:31-08:00","id":61908,"title":"","content":"&quot;I do not like this but if it is a primordial we can't fight it, might as well go meet this guy to avoid confrontation&quot; Amelia puts her autokalve back in it sheath and is ready to follow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T18:52:07-08:00","id":61914,"title":"","content":"&quot;It's alright, everyone! Palanmas is a kind being! Come, we'll see Her,&quot; he says, and opens his book, which he hops aboard, and motions for you to do the same.<br /> <br /> &quot;Before you see Palanmas' small-body, I believe it would be best to tell you of her story. It may answer some questions you have.<br /> <br /> You see...In the Beginning. There was Nothing, until the Divine Ignition awoke, and the Tribe of Dreamers realized the emptiness of their world.<br /> <br /> &quot;Let us build a land we can call our own,&quot; They decided, while Palanmas was still sleepy.<br /> <br /> &quot;I wish to sleep for five more minutes. Go ahead of me,&quot; she said, and wrapped herself in a blanket made of Unshaped. Well, five minutes became five aeons, as these things do, and finally, Palanmas awoke to find her fellows already gone ahead and made their land. Therefore, she took her four closest allies; the Thief of Worlds, Prince Balor, the Duke of Mirrors, and the Princess of the Glittering Train, and went to see her fellows. That's what's happening now. Well, until she paused. She's wondering what you all want, and that's why I am here,&quot; Jellivans said, as the book sailed over the cloudy landscape until stopping at a gigantic tower.<br /> <br /> &quot;I must caution you, though. If you know of what Palanmas is; She is not quite as...grown as the others. Her sleeping for so long has stunted her growth of power and insight, you see,&quot; Jellivans says, and opens the door.<br /> <br /> Inside is five people standing around a table. Four are obviously Fae; their impossible beauty and dazzling tools gave away that much, while a girl, no more than fifteen is amongst them, laughing.<br /> <br /> &quot;And, YOU, got the Old Maid! Now, you deal, Balor!&quot; she calls, before staring at you.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, hello. Who are you,&quot; She asks.<br /> <br /> Well, then. How do you respond?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T18:57:27-08:00","id":61917,"title":"","content":"&quot;Greetings I am Amelia and it is an honor to meet you&quot; Lets play it safe for now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T19:22:19-08:00","id":61932,"title":"","content":"Jin will bow to the young Primordial and her entourage, &quot;Greetings. I am Jin, Exalted servant of the Maidens of Destiny, and envoy the Primordial Autochthon, the Great Maker. It is an honor to meet you, My Lady.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T21:19:37-08:00","id":61981,"title":"","content":"Pellias didn't like the situation they were in. For one, a whole division of the Fleet was off performing a risky move that would cost livesso the <i>Zekka</i> crew could infiltrate. Now, they'd crashed into the first thing they'd come into and were wasting time on a curiousity, albeit a curiousity that at any other time would be a more than worthwhile stop.<br /> <br /> For two, they'd been drawn well away from the <i>Zekka</i> itself into the heart of things too fast. He'd had a bit of experience off-Gunstar and knew all too well how well-disguised traps could exist on a foreign world. &quot;What're you playing?&quot; he asked in his electric buzz.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T07:52:18-08:00","id":62164,"title":"","content":"The girl looks at Amelia, and curtsies as best she can, &quot;Nice to meet you as well. I am Palanmas, the Rainbow of Passions Wrought, and these are my friends, the Duke of Mirrors, Thief of Worlds, Princess of the Glittering Train and, of course, Prince Balor,&quot; she said, going around the table.<br /> <br /> &quot;These mortals are woefully dressed,&quot; comments the Princess, a haughty woman, her achingly beautiful face made bearable to look at with a gauzy veil.<br /> <br /> &quot;I agree. They seem off to play war,&quot; The Thief of Worlds said, a thin man without a shirt, his voluminous mane accomplishing this task. <br /> <br /> &quot;I appreciate your greetings as well, Sirs,&quot; She curtsies to Jin and Pellias, but pauses as Jin mentions his affiliation to the Maidens.<br /> <br /> &quot;What are those? Maidens? Destiny?&quot; She asks, as Prince Balor, a regal man whose left arm and foot are much smaller than his right, his eyes clenched shut, chimed in.<br /> <br /> &quot;They are automatons, love. They served your elders, and now serve one of them; the Machine Lord Authochthon. They ensure the World operates as intended. That's what Destiny is; their World operating well,&quot; he says, as Palanmas looks on fascinated.<br /> <br /> &quot;Really! I never knew my elders could make such things! In my exploration of the Spiral, I have seen many things, but nothing like that! Oh, you must join us, though. We are playing Old Maid. Apparently, you all have cards, and must play them, else you get the Old Maid, as you have to let your opponents take one of your cards.<br /> <br /> Well, will you join in? (Int+War if you're going to play fair. Manipulation+War if you're going to cheat)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T08:18:57-08:00","id":62187,"title":"","content":"&quot;It will be my pleasure to play, my lady and I apologies if I am not dressed properly but in these troubled times it is better to wear armor than a dress I'm afraid&quot; moving to a seat at the table. (Amelia activate her first war excellency to add 6 dice to her roll at a cost of 6 mote of personal essence, with 11 mote remaining in her personal pool) <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4386246/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4386246/</a> (oh and I play fair)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 01-31-2014, 11:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T08:36:31-08:00","id":62196,"title":"","content":"Jin will sit down and play fairly; after all, no-one likes a cheat. Rolling 4 dice, he gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4386261/\" target=\"_blank\">5 sux</a>. Neat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T08:58:59-08:00","id":62214,"title":"","content":"As Palanmas draws her cards to play, Balor halts her. <br /> <br /> &quot;Why not let Keirren play, Love? Her power may be needed to beat these mortals,&quot; he says, and Palanmas looks at the Circle.<br /> <br /> &quot;You could be right. They look tough,&quot; the Titan admits, and blows a whistle. A rainbow bursts down into the room, and out of it appears a woman seemingly out of a children's superhero stage show. She is wearing a blue eye mask, and matching blue bodysuit, along with a dai-sho arrangement of two swords with hearts built into the hilts.<br /> <br /> &quot;Keirren, Warrior of Love has arrived,&quot; the woman remarked, posing, as everyone looked on.<br /> <br /> &quot;Keirren, I need you to play for me,&quot; Palanmas said cheerfully, and the newcomer Daeva dutifully replaced the girl-Titan at the table.<br /> <br /> The game goes on in silence, as Keirren handily crushes Amelia to her right. However, Amelia's gambit opened up Keirren's tells to Jin, who ultimately allowed him to hand her defeat.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Old Maid. You all fight well. My lady, I apologize. These mortals have bested me,&quot; Keirren said solemnly to her Jouten, as the small girl laughed.<br /> <br /> &quot;You two are strong! Well, be that as it may, you may be given one wish, then. That is the rule of this table. I had hoped Keirren would crush you, and I'd be able to keep you here, but I guess that won't be,&quot; she said, as the four Fae look on impassively.<br /> <br /> Well, what is your wish?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T09:38:30-08:00","id":62243,"title":"","content":"&quot;It was a marvelous game Palanmas and thank you all for this game&quot; She gestures towards the fae and the devas, Amelia ponders for a moment before giving a cryptic answer &quot;I wish to be everything that I can be and everything that I should be&quot; (I have no idea what to wish for so let see what you want to give me)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T09:47:43-08:00","id":62249,"title":"","content":"Harmonious Voice Virtuoso had just finished his tea. Or what passes for tea on a military vessel anyway. He had seen his staff of Lectors settled into their quarters, taken a relaxing stroll through the ship, and selected his outfit for take-off. A flowing set of royal blue and violet robes held together with a golden sash about his waist. No ornamentation needed, the bold colors would speak for themselves. His hair was perfectly brushed and done up in a top-knot, held in place with a simple pin. No need for any jewelry suggesting a crown. As the only politician he knew of on board, he didn't want to be seen as thinking himself 'better' than the soldiers.<br /> <br /> He was just walking down the corridor toward the lift when the alarm sounded. &quot;<i>An attack!</i>&quot; he thought as he looked around. Voice had really wished he had paid more attention to the layout on his previous walk about the ship. He overheard an officer calling to ready fighters but not to engage. It seems the original plan was still intact. <i>&quot;Thank the Maidens...&quot;</i> he prayed to himself as the pit in his stomach grew. He had to keep his courage. The leadership needed to appear confident. And so he checked his holster within his robes, feeling the familiar cold grip of his blaster. That gave him the courage to keep going. The ride on the lift was quiet enough, but the sudden stop at the top was unsettling. The whole ship seemed to lurch forward. He braced for the impact as well as he could, once again thanking the Maidens his top-knot didn't fall out. He adjusted himself and boldly stepped onto the bridge. He inteneded to look regal and important, only to look at the beautiful rainbow landscape before him and stand slack-jawed in wonder.<br /> <br /> ((OOC: feel free to stick me in the current time. On the bridge while everyone has left already))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T09:49:53-08:00","id":62254,"title":"","content":"Palanmas ponders this for a minute, and then says, &quot;Very well,&quot; and snaps her fingers.<br /> <br /> Nothing changes about Amelia, and she doesn't feel any different. Her puzzlement extends to Palanmas and Keirren, who look at one another,<br /> <br /> &quot;Um, it seems a being stronger than I has already done so. You possess a power within you that has refined you to the point whereby any improvements I can grant are moot. I'm not stingy, though. Is there anything else you'd want?&quot; she asks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-31-2014, 12:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T09:54:58-08:00","id":62261,"title":"","content":"&quot;Lady Palanmas,&quot; Jin says, &quot;I wish that you or a dutifully appointed representative, such as one of your Highest Souls, travel to the World of the Great Maker to meet my Patrons.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T10:05:39-08:00","id":62270,"title":"","content":"Amelia smiles while listening to the answer of the primordial &quot;Thank you for the answer you have given me,we are however on an important journey that must be accomplished into the spiral and our presence must remain a secret my wish is that you and all of you're court keep that secret&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T10:16:45-08:00","id":62279,"title":"","content":"Palanmas laughs, &quot;See Authochthon? We were going to do that anyways, but I suppose we could do that next. And don't worry, your secret is safe with us. I do enjoy this game!&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;I solemnly swear this as well,&quot; intones the four Fae, their faces set as though stone.<br /> <br /> Through their suits, the Circle hears,&quot; Lords. This is Warrant Officer Hoshi. We've managed to right Zekka. We're ready to begin travel anew. How do you fare? Do you require reinforcements?&quot;<br /> <br /> What will you do next?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T10:17:50-08:00","id":62282,"title":"","content":"Harmonious Voice Virtuoso sees the others heading out to meet these new people and quails. <i>&quot;Oh excellent...&quot;</i> he sighs thinking on how awful it looks to be the diplomat late for the expedition's first contact with an unknown civilization. He quickly makes his way back out of the bridge with only a hirried salute and a bemused smile on his face. He catches up with them as Jin does an excellent job as envoy to the Realm. Voice quickly introduces himself along with the others, begging a thousand pardons for his tardiness.<br /> <br /> When they travel with the well-dressed Daeva and hop onto his book, the eclipse is filled once again with wonder. Who would have thought such beauty could just be floating out here. When they meet the Fae and the child-Primordial he once again introduces himself, using the title of 'Deliberator Virtuoso'. He can't help but agree with the faeries disdain of his fellows' combat attire. If only he hadn't spent so much time choosing a belt...His attention is drawn to the game, and grows cautious when they are offered a wish. He studies the Primordial girl, looking for any sign that her girlish exterior is but a facade. His trained eyes pick up on the subtle reactions of the fae nobles, looking for signs of deceit.<br /> <br /> ((I'd like to activate Sagacious Reading of Intent when we are offered a wish. 3m from personal. I want to make sure this is just a prize for beating her champion.))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T10:20:02-08:00","id":62284,"title":"","content":"You read Palanmas as a being of overbearing Love. She has no ulterior motive apart from desiring to reward you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T10:30:34-08:00","id":62294,"title":"","content":"Satisfied that this isn't some Fae trick, Voice considers a moment. he looks about him at the beautiful rainbow hues of this world and knows what he desires. &quot;I know I didn't play at Old Maid, besting your champion. Though I did a thorough job watching it. I would beg of you still to grant me one thing. Your world inspires awe with its splendor, such that I only strive for in my most fantastical imaginations. The weavers that we have brought with us are used to such dull fabrics and hues. Fit for military wear, not for those with a soul for such beauty. I ask only for a small token. Something to remind me of your grace. I would wear it with pride, having been hosted by the Rainbow of Passions Wrought.&quot; He finishes with a smile and a deep bow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T10:54:11-08:00","id":62305,"title":"","content":"''That won't be necessary Mr Hoshi everything is fine we will back to the ship in a few moments, if you would excuse us it is time for us to go&quot; Amelia gives a slight bow to Panlanmas<br /> &quot;Alright gentlemen it is time to leave we have a long road ahead of us&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T10:58:06-08:00","id":62316,"title":"","content":"Palanmas smiles, &quot; A token of your time here.&quot; She then snaps her fingers once more, and another rainbow appears. Out of this steps an old woman wearing a large spinning wheel on her back.<br /> <br /> &quot;Gerexese, Weaver of Connections, arrives,&quot; the crone said, as Palanmas explained Virtuoso's desire. She chuckled, and set about to work. In a flash, she produced a large coat, seemingly made of the rainbows that sprouted out of the Titan's body.<br /> <br /> &quot;This is a Agape Cloak, boy,&quot; the Daeva-Crone croaked, handing it to Virtuoso, &quot;Don it and the entire world will love you.&quot;<br /> <br /> (C'mon, everybody! <a href=\"http://youtu.be/ai2_UN7x4-Y?t=3m19s\" target=\"_blank\">Be astounded at the Rainbow Coat!</a>)<br /> <br /> <b>Agape Cloak</b>:<br /> Formed of woven Beriberii wool and graced with Geraxese's charms, this coat is a sign of Imperium within Palanmas' World-body. It is a reinforced buff jacket, but with the added ability to exert an unnatural mental influence on those within eyeshot of the wearer as an emotional compulsion effect. Spend a willpower and roll (Charisma+Performance, with Essence in automatic successes) for this effect. It costs 6 motes to attune to.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, Hoshi acknowledges Amelia's report, saying, &quot;Roger. We'll be ready to get afloat when you return.&quot;<br /> <br /> What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-31-2014, 02:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T11:11:31-08:00","id":62330,"title":"","content":"Jin bows to the Primordial, &quot;I thank you for your hospitality, Lady Palanmas. We are, however, on a time critical mission. Perhaps. we can play again some time in the future?&quot;<br /> <br /> With that Jin will turn to leave, heading back towards Zekka.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T11:39:28-08:00","id":62343,"title":"","content":"Virtuoso is amazed. &quot;Astounding, Lady Geraxese. Truly a gift fit for our newly found freindship.&quot; He dons the cloak, which fits like a dream. &quot;I will wear it with great pride. All the Realm will know of the Virtuoso and his Rainbow Cloak. Thry will gaze upon its beauty snd call me blessed for such a generous gift.&quot; He gives another bow of respect and joins the others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T12:30:58-08:00","id":62377,"title":"","content":"Palanmas and her souls all bow as well, as Jellivens motions you outside, and back to his book.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am ever so glad that went well, Lady Palanmas is not in the habit of receiving visitors,&quot; Jellivens says, &quot;But do drop again soon. She might seem flighty, but Lady Palanmas did enjoy your company.&quot;<br /> <br /> As you leave the book, Jellivens tips his top hat to you, and flies off. As you all board Zekka, Pellias sees a figure walk by onto the ship for a half-moment. Looking again, there is nothing. A mirage?<br /> <br /> As you all enter the bridge, Zekka chortles, &quot;Man, what a waste of time. Well, time to get this thing going, kyahahahahaha!&quot; <br /> <br /> With that, you fly off, leaving Palanmas, and reentering the Spiral. There, Hoshi announces a message from <i>Mercury's Delight</i>. A downy-haired woman wearing a snakeskin shawl over her Realm military uniform appears oncscreen.<br /> <br /> &quot;Captain Kleiner here. Zekka, we're glad that you came out. We thought that you had been lost within that thing. Are you still able to pursue the mission?&quot; she says.<br /> <br /> When brought abreast of the situation, Kleiner nods, &quot;Very well, then. My charts have four potential avenues we can travel along.&quot;<br /> <br /> Bringing up the charts on the screen, Kleiner outlines a short route to a planet to your northwest. There is another route underneath the Western Arm, into a sparsely populated area much closer to the center of the Spiral. There is also a string of planets on the opposite side with two prospective planets outline. One is a known jungle world, while the other is a plains world.<br /> <br /> So, where will you go?<br /> -Planet right in front of you?<br /> -Planet close to the Spiral's core, but sparsely populated?<br /> -Plains Planet?<br /> -Jungle Planet?<br /> <br /> Also, congratulations, everyone! Our game has (Officially) started now!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T13:07:17-08:00","id":62417,"title":"","content":"It was good to be back on the ship, Amelia listen to Captain Kleiner talk about the different options. All seems dangerous but profitable, a hard choice to make. &quot;I would cast my vote on the planet in front of us, it could give us a idea of what to expect on the other planets without entering too deep into the spiral, caution would be best for now&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T13:48:24-08:00","id":62443,"title":"","content":"Virtuoso checks over his cloak a few more times, hoping its appearance doesn't lose its luster once aboard the ship again. When he is satisfied at its condition, he turns his attention back to his fellow officers. Nodding in approval, he says &quot;I cannot agree more, Amelia.&quot; He smiles and adds &quot;Besides, Seatongue was the first language from the Spiral I mastered.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T14:10:27-08:00","id":62455,"title":"","content":"Very well, then.<br /> <br /> Using their Saffron Transit Nodes, both Zekka and the<i> Mercury's Delight</i> rapidly fly off into the Spiral. In the distance, to the far east, you can see the twin glows of Ruvelia the Crystal Moon and Ligier the Green Sun. On top of this, you see six new stars surrounding the Spiral in the vault above.<br /> <br /> As you approach the designated planet, Hoshi says, &quot;Scanning the planet now. No magitech signatures on the planet. It looks to be devoid of technology.&quot;<br /> <br /> What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-31-2014, 06:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T14:48:46-08:00","id":62477,"title":"","content":"&quot; I believe that it is Mr Pellias job to scout new planet is it not ?&quot; Amelia steps toward the view screen &quot;Mr Hoshi are there useful resources on this planet or signs of intelligent life ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T15:55:50-08:00","id":62529,"title":"","content":"Hoshi glances over his terminal, and responds,&quot;Standard levels of iron, and other base metals. Life readings are off the charts. In fact--&quot; and with that, the entire terminal sputtered and winked out.<br /> <br /> &quot;The last reading the sensor managed to make was one hundred MegaAnimas,&quot; Hoshi said, turning to the Circle.<br /> <br /> &quot;But that would mean....&quot; Lydia began.<br /> <br /> &quot;There's over one hundred million essence-using beings on that planet. Interesting. It seems something or someone has been awaiting us,&quot; Zekka says.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic Motonic Theory by the Magnus</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">It can be said that Essence is the source of being for all life forms. Even ones that cannot normally respirate or use it rely on it for maintenance of their forms and the gods that oversee them. That humans can create prayer, that transmittable form of Essence, is proof of this. This process, brought into mathematics terms, uses the Anima unit, a unit which denotes how much essence an awakened human can respire in one hour.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 01-31-2014, 07:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T16:41:36-08:00","id":62562,"title":"","content":"First the infant primordial and now a hundred million essence users &quot;My head hurts...&quot; said Amelia as she closed her eyes and massaged the side of her head with her fingers. &quot;Mr Hoshi would you please inform the crew to assume that trouble might be coming... again, also have dropships and voidfighters ready, we are gonna need to know what's on that planet&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T17:07:37-08:00","id":62579,"title":"","content":"Jin idly cracks his knuckles, pondering what could be down there. &quot;Yes, we should land,&quot; he says softly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T17:28:18-08:00","id":62597,"title":"","content":"Hoshi nods to Amelia, and begins to bark orders to the crew about a landing. As the drop ships and voidstars are prepped, the Circle loads up on several of the ships as well, along with the DelArm Divisions.<br /> <br /> As the ships land, they find the world to be cloaked in night, with nary a living thing to confirm the massive life readings from before.<br /> <br /> However, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F4efZIHtiQQ\" target=\"_blank\"> as if on cue, dawn arrives</a>.<br /> <br /> With it, you can see the local landscape to be a massive plain, entirely flat. Flat, of course, save for the gigantic stone monoliths scattered here and there. and around them, are the beasts. They look like ordinary creatures, as one would see in any of the Lunar menageries in the Gunstar, but not quite. They chatter to one another, assuming formations, and many are wearing clothing and armor. They quickly busy themselves with inspecting, cleaning, and further on, you can see them erecting further monoliths. As time goes on, more and more beasts appear, as if from nothing.<br /> <br /> In the extreme distance, you can see a far larger structure, but whether or not it is artificial cannot be discerned from this distance.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T01:30:51-08:00","id":62786,"title":"","content":"Pellias steps off his transport, the feeling of new land beneath his feet like slipping on a favourite pair of shoes. The exotic landscape and sudden sunrise leading to a foreign set of variables, including the seemingly intelligent beasts, brought excitement.<br /> <br /> An eye whizzed by Pellias invisbly, hidden from sight being dematerialised but giving him a full awareness of its perspective. It had taken no more than a silent whisper to sent it flying off into the horizon towards the large structure in the extreme distance.<br /> <br /> ((<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4387120/\" target=\"_blank\">8 suxx</a> on a perc+awareness roll to look at the distance at the structure, and I've sent an eye out towards it at roughly 30 mph))<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T09:30:46-08:00","id":62941,"title":"","content":"Upon closer inspection, the structure in the distance is indeed artificial. It is a large stepped pyramid. Movement upon it suggests that the beasts are even there as well. The eye reaches it in about two hours, and you can note that the entire structure is decorated with Realm letters. They constantly repeat &quot;Abaskeru, Abaskeru, Abaskeru, Beast King, Lord of the Wild&quot; over and over again.<br /> <br /> Another, and more chilling discovery of note, is that your eye detected a figure, not unlike the one you saw before, perched on the top of a dropship. However, after a moment, like before, it vanishes.<br /> <br /> What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T09:40:18-08:00","id":62949,"title":"","content":"&quot;Mr Pellias how do you suggest we proceed ? Scouting planets is you're area of expertise&quot; Says Amelia as she prepares her weapons and armor for a possible confrontation (Dietaku is it okay if have a couple of pyromantic grenades ? Scroll of fallen races p.24)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T11:03:50-08:00","id":63005,"title":"","content":"That's fine, Magnusar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T15:48:11-08:00","id":63160,"title":"","content":"&quot;The first step is usually to ascertain if there's any immediate threat and set up a small camp, nothing that can't be taken down in 30 minutes or so.&quot; Pellias turned to the horizon and the increasingly exposed pyramid to his mind's eyes. &quot;Given that we've been on the ground for some time now, I would suggest that preparation for a short stay is in order.&quot; He concentrated for a moment, letting what the eye was surveying digest in his mind. &quot;The locals do appear to have intelligence...and leadership. This may quickly become a more diplomatic mission than any extended scouting endeavour.&quot;<br /> <br /> He thought about holding his tongue regarding the shimmering figure, knowing full well from his own strategies that any change in observable patterns could cause the spy to abandon their mission. However, he also knew very well that this could cost the life of a valued target. It was interesting to be on the other end of this game for a change.<br /> <br /> &quot;We're also not alone. I've seen what appears to be an invisible or partly-visible target twice now on our equipment. Keep sharp.&quot; Pellias quickly flickers out of sight himself a moment later, the helmet of his suit snapping out his face last of all.<br /> <br /> (Going to try to track the individual who was on top of the dropship. Any particular roll wanted, or shall I use Survival?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T19:31:45-08:00","id":63242,"title":"","content":"As Pellias vanishes from sight Amelia barks orders to the soldiers to set up camp and activates her essence sight in her visor (3m for the scene) to watch for potential treats also using her armor's communication gear to contact Hoshi on the ship &quot;Mr Hoshi are the sensors back online ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T17:06:47-08:00","id":63653,"title":"","content":"(Ah, sorry about disappearing. My job had me doing both a closing and opening in quick succession. )<br /> <br /> (Roll Wits+Survival to track as a hunter would. Wits+Occult may be good, too, Jotun.)<br /> <br /> &quot;Hoshi here. We've recalibrated the sensors. We're only scanning for Celestial essence now, as we determined it was the Wood essence in the area that overloaded the scanner. Hold it, something else is approaching the planet--&quot; Hoshi says, before being drowned in static.<br /> <br /> Above you, you can see a meteor shower, as the beasts all begin to chatter excitedly. Finally, a light flashes on the horizon, as a voice blares throughout the world.<br /> <br /> &quot;MMMMPH, WHO IS IT THAT WAKES?&quot; the voice asks, as the beasts all respond as one in a resounding cry of their own.<br /> <br /> &quot;YOU, ABASKERU, KING OF BEASTS, LORD OF THE WILD!&quot; they reply in unison. <br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T17:51:22-08:00","id":63668,"title":"","content":"(No worry Dietaku, I'm more worried about the others not joining us, I'm going to assume that the beasts all speak old realm as it is the only language Amelia can understand)<br /> <br /> As contact with Hoshi is lost. Amelia thinks for a few seconds before taking a decision she turns to a Dragon-Blooded &quot;Make sure that the camp is well defended but nothing that can't be abandoned quickly just in case, I will go make first contact but the troops stays here&quot; (If the other player wish to go with her just say so in you're post). Amelia seals her armor and takes an All-Sensing Machine Sages with her as she begin to walk toward the first group of beast she can encounter in the plain. she walk toward them but tries to makes no movement that could perceived as aggressive. Lets see how they react first she though and find more about this Abaskeru maybe its a god she though or a deva.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 02-02-2014, 09:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T18:42:50-08:00","id":63683,"title":"","content":"Pellias moves about invisibly, trying to get a mark on the other (and presumably also invisible) presence. Even as the meteor shower and loud shouting begin, Pellias focuses on the clues left behind; the small dusts scuffs, the pressure points and the subtle prints were all he was caring about for the moment. It's only when he notes Amelia starting off towards the beast-tribes that Pellias takes a small amount of notice outside of his task.<br /> <br /> (<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4389987/\" target=\"_blank\">2 successes</a> on wits + survival (with +1 specialty for tracking))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T19:39:59-08:00","id":63694,"title":"","content":"Alrighty, then...<br /> <br /> Despite whatever Pellias expected, his target revealing itself is nothing like it. Reality seems to peel back, as though a curtain, revealing a maddening world of neither form, function or identity. Out of this mad realm slinks a shapely woman in a gold and green leather uniform, an emblem of seven wings and seven eyes on her chest. She spies Pellias and yelps.<br /> <br /> &quot;Footsteps on Glass Practice didn't hide me? Can you gaze on the Shinmas as well?&quot; the woman asked, surprised as much as frightened at Pellias' attention.<br /> <br /> As for Amelia, she approaches a trio of beasts tidying a monolith. Appraised of her presence, they all genuflect on the ground, saying as one, &quot;HAIL TO YOU, CHILD OF THE TYRANT SUN!&quot;<br /> <br /> What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T20:16:21-08:00","id":63713,"title":"","content":"Quickdrawing, Pellias holds one of his blasters out to his side and ready for a fight, a shimmer in the air all that revealed him to the normal world. He was certainly surprised by this turn of events; he hadn't expected an equally surprised and exotic target to reveal itself so spectacularly. &quot;You!&quot; he said with some force behind it. &quot;How can you see me?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T20:18:08-08:00","id":63715,"title":"","content":"Oh crap... that doesn't sound good Amelia thought but leaving would cause suspicion and they needed to know who those beast where. &quot;Greetings you seem to have me at disadvantage for you know what I am but I don't know what you are my friends coud you present yourselves ?&quot; signaling them to rise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T20:30:06-08:00","id":63722,"title":"","content":"The woman blinks and says, &quot; I can see anything I wish. My patron has given me many things. Most principal amonsgt them is <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=btjbqisVQSU\" target=\"_blank\"> sight beyond sight!</a> I suppose introductions are in order. Enien Salzbourg is my name, Chosen of the Sevenfold Stigmatized Peacock of Majesty, That Who is Not, Sailor on the Seas of Fate, and a thousand titles more,&quot; she says, holding out her hand.<br /> <br /> &quot;We are slaves, Lady Sun. Slaves of He Who is King, herald of the Immeasurable Perched on Highest Slope. We build these monoliths by his name, for it was He, who exalted us to sapience. Without he, we would be dumb, foolish serfs of masters too good for such servants,&quot; one beast explained, as the others nodded.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T20:40:27-08:00","id":63731,"title":"","content":"Jin ponders Enien Salzbourg's words. His eyes widen in shock as he remembers his Sifu's lectures on the Titans. &quot;You're an Infernal!&quot; He hisses, &quot;One of the servants of Oramus, Dragon beyond the World!&quot;<br /> <br /> Jin drops into the <i>Fated Fist: Hermit Slaughters the Dragon</i> Stance, his hands splayed into the Least Signs of Jupiter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T22:33:48-08:00","id":63776,"title":"","content":"&quot;I never said anything to deny that,&quot; Enien says, assuming a knife hand stance against Jin's maneuver.<br /> <br /> Noodle, roll (Int+Martial Arts.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T22:49:38-08:00","id":63783,"title":"","content":"Jin gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4390172\" target=\"_blank\">5 successes</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T07:07:18-08:00","id":63952,"title":"","content":"((Let's assume I went with the scout for first contact with the beasts))<br /> <br /> Virtuoso had left his shimmering new cloak behind on the ship, favoring instead a green cloak to fit the landscape better. He wore his brilliant breastplate underneath and his blaster on his hip, just in case. When Amelia goes to meet the beasts, the diplomat is quick to volunteer. He steps out with her when they are greeted with such respect. Hearing that the beasts know of the Tyrant Sun, Virtuoso assumes a more commanding stance. &quot;Then hear us now, slave! Your King and his Herald. Are they loyal to the Sun? Do your masters bow to the Titans?&quot; He booms, demanding an answer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T11:57:43-08:00","id":64180,"title":"","content":"&quot;No, no, no, no! You misunderstand, Lord Sun. Our King is the Herald of a Greater Master, even greater than the Sun. That Master, dare I say it, is Mardukth, He who Holds in Thra--&quot; the beast manages as a he is struck down by an impossibly fast projectile. When looking further, you see the thing that killed that beast was a large, steel-combed feather, as the other beasts cower and hide. In the distance, a trumpet blares, and another voice erupts from the horizon.<br /> <br /> &quot;Zezoothe, Lord of Birds, approaches. Give adulation to this Prince of the Wild!&quot; the voice commands, as the beasts all line up into columns.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, Enien and Jin are engaged in their stand-off, as Jin recognizes the stance that Enien took. The shift of weight, the footwork and posture. There is doubt about it; it is exactly as your Sifu, Peerless Ocelot, proscirbed during his tutelage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T12:10:50-08:00","id":64192,"title":"","content":"&quot;Mr Virtuoso I suggest that you stand behind me this is past the point of civilized diplomacy&quot; Amelia takes a step to put herself between Virtuoso and any further projectile that could come their way as she shout &quot;Show yourself and I may give you some semblance of the attention you deserve&quot; she half unsheathe her autoklaive just to be ready to parry and her other hand is ready to draw her shellcaster.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T12:32:56-08:00","id":64214,"title":"","content":"&quot;WHO IS IT THAT WELCOMES THE LORD OF BIRDS?&quot; the original voice asks, and the beasts all respond in kind once more.<br /> <br /> &quot;YOU, LORD ABASKERU, LORD OF THE WILD, KING OF BEASTS,&quot; they call, as the voice chuckles.<br /> <br /> &quot;It seems we are welcomed, my children of the earth, by a pilgrimage from beyond the Stars. Zezoothe has seen their chariot in orbit above us, and their processional has touched upon our Holy Planet. Know this, Children of the Tyrant Sun. This is the planet of the Beast King...&quot;<br /> <br /> Then, a great rumbling occurs, and the light on the horizon reappears. For a moment, nothing seems to happen, until you see a growing shape appear. It grows ever larger, and you come to realize that it is a large stone palanquin carried by a myriad of beasts. Upon it is a man seated on a stone throne. Dressed in skins and leathers, the hide of a great lion upon his back, his body is riddled with scars. Beside him is a regal looking figure; bedecked from head to toe in golden-brown feathers, and wearing golden jewelry, this bird-man looks on in imperial disinterest. As they pass Jin and Enien's stand-off, the seated man laughs, and the palanquin passes on, resting when they reach Amelia and Virtuoso.<br /> <br /> &quot;How will you pay respects to Abaskeru, King of Beasts,&quot; the man demands in his booming voice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 02-03-2014, 04:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T13:22:41-08:00","id":64265,"title":"","content":"&quot;So, you're a fellow student of Peerless Ocelot,&quot; Jin says to Enien, &quot;Care to assist me in kicking this pretentious prick's teeth in? Its what Sifu would want.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T13:37:15-08:00","id":64276,"title":"","content":"&quot;I will acknowledge you're title of king of this world and give you the respect you deserve but no more. I am a child of the stars, kings of planet and earthly kingdoms seldom are my concern but you have come to greet us upon you're world and in return I salute you KING OF BEASTS !!!&quot; Amelia bow her head slightly while finishing her sentence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T20:58:27-08:00","id":64559,"title":"","content":"&quot;Heh. Very well. I am not affiliated directly with him, and I doubt my master will care much in either case,&quot; Enien says, &quot;My services are yours.&quot;<br /> <br /> The Beast King laughs at Amelia's salute, and says, &quot; Look, everyone, even the Solar Child is oblescing to us. Are we not great? You say that earthly kingdoms are beneath you, and yet you come to my domain. Why is that?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T22:29:28-08:00","id":64610,"title":"","content":"Jin relaxes from his stance, saying &quot;Alright then. No time like the present, eh?&quot;<br /> <br /> He looks over towards Abaskeru, and makes the Sign of the Treasure Trove. His fingers then begin to blur, rapidly crafting a net of Fate. Once finished, he casts the net at Abaskeru, and begins marching towards the Infernal with purpose.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Jin spends 10m to activate &quot;Of Horrors Best Unknown&quot;, getting <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4391149\" target=\"_blank\">7 successes</a> against a difficulty of Abaskeru's Essence. Success renders him Within Fate and grants Jin a -1 TN modifier against him in the selected circumstance of &quot;In a Melee&quot;</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T06:08:28-08:00","id":64786,"title":"","content":"Virtuoso steps forward, &quot;We are explorers, great king. Seeking new wonders and civilizations. We came here when our ship detected so many weilders of essence on your world. I must say we were surprised to find the source.&quot; He makes a sweeping gesture as he finishes, &quot;It is a wonder indeed, to have awakened so many.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T08:44:30-08:00","id":64870,"title":"","content":"As Jin begins to craft his cunning plan, Abaskeru frowns and shouts to no one in particular, &quot; Who am I?&quot;<br /> <br /> In reponse, the beasts, and the trees, the grass and even the earth itself respond in kind, these servants all glowing slightly.<br /> <br /> &quot;BEAST KING ABASKERU, LORD OF THE WILD, HERALD OF THE BEAST UPON THE MOUNTAIN, KING OF KINGS,&quot; they respond, as the trap is shattered upon the Beast King's massive ego.<br /> <br /> &quot;Indeed,&quot; Abaskeru says, &quot; I have spent many centuries awakening and molding the beasts of this world to my like, in hopes that one day, my Master would seek me to go on the hunt with him for the ultimate quarry, Imagine my surprise when several of them appear on my planet. Very interesting, indeed. And even a Herald of the Dragon Beyond. Very interesting....&quot; The king smiles, hefting a monstrous bladed club out from behind his throne.<br /> <br /> &quot;I will give you two options; Submit and join my army of beasts or become my prey. What do you choose?&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 02-04-2014, 06:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T09:08:09-08:00","id":64891,"title":"","content":"Feeling his charm fail, Jin activates Horrific Wreath and the Essence Flight power of his Celestial Battle Armor. He leaps at Abaskeru, streaking towards the Infernal like an Emerald comet. With his hands held like claws and wreathed in baleful Sidereal essence, Jin focuses on a single point on the Infernal's body: His throat. Snarling, Jin slashes at his throat, intending to silence him for good. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Jin makes a 'Punch' attack at Abaskeru, making a called shot to impose a &quot;Unable to Speak&quot; Crippling Effect. He gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4391601\" target=\"_blank\">14 Successes</a> + stunt dice, less however much of a called shot penalty that is. Base damage is 13B, converted to Lethal by Horrific Wreath. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T15:18:47-08:00","id":65177,"title":"","content":"Abaskeru is shocked at the sudden attack of the Sidereal, reeling back as his throat is crippled. He chokes and finally, falls back, landing on the supplicants below, as Zezoothe laughs.<br /> <br /> However, the victory is short-lived, as a green surge of light explodes upwards from Abaskeru's position and a cacophony of hots, howls and snarls rings out. The Beast King rises, although not as he was before. His supplicants driving his palanquin are gone, as his body is now a writhing mass of fur, fangs, claws and eyes, albeit in a humanoid shape.<br /> <br /> A wolf's head erupts out of the mass, and calls, &quot; King Abaskeru says, &quot;Now, I'm going to suck the marrow from your bones, you wretches!&quot; Um, um...Yes. He also says, &quot; He's going to--&quot; Wait, no, I'm not saying that.&quot; before being drawn back into the mass' body.<br /> <br /> What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T19:50:57-08:00","id":65325,"title":"","content":"Hovering some distance from Abaskeru, Jin activates Of Horrors Best Unknown on him again, getting <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4392247\" target=\"_blank\">]6 successes</a> (with the same effect and conditions as above).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T07:03:00-08:00","id":65657,"title":"","content":"&quot;And here I thought things were going so well...&quot; Virtuouso quips to no one in particular. He will nod to Amelia as he steps behind her and pulls out his blaster. He will try to make his way back to camp to help cover a possible retreat. If any of the ships are departing, the Eclipse will join them. He will be more use to the team in the cockpit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T09:04:30-08:00","id":65733,"title":"","content":"As Virtuoso is making his retreat to the dropships, who are ferrying materials and personnel back and forth, he spies several fast shapes in the air.<br /> <br /> &quot;Those aren't ours,&quot; a Dragonblood soldier says, as a mortal technician is grabbed up and ripped in half. His assailant is a horrifying mix of canadian geese and muscled human. A nearby All-sensing Maching Sage declares it to be a &quot;Cervoce, the Singing Void Flier.&quot; Sure enough, after executing the kill, the creature let out a fluting croon and flew off to join its fellows in the air.<br /> <br /> As Virtuoso boards the next dropship he sees more of the Cervoce flying in formation towards Zekka. While in the air, more and more of the Daevas join the formation, until they enter the Void, where he can see a good hundred or so beings flying in a large v. However, when they get close to Zekka, clouds of flak break the formation, and the goose-monsters scatter. When Virtuoso boards, he's met by several flight officers.<br /> <br /> &quot;Sir, we've managed to shake them off a few times. They just shot in right on top of us, and hit our Comms Dish pretty hard. We've managed to get it back up, but they're slippery little buggers. So far,<i> Mercury's Delight</i>'s been covering for us, but Captain Kleiner and her boys are running out of essence. What do you recommend?&quot;<br /> <br /> (Meanwhile on the ground)<br /> <br /> The DelArm has converged on where the Circle is, laying down heavy fire on Abaskeru, but whatever damage they inflict is lost in the hail of bodies that the giant stuffs into itself from the many beasts running around it.<br /> <br /> &quot;You weaklings are too soft. Come and fight me, in the Old Ways. Your Ancients would have done so. I've seen it in the records at the Viridian Palace,&quot; a beast head calls out of the giant.<br /> <br /> &quot;Lords, It's too much. No matter how much firepower we've thrown at it, it won't die, or even budge fret much,&quot; a Siege soldier says, as Airi runs over.<br /> <br /> &quot;We do have these,&quot; She says, pulling out a long tube with a red jade firing cap on one end. Anti-Fortress charges. If we can toss them, it may take out his beasts faster than he can absorb them. I only have five on me, though, so that's what we have at present.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 02-05-2014, 02:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T11:19:27-08:00","id":65824,"title":"","content":"Amelia looks at the soldier and the charges, ''Give me those&quot; Grabbing the charges as she activate her essence wings and Panoptic fusion discipline before flying strait toward Abaskeru accelerating and taking as much speed as possible before dropping the charges at his body letting gravity and speed guiding them to him, before turning to the side to have a clear shot at the charges. Her sense becoming so sharp that the flow of time seem to slow down as she draw her shellcaster and take aim at the charges (She activates First achery excellency and essence arrow attack to add damage to make sure that charges blow up) (Attack dice: 5 dex +4 Archery +1 Specialty +3 weapons + 3 from panoptic that counts as aiming and +9 more from first excellency) as a Great Dragon of solar essence surges from her body blood red smoke coming out of its mouth and snout its purple eyes glaring brightly at its enemies. (<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4392814/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4392814/</a> 10 success) (I hope they blow up...)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 02-05-2014, 06:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T22:55:53-08:00","id":66274,"title":"","content":"&quot;Can he even move like that?&quot; Pellias' electric voice sounded over the comm-channel. &quot;I question our prideful friend's ability to maenuver quickly. More to the point, the pyramid is littered with his name. I reckon we can force him into revealing himself if we hurt his pride rather than shoot into the mound of bodies.&quot; He waited for a moment to clear, watching Amelia sail off with the charges towards the giant before speaking out over the channel again. &quot;Anyone up there able to take a quick shot at the pyramid?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-06T08:29:58-08:00","id":66503,"title":"","content":"(Let me tell you about the Mark 4 Anti-Fortress Explosive Charge. The construction of the weapon is a steel cylinder, holding a red jade firing cap and a red jade rod connecting to a web of consecrated silk, holding one oil elemental and one lightning elemental separated. Once the charge is primed, hitting the charge on the firing cap causes the essence of the two elementals to suffuse the red jade, burning away the silk constraining them, and forcing them to meet. This union between two such unstable elements annihilates the two elementals and produces a catastrophic destructive cylinder, perfect for destroying large walls.)<br /> <br /> Amelia's attack hurled the bombs at the giant, exploding into a gigantic mushroom cloud, pushing Amelia back towards the DelArm's position.The giant seems to grow smaller, as the charred corpses slough off like dead skin off a snake. At Pellias' request, Airi brings a pair of large essence cannons.<br /> <br /> &quot;We're going to need to get closer to do that. The weapons are way out of their effective range, Sir,&quot; she says.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-06T11:50:12-08:00","id":66626,"title":"","content":"Virtuoso is taken by surprise when the soldier asks him for orders. He is no military commander. Not wanting to waste time to ask someone more qualified, he makes the desicion himself. &quot;Get me on comms with whichever voidfighter squad can get in the air the fastest and ready my personal ship. We'll be taking the fight to them!&quot; He will head to the flight deck to get into his flight suit and find a commlink to speak with the voidfighter squad's commander.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-06T21:55:39-08:00","id":66985,"title":"","content":"The soldier nods, and Virtuoso runs to the hangar.<br /> <br /> As Virtuoso is launched, He finds himself in a world of chaos, beams of essence lancing here and there,as debris from Zekka scattered here and there, along with the corpses of dead Daevas surrounds the battleship.<br /> <br /> &quot;All wings report in,&quot; a stern voice calls over the voxcaster relay.<br /> <br /> &quot;Wood Seven, standing by.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Wood Five, standing by.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Wood Three, standing by.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Wood Two, standing by.&quot;<br /> <br /> Wood Six, standing by!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Wood Four, standing by.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Wood Leader, standing by. Alright, boys, We gotta show the Lawgiver a taste of our mettle! Let's show him how we do things in Wood Squad!&quot; Cathak Toven calls.<br /> <br /> Ahead of you, you see a veritable wall of winged creatures, much as you saw before.<br /> <br /> Roll for initiative.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 02-07-2014, 11:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-07T00:42:28-08:00","id":67031,"title":"","content":"Pellias waves off Airi's comment about range and shoulders the large essence cannon. &quot;Let's see if this does anything&quot; he said as he looked through the aiming device and took in a breath. He could see the pyramid off in the distance and through the eye that had voyaged out towards it, letting him simultaneously note the general area of where he would be shooting at from this distance. &quot;Hope you don't mind me defacing your precious name a bit, mate&quot;<br /> <br /> (Using &quot;There is no Wind&quot; at the 5m version to shoot to visibility range. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4394838/\" target=\"_blank\">5 successes</a> on a flat Archery+dex roll with speciality)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-07T06:16:06-08:00","id":67141,"title":"","content":"The eclipse caste checks over his instruments and readings one last time. He lets out a deep breath thinking, <i>You can do this...</i> With a lurch that makes his gut sink but spirit soar, the launch tube fires him into space along with Wood Squad. The sudden jump in speed and the opening of his perceptions as he takes to the sky is exhilarating. He forgets himself for a moment as he tests his controls and lets out a whoop and a laugh. A grizzled voidfighter pilot might just mistake such a display of freedom as a war cry from a soldier. Virtuoso settles into formation alongside Wood Leader. &quot;Orichalcum One, standing by.&quot; He calls into the voxcaster. &quot;Thanks for having me, gentlemen. This is your show still, I'm just here to help. Captain, call it.&quot; He takes another deep breath as they approach the enemy line. The distractions fall away as his perceptions sharpen. Time seems to slow as he scans the vultures for a likely target, judging when best to strike.<br /> <br /> (( Join Battle with 8m spent on 2nd excellency: 7 Suxx plus whatever stunt. Activating Panoptic Fusion Discipline. 12m spent of personal. 7m remaining.))<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A0A0A0\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4394983/\" target=\"_blank\">8d10=35</a></span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-07T08:47:11-08:00","id":67219,"title":"","content":"Pellias' shot slices the top of the pyramid clean in half, crashing to the ground. Upon seeing this, Abaskeru's giant form reels, pulling at it's head stump as though trying to maintain its balance. After rocking violently like this, it grows bigger still, until the giant is now the size of a royal warstrider, a wreath of beast heads rising out of its head stump, crying in unison.<br /> <br /> &quot;Am I Abaskeru? Am I Abaskeru? Am I Abaskeru? Am I Abaskeru? Am I Abaskeru?&quot; They call, as the giant, writhing mass charges at Pellias.<br /> <br /> (Alright, alright, you guys got what you wanted; Abaskeru is officially having a mental breakdown. Roll for join battle, Jotun, Magnusar, Noodle.)<br /> <br /> (Meanwhile in space)<br /> <br /> (You get a one die stunt for that, Albz)<br /> <br /> The turn order is Virtuoso, Wood Squad, and then the Daevas. Go ahead, Albz.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-07T10:16:43-08:00","id":67267,"title":"","content":"&quot;Look at that. All lined up for me.&quot; Virtuoso remarks as he charges a Nova-class warhead. His ship flashes across the void, seizing the opportunity. He skirts around a large chunk of debris, lining up his shot. A flash of essence reveals his caste mark as he fires. The warhead streaks across to the wall of creatures and explodes in a fire of golden essence. His aim for the left flank of the enemy is perfect, obliterating all in a 100-yard radius and sending the rest screeching to the right and towards the rest of Wood Squad. He finishes his maneuver with a quick roll behind another chunk of debris to cover his retreat back into formation. &quot;Let them have it!&quot; He calls out over the voxcaster.<br /> <br /> ((Warhead attack, 10m from engine and 5m on 1st archery excellency. 7 Suxx plus stunt / 30A if hit. hits all targets within 100 yards))<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A0A0A0\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4395145/\" target=\"_blank\">15d10=81</a></span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-07T11:14:41-08:00","id":67290,"title":"","content":"Jin gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4395189\" target=\"_blank\">5 successes</a> for his join battle","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-07T11:49:52-08:00","id":67303,"title":"","content":"Amelia as 7 successes (<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4395208/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4395208/</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-07T15:17:10-08:00","id":67440,"title":"","content":"Pellias gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4395436/\" target=\"_blank\">5 successes</a> for JB.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-10T08:17:05-08:00","id":69090,"title":"","content":"(Sorry about disappearing. Long, continuous shifts and all that.)<br /> <br /> Virtuoso's shot flies true, and vaporizes a swathe of the Daevas, while the Wood Squad does the same with essence cannons. The combined firepower of the Voidstars cuts a neat gash in the Daeva's formation. Then comes the counterattack. The Daevas puff up and unleash a volley of shattering screeches, as the Akasa in the area illuminates, propelling the sound towards the fighters. Virtuoso feels just a bump, but other's aren't so lucky.<br /> <br /> &quot;This is Wood Four. I've been--&quot; she calls, and then her fighter crumples and explodes under the weight of the Daeva's esoteric attacks.<br /> <br /> &quot;Janna! DAMMIT! Alright, boys.Let's light them up!&quot; Toven called to his team.<br /> <br /> &quot;This is Hoshi. Wood Squad, there's a high-speed object propelling towards you. Be advised.&quot; the Comms operator said over the voxcasters.<br /> <br /> It is now your turn again, Albz.<br /> <br /> (Meanwhile, down on the planet)<br /> <br /> While you all ready to go into battle, Abaskeru grabs handfuls of more beasts in his fury, and stuffs them into himself, while Enien pirouettes and makes the lesser sign of the...Resplendent Fowl? (Flamingo? Paradise Bird? Peacock? Let's go with Peacock. Realm can be tricky) She then grows feathery down on her body, and another five arms.<br /> <br /> &quot;Majestic Peacock of Sevenfold Glory Shintai,&quot; the Dement mumbles, posing to no one in particular.<br /> <br /> (The turn order is now Amelia, Jin/Pellis, Abaskeru/Enien).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-13T08:00:40-08:00","id":71297,"title":"","content":"Amelia will attack Abaskeru with her autoklave, using the mobility of her armor flight system to give more momentum to her strike (Amelia rolls 18 dice on her attack 15 base +3 from panoptic fusion discipline, scoring <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4403911/\" target=\"_blank\">9 success</a> with a base damage of 12L/2 and she activates hungry tiger technique for 1 mote)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-13T10:09:00-08:00","id":71402,"title":"","content":"Amelia's attack cleaves heavily into Abaskeru's body, but in his rage, he doesn't really notice the damage.<br /> <br /> (Also, you get a one die stunt for that)<br /> <br /> (Noodle and Jotun's turns now)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-13T13:09:05-08:00","id":71549,"title":"","content":"Pellias smiles a wicked grin (if anyone could see it beneath his facemask) and chuckles as the giant amalgam raged towards him. Flexing in his suit and feeling it respond to his influx, he turned to Airi quickly and waved him away again &quot;I'd get out of his way.&quot;<br /> <br /> His figure shimmered into complete nothingness as he dashed at a superhuman speed and out of sight. If the giant truly wanted hi head, it was time for a good game of hide and seek.<br /> <br /> (Popping 5m into my stealth suit for cloaking and dashing out of line of sight. Note: dash at 2x speed for 22yards per tick)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T10:32:44-08:00","id":72060,"title":"","content":"Jin streaks back down towards Abaskeru, his anima flaring brightly. He lands forcefully several yards from the Infernal, springing from the impact to deliver a double-palm strike. The streaks of light that make up his anima coalesce for a moment into Old Realm script as he shouts, &quot;<i>Heavenly Seer: Soul Breaker Fist!&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Jin makes a Punch attack on Abaskeru, getting <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4405478\" target=\"_blank\">10 sux</a>. Damage is +13L</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T23:06:45-08:00","id":72486,"title":"","content":"(That's a 3 die stunt, Noodle. Also, because of a house rule I tend to play by, everyone gets the exp.)<br /> <br /> Abaskeru is hammered by the blow, and flails wildly at Jin, landing a massive hit of 10 successes, as his amalgamated body lunges at you, forming a giant wall that seems to block your vision in all directions. (This attack makes Dodge DV inapplicable. How will you respond?)<br /> <br /> Enien's feathery body seems to shift this way and that, not wholly in one area or the next, Her seven hands splay and clasp, forming strange mudras, until a glowing screen envelopes the Circle, and you feel immense relief, as though everything will be alright.<br /> <br /> (Everyone now has a +4 bonus to all soaks, and 4 auto successes to any action in this scene. These, being an effect of Enien's Shintai, count as dice from charms)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-15T06:51:46-08:00","id":72597,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hoshi, this is Orichalcum One. I copy you. Let me get a closer look.&quot; Virtuoso is going to weave his way through the debris as long as possible, trying to hide is movements from the Daevas and providing cover in case they follow him. He wants to engage the object with enough time to warn the others if it's dangerous. He figures the Wood Squad can handle the Daevas for a few more exchanges.<br /> <br /> (( OOC: If I need a dash action to get there in one action, I'll do that. I also have a charm to double his speed if needed.))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1570-albzthedude","name":"AlbztheDude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-15T21:30:21-08:00","id":72995,"title":"","content":"THe object is actually moving in your general direction, Albz, so no dash is needed. It turns out to be Zezoothe, the Daeva that was wtih Abaskeru before. He's streaking towards the dogfight. What will you do, then?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T07:00:21-08:00","id":73162,"title":"","content":"Oh, and since I forgot to mention this earlier, It will be Pellias' turn, then Amelia's on the ground.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T11:01:49-08:00","id":73269,"title":"","content":"With the wall of flesh closing in around him, Jin closes his eyes, focusing his essence. He snarls &quot;<i>Fated Fist: Shield of Thousandfold Directions!&quot;,</i> before waving his hands up on both sides and sending out a shock-wave of baleful crimson energy to counter. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Jin activates Crimson Palm Counterstrike. After converting four dice to successes from Enien's shintai effect, Jin gets 8 successes (Invisible castle seems to be down at the moment). That should reduce the attack below my PDV (negating it), and apply the 8 successes in a counterattack (with +13L base damage)</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T13:21:53-08:00","id":73333,"title":"","content":"A cloud of dust plumes around the monolith from the movement of the giant but fails to register to Pellias, his visor easily scanning through it. He was where he wanted to be, stillness in the dust looking through the end of his weapon. Exhaling, he looked through the little spirits in his focus lens and into the mass of beast heads freakishly wreathing the lack of discernable head that the giant had.<br /> <br /> The shot barely made a sound as it went off and whizzed through the dust cloud.<br /> <br /> ((Yeah, inivisble castle not working. 2014-02-16 14:19:11 Pellias rolls 15 dice to Archery+Dex+Specialty+Acc 5,2,1,3,8, 9,8,4,8,5, 4,2,7,3,1 (5 successes) from <a href=\"http://umbralechoes.com/ExaltedRoller.php\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> . Added to the auto 4 successes, thats 9 at 11L/3))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T18:03:00-08:00","id":73479,"title":"","content":"Abaskeru's giant form sneers, as best as his crown of howling heads can sneer, as the counterattack slices off yet more of the writihing bodies. Pellias' shot, however, smashes the giants head open, and reveals Abaskeru in all his bloody, angry glory. He screams a wordless scream that deafens the battlefield, to no one's reply.<br /> <br /> Amelia's turn, then Jin's next.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-18T15:03:09-08:00","id":74581,"title":"","content":"Amelia will go straight for the real Abaskeru pushing her armor to its limit to gain maximum speed once again carefully looking for the perfect spot to deliver the blow, her grip tightening on her Autoklave. She does not even dare to blink as she approach with great speed the dragon of her anima has bared its fangs and claws and extended its wings over those of the armor. (Amelia activate hungry tiger technique for 1 mote and score <a href=\"http://umbralechoes.com/ExaltedRoller.php\" target=\"_blank\">11 success</a> not counting the 4 auto success)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-19T10:59:50-08:00","id":75070,"title":"","content":"Amelia's strike lands true, and the force of her blow decapitates the Beast King. His giant body of minions falls, and the rain of gore is a sight to behold. In space, Zezoothe and his Daveas pause, and then fly off, their being there ow a liability without the Beast King's might to assist them. The Deliberative has won the day. <br /> <br /> However, without the Beast King, all the beasts now have fallen back to their normal ways, preying upon one another in a berserk fervor. <br /> <br /> What will you do now?<br /> <br /> (And with that, we get a nice reprieve moment, so I'll hand out experience. Five for the session, plus one for the three die stunt.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-19T12:08:41-08:00","id":75119,"title":"","content":"Jin will order the DelArm detachment to consolidate thier position, but not to attack the beasts unless attacked first. We don't want to get their attention any more than we have to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-20T13:18:29-08:00","id":75837,"title":"","content":"Pellias will go to the remnants of the barge that carried in Abaskeru and begin to investigate it for anything unusual (or useful).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-20T15:30:44-08:00","id":75915,"title":"","content":"As Amelia hovers over the battlefield she calls Hoshi &quot; Mr. Hoshi this is commander Blitzfire we need immediate air support to cover the DelArm forces on the ground the beast have gone berserk and started to feed off each other request immediate evac&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T07:21:05-08:00","id":77049,"title":"","content":"When Pellias stalked towards the palanquin, he notices that it is covered in Realm script. It tells the story of a man from a tribe who lived in a far-off planet, whose ancestors and even those before them worshipped the Great Goat. However, the Mountain and Beast as One, descended on their planet, and after battling the Great Goat, had won their world. However, this man was not satisfied. He climbed the mountain and, after five days, reached the top, where he demanded of the Beast to know if He would rule fairly. Impressed that one so small had an ego as large as His own, Mardukth Exalted the man, who became the Beast King you saw before. APart from this, there's nothing remarkable about it, save perhaps its ornate craftsmanship.<br /> <br /> &quot;Acknowledged, Commander Blitzfire. We are sending transports with supplies en route to assist. I am also redirecting Wood Squad to cover the operation,&quot; The Comms operator said over the voxcaster in Amelia's suit. <br /> <br /> Enien, meanwhile, was chuckling to herself over the sight of the beasts, looking over the sprawling plain and all its brutality. <br /> <br /> What will you do?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-23T13:19:56-08:00","id":77800,"title":"","content":"Satisfied that he had seen what he needed to see on the palanquin, Pellias made his way slowly back to to the others, noting the beasts running amok as he did, and allowed his suit to shed its cloak a few feet from his comrades. &quot;This planet has been compromised.&quot;<br /> <br /> He sighed in an electric rasp as he looked over the beasts. &quot;Not that there's much strategic or resource value in this location, from this particular sample we're seeing. I doubt we'd be able to bring the locals into line&quot; he said as he looked to the others (somewhat pausing on Enien for a moment longer), &quot;unless anyone has something clever they'd wish to try?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T15:57:32-08:00","id":78733,"title":"","content":"Enien laughs, and says, &quot; Sorry, but if I did, then these beasts would be monsters that would devour the dreams of Humanity, not something you could easily rule over. Sorry, if I haven't introduced myself properly, &quot;She bows to the Circle, &quot; Enien Salzbourg, First Scouting Division of the Southern Shogun's Battle Fleet, chosen of He who is Not, and fellow student of Peerless Ocelot, Chosen of Endings.&quot;<br /> <br /> At that moment, the transports that Hoshi had called down arrive, bringing with them personnel and more supplies. <br /> (Sorry, Albz if it seems like you got shafted. Things got a little out of hand, and I probably shouldn't have tried to divide up the Circle. My B on that one.)<br /> <br /> So, what will you do now? Will you leave, or work anew? ALso, will you accept Enien's assistance?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T16:28:00-08:00","id":78771,"title":"","content":"Amelia lands near her teammate as her anima begins to fade away and deactivate her essence wings &quot;No mister Pellias there is nothing of value to us here and it as cost us both time and lives, I will instruct the DelArm detachment to collect samples of both plants and life forms for the genesis division back on the Gunstar if you don't have any objections, you are in command of the DelArm force and I do not wish to overrule you're authority&quot; Amelia turns to look at the infernal and open her helmet &quot; So what graces us with the presence of an Infernal that is not trying to kill us Miss Salzbourg ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T16:37:40-08:00","id":78787,"title":"","content":"The Terrestrials nod, and begin their work in gathering, as Enien laughs,&quot; Shogun Escha instructed me to track and pursue your contingent, as it seemed odd that you broke off at a critical moment of the battle. However, as you traveled through that Wyld Storm, I've been curious to see what you're doing. I have only the faintest ideas of what your Gunstar people think or even do, really, you see.&quot; she says, smiling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T17:11:11-08:00","id":78822,"title":"","content":"Amelia chuckles &quot;So you came to spy on us nice of you to tell us. As for what we do, well we try to survive mostly I cannot tell you more than that seeing that you are technically our enemy no offence nevertheless you have helped us in this fight and for that you have my thanks. What are you gonna do now that you have revealed yourself to us ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T18:16:52-08:00","id":78890,"title":"","content":"&quot;If you'll permit me, I'd like to tag along. If I do, then I'm technically obeying my orders, and the Shogun knows, oh, he knows when I lie. And before you ask, the Shoguns aren't above fighting one another. After all, Papa Theion only has so much attention he is willing to spare to the Heralds of the Green Sun,&quot; Enien says, pleading.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T19:08:31-08:00","id":78955,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hmm... I don't have a problem with it after all if you do something stupid Zekka will kill you but I am not the only one that need to give an approval&quot; As she gesture at her teammate &quot;If you'll excuse me for a moment&quot; Amelia walks a few meter away and activate her voxcaster after setting it to a specific frequency &quot;Zekka can you hear me ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-25T08:01:40-08:00","id":79321,"title":"","content":"Enien claps, although she looks to the others in the circle, and asks, &quot;And what do you say?&quot;<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, Zekka responds over the voxcaster to Amelia,&quot; Zekka here. What do you want?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-25T12:52:52-08:00","id":79525,"title":"","content":"Pellias' hood removed itself and shuttered down into his cowl, revealing his slightly sceptical-looking face staring hard at Enien. &quot;Shogun Escha... I take it he was behind the opposite forces in the previous battle. So, now you propose to continue your surveillance of us under his orders. Tell me, Chosen of He who is Not, now that you've found out where we went to after the Wyld storm, what is it that you think we are doing that needs watching?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T07:36:56-08:00","id":80227,"title":"","content":"&quot;You misunderstand me. I have suspicions, but that's not why I wish to accompany you. As I said before, I'm curious as to how you people have lived for so long in isolation from the Spiral? For instance, is it true that you all live within the World-Jouten of Autochton? Also, is true that you consume the dead bodies of your ancestors to consume their spirits?&quot; She asks, pulling out a parcel from her coat, &quot; But, that isn't all, though. I also have this letter from Peerless Ocelot, addressed to you all Do you want it?&quot;<br /> <br /> Zekka then coughs over the voxcaster,&quot; Sorry to interrupt your pattycake session, but I thought you might like to know that the planet seems to be coming apart in oh...four hours? Four hours. Seems that one Green Sun Prince you all curbstomped was a axis mundi that kept this world together. You might wanna leave.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T17:29:37-08:00","id":80645,"title":"","content":"Amelia grins, one less problem to deal with she thought turniing to face her friends &quot;Alright you heard the man get ready to get off this rock&quot; She respond in her voxcaster &quot;Zekka get ready for an unusual visitor, get hoshi to ready a room for our guest and I would like to speak to you privately when this is over&quot; she aproach the infernal and speak with a stern look on her face &quot;Miss Salzbourg due to you're nature you will be treated with caution but with civility however you will be disarmed and transported on board Zekka in a transport along with fifteen dragon-Blooded and myself you do anything relatively funny or suspicious and I will kill you without a second of hesitation, if you feel that any of those term are unacceptable you are free to stay here, whatever this letter says understood ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T17:34:36-08:00","id":80648,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'll take that,&quot; Jin says, indicating the letter, &quot;If anyone here will be able to verify its authenticity, its me.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T12:59:02-08:00","id":81186,"title":"","content":"Enien hands over the letter, which Jin opens. Sepia tones swirl around him as a ghostly apparition of Peerless Ocelot stands before him, writing while the letter's contents are spoken in the deep baritone of a man wise i nthe world. <br /> <br /> &quot;My dear student Jin,<br /> <br /> I am writing this letter to apologize for a number of deceptions I have perpetrated against you. As you have gotten, no doubt, you are aware that I am still alive. The deception was necessary for certain plans to be made. Rest assured, I am still working towards creating a Spiral where all can life in peace and freedom. To ensure that I got this letter to you, I pressured Shogun Escha to have my student, Enien, be part of the scouting force. She is well-versed in the Infernal Hero Art, so she may be useful as a guide and a companion. If you wish to meet me, I will be on Ev Ilta's Pleasure Planet. Go there, and ask for Korbo, if you wish to learn the truth.<br /> <br /> Regards,<br /> Peerless Ocelot&quot;<br /> <br /> And with that, the illusory Sifu gets up and tosses the parchement into the air, only to reverse kick it into the hands of a passing uniformed Daeva flying overhead. <br /> <br /> With that, the Deliberative Army is funneled back into the transports without much interference, and after all returning to Zekka, they witnessed the collapse of the Planet, as it returned to space dust. Enien is escprted to a brig room, with the guard Amelia proscribes, as Zekka walks into the bridge with the Circle.<br /> <br /> &quot;So, that ended quickly. What happened, and where do we go from here?&quot; the Alchemical asks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T13:59:22-08:00","id":81220,"title":"","content":"&quot;This could be a very clever trap&quot; Pellias breaks in, looking to Jin as he does. &quot;I'm just saying what is on the table. Ev Illta's Pleasure Planet? We're rapidly getting led down a path we ourselves didn't uncover.&quot; He paused as he watched the ship through his <i>eyes</i>, very uncomfortable having Enien on board despite the guard assigned to her. &quot;We have to contend with the fact that our presence here is no longer secret, and I feel that as a result the grander mission may fizzle before it really begins.&quot;<br /> <br /> Looking to the remains of the planet's dust on the viewscreen, he sighed. &quot;What's your gut reaction, Jin? Is Peerless Ocelot really alive, or is this simply a trick of our friend down in the brig?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T15:34:18-08:00","id":81274,"title":"","content":"&quot;Zekka you are the oldest and most experienced among us what do you think ?&quot; But Amelia shared the suspicion of Pellias on this one this could be a trap but more frightening was this letter, it proved that someone talked about this expedition with outsider and that could mean infernal agents know about it too. &quot;We have to assume that everything we do from this point could be a trap and for one I do not trust this letter but I will trust you're judgement on this Mr Jin he was you're master and if you believe that he is alive and can be trusted than so be it&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 02-27-2014, 07:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T17:19:49-08:00","id":81329,"title":"","content":"&quot;I don't know about this planet or about Peerless Ocelot. Most Sidereals are intelligence spooks, while my Circle was out on the front-lines of the East. If we were in the Eastern Arm, I would have more to go on, but I really know as much as you do at this point,&quot; Zekka frowns.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T21:54:30-08:00","id":81418,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm certain its him,&quot; Jin says, &quot;There's to many tiny details. Whether or not it's a trap? I don't know. I doubt he's turned, if that's what you're saying. If he turned he could have done far more damage form within the Realm. He had access to our intelligence networks, and he trained a large portion of some of DelArm's most powerful shock troopers. No, he's to cunning an clever for that. The only thing i can imaging is if he went into deep cover. The higher echelons back home probably even knew about it, since they told me, on no uncertain terms that he was dead, and they would have known he wasn't since Lytek would have gotten his Exaltation, and would have raised red flags if he didn't. If this is a trap, its because someone else is trying to get us to come to him.&quot;<br /> <br /> Once the focus is back off of him, Jin will ask his Pattern Spider to interface with the rest of the spiders, to determine if his plan for Abaskeru's Exaltation worked.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T07:34:46-08:00","id":81586,"title":"","content":"&quot;Soooo, are we going or not?&quot; Zekka asks, looking around, as best as the Circle can tell due to his impassive ocular implants.<br /> <br /> Jin waits a minute as his Fatweaver leaves and returns from the Matrices of Destiny with its fellows. It chirps in Realm that the plan was successful, but Lytek and the Maidens are also wondering what to do with it, as they do not possess control over the Therian Exaltation's inherent bestial font of power. It also indicates that Palanmas, the Titan they had met earlier, had introduced herself to Autochthon, but has since departed once more for the Spiral.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T09:21:26-08:00","id":81630,"title":"","content":"&quot;No not yet, I would like to know more about this pleasure planet before going there perhaps Miss Salzbourg could help us with that. But we have other matter to attend before we leave. Mr Hoshi casualty report please&quot; Amelia looks tired as she speak to the Dragon-Blooded.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-01T07:11:02-08:00","id":82092,"title":"","content":"Cynis Lydia appears before you, and with her pict-caster,&quot; Losses were at a minimum. We lost a dozen soldiers on the ground, with approximately fifty or so injuries, none of them impossible to treat with our equipment. In the battle in space, we lost two fighters in Wood Squad. Our salvage team is recovering the wreckage now so we can rebuild them. We will hold a mmeorial service tomorrow, operations willing. As for <i>Mercury's Delight,</i> they sufferedsuffered minor casualties as well, although numbers are not available at this time..&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;What's this about me and my ship?&quot; a voice calls, as a thin woman whose silver hair contrasts greatly to her navy blues strides in.<br /> <br /> &quot;Captain Kleiner, reporting,&quot; Kleiner, salutes &quot; So, what's going on, and what's this about a prisoner I've heard?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-01T08:28:50-08:00","id":82113,"title":"","content":"&quot;We will take the time Miss Lydia, keep me informed please&quot; Wen captain Kleiner enters the bridge Amelia returns her salute &quot;Captain Kleiner pleasure to meet you, yes we have an infernal in the brig but this is not the most disturbing part It would appear that our secret mission is not so secret after all, I will let Mr Jin explain the details&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-01T17:06:06-08:00","id":82399,"title":"","content":"&quot;Sorry that we couldn't provide much of a notice of this, by the way. With the planet about to break apart, the decision had to be made very quickly.&quot; Pellias said to Kleiner with a slight grimace on his face. &quot;Incidentally, I think she could've made it off that rock by herself without much of a problem. I've half a mind to insist that we use draining-shackles on her while she's in custody.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-02T07:13:58-08:00","id":82612,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh, are we going to interrogate this Infernal, then? She may know more about this information leak, after all,&quot; Kleiner posits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T19:50:21-08:00","id":83695,"title":"","content":"Pellias winces at the mention of interrogation, thinking on the risks of such an undertaking. &quot;I would say that we would need a good interrogator if we wanted to do that right now, someone who can do the job delicately. One thing that can be assumed, however, is that our friend has her own exit strategy, or she would not have been as compliant to have come on board.&quot;<br /> <br /> He looked to the Captain and gave a small nod. &quot;Other than the Pleasure Planet, what other options seem even remotely worthy of our attention?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T20:50:42-08:00","id":83739,"title":"","content":"&quot;Indeed, Commander Pellias, indeed. Although, apart from the Pleasure Planet, there are the other three main avenures scouted out before. One in the sparse core area, which is remarkably close to the coordinates listed for this Pleasure Planet,&quot; Kleiner said, peering over Lydia's shoulder,&quot; But also several planets in the Western Arm we are relatively close to. The issue, arises, however, that several Daevas broke off from our engagement, and on top of that, there's a security leak to our operations already in progress before news spreads of our arrival. This is all troubling news, but I will defer to your judgement,&quot; The Lunar captain bows.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-06T09:30:01-08:00","id":85400,"title":"","content":"&quot;Despite wanting to speak to my mentor, the mission comes first. Might I suggest we find a place with not so many locals?&quot;<br /> <br /> Jin requests that his pattern spider remind Lytek of the theoretical treatise he [Jin] wrote when the plan was first conceived. Namely, of three potential paths of alteration. (1) Reformat the Exaltation to function for allied Primordials, (2) Reverse the original Titanic exalted creation process and turn it into a Solar Exaltation, and (3) Format the exaltation into a Celestial shard most in-theme with the Primary-coded Primordial; which in this case, would likely be a Lunar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-06T17:47:07-08:00","id":85738,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well said, though where next? That part is critical,&quot; Kleiner asks.<br /> <br /> Also, Jin gets this response back.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Boy, do you know how hard the Motonic Physics is in order to recalibrate an engine of mass Arete acceleration and refinement? It's not just your average &quot;Oh, look at me, I can balance the entire Universe on my toe using a system of levers and clever puns on prayer strips, whoop whoop di doo&quot; problem.<br /> <br /> It's a delicate process, filled with potentially unsolvable problems that arise from fundamentally translating this engine from one form of raw infinite power to another. This is exacerbated in that you got me an Exaltation from Mardukth. He probably didn't even properly make it, just burping the thing out, and then bewildered at his act of genesis, had his souls do the rest. That's slipshod craftsmanship on top of the problems I already addressed. So, while I appreciate your input (I really do), can you ever so politely cease your backseat alchemy unless you want to join in? </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T16:56:15-07:00","id":91212,"title":"","content":"&quot;We have few thing to deal with first Captain Kleiner, Zekka may I ask that you make sure that our guest is secure in Manacles of Might like Mr Pellias suggested. As for our destination anyone as suggestions ? &quot; The thought of interrogating the Infernal as crossed Amelia's mind but It would not be easy or safe for that matter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T17:11:23-07:00","id":91223,"title":"","content":"&quot;Jungle&quot; Pellias said, with more than a bit of excitement behind his voice. &quot;I'm not one known for particularly long-term planning, but it seems to me that unsettled jungle might be a good mixture of resources and cover; easier to hide in a harsh jungle than open on a surface I figure.&quot; He looked to the others with a wide grin on his face and then to Magnusar. &quot;We could also bring our new friend along. What better security than under our nose? I feel safer with her off the Zekka in any case; less of a chance to do something we can't repair later.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-18T07:43:24-07:00","id":93487,"title":"","content":"Lydia nods at Amelia's command, and Enien is led into the room. another Dragonblood soldier readying the manacles. However before they can be affixed, her eyes roll back and her caste mark appears. She <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gsNaR6FRuO0\" target=\"_blank\">screeches an unusual cacophony of noise,</a> and then begins to speak:<br /> <br /> &quot;Three is the number of Great Suns to await you on your Path<br /> One the Black Dreams of Scholars, snubbed, ridiculed and mocked, now a power to be feared.<br /> The second is the Exquisite Tree, whose lies made Man and Women go mad.<br /> The final is the Crimson Wind, whose teachings slay those she loves with her bloody spear.<br /> Tread carefully, my sons, the Valley of Giants is no man's land. &quot;<br /> <br /> With that, she sighs and her eyes return to their normal state, as everyone looks on unnerved. She is returned to the brig, while Zekka laughs.<br /> <br /> &quot;Cheerful broad, ain't she?&quot; he says, walking off, while the ship makes preparations for the trip to the next world.<br /> <br /> The trip takes one week, and after , you can see a large verdant world before you. What will you do?<br /> <br /> (And if you wish to do some training or soemthing in the downtime, be sure to say so).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-20T02:28:38-07:00","id":94814,"title":"","content":"Watching the screen show the verdant jungle planet, Pellias gave an impressed whistle. &quot;Totally void of any obvious civilization?&quot; he asked to the room in general. &quot;We're going to need to know where best to set down rather than just pick a point on the map. Tact...&quot; he remarked as he scanned over the features of the world they had arrived at, &quot;going to have to take this with some caution. As much as I'd like a bit of safari, we're looking for candidates for longer settlement&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-20T20:17:09-07:00","id":95363,"title":"","content":"Hoshi printed out a sheet describing the planet. <br /> <br /> &quot;There are patches of essence respiration we can see, and there's a lattice of high essence generation here, &quot; he says, pointing near the equator, &quot;But apart from that, there's nothing in terms of industry. According to our scanners, the equator is a swampy bog biome, while as you go north or south, the environment gets more temperate, but no less lush. It seems we'll have to trek through bush no matter where we touch down. There is, however, this,&quot; he then points to a large ravine.<br /> <br /> &quot;This seems to have been formed when an Unshaped attacked the region centuries ago, but it has created a rocky area that the plants grow the least in. In any case, then, you'd have to deal with difficult terrain,&quot; he says, mater-of-factly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-24T14:35:07-07:00","id":97755,"title":"","content":"Pellias gave a slow nod after allowing a moment for any other options (or objections) to be posed. Hearing none, he whistled through his teeth and pointed to the ravine. &quot;I say we drop a small team, no more than say a dozen of us, down there to suss out what it feels like. In and out quietly if needs be, but perhaps giving a few days scouting before we look at prospects of any sort of construction.&quot; He turned to the other Chosen in the room and looked evenly at the crew around them. &quot;Volunteers only for the ground crew; this may be less than fun or even survivable, but it should at least be exciting&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-24T15:41:32-07:00","id":97805,"title":"","content":"Amelia reaches for the map and take a look at it before putting it back. &quot; I will go down with you Mr Pellias but I would suggest that we drop with heavy weapons just in case and only exalted for this one, while also keeping an extraction force ready to deploy if things go bad.&quot; Amelia seems hesitant for a moment before continuing &quot;Also there is that strange warning from Miss Enien should we take this seriously ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T16:53:43-07:00","id":98772,"title":"","content":"Airi and Ryuuka both step forward as if on cue. <br /> <br /> &quot;We'll join you, if you'd like, milords. The mission won't be our first time going in blind,&quot; Airi says gruffly, and Ryuuka nods. <br /> <br /> After prepping and getting ready, the expeditionary force sets down in a small clearing, where only smaller trees reside in the hole made when a massive elder tree fell in some calamity.<br /> <br /> &quot;We'll be in the air, as visibility beneath the treeline will be low, so call in if you need support,&quot; the pilot signals to the Circle. <br /> <br /> You then find yourselves in that selfsame clearing; a dark realm all round you where the only light comes from the scant gaps in the trees You can hear soemthing faintly in the distance.<br /> <br /> &quot;Toktok tobakta, Hono!&quot; it says in a deep, rumbling voice.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-25T21:20:32-07:00","id":98927,"title":"","content":"Jin tries to zero in on the source of the voice, &quot;I don't suppose you speak Realm?&quot; he says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T08:57:51-07:00","id":99209,"title":"","content":"The three beings that walk out of the bush look humanoid, but only to a mind who has the dimmest understanding of what a human looks like. They were over five meters tall, possessing lean, muscular bodies of a mottled brown like the trees around them. They possessed three digits on each overly long limb, and mouths filled with tusks. However, their most striking feature was their four eyes, one pair above the other, who scanned the team before them blankly. <br /> <br /> &quot;Gojus, totoranbu hess Rusemin ess, Sabbie tessprecht euru&quot; the tallest said, his caprine ears flickering, as a smaller giant walked over to the Circle and leaned down. Gently, he pushed one of the dragonblooded scouts with a huge finger.<br /> <br /> &quot;Kussus, Rusemin ja nai,&quot; the smaller giant called to the leader, who frowned.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-26T15:48:02-07:00","id":99551,"title":"","content":"&quot;Let's try not to have this turn into a bad first impression too quickly, shall we?&quot; he remarked to the scout being prodded. &quot;On an aside, did anyone understand that? If not, I want the bulk of it on constant transmission to the Zekka for their analysis&quot; <br /> <br /> Pellias pressed the side of his cowl and allowed his hood to snap up over his head. With essence-sight now active, he peered at not only their 'welcoming party' but also at the trees around them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-27T08:15:14-07:00","id":100026,"title":"","content":"&quot;I understood that. They're Watchers, a servant race of The All-Consuming Blossom. Their mouths can't easily produces the sounds necessary for Realm, y'see,&quot; Enien says over the radio, as Hoshi coughs.<br /> <br /> &quot;Sorry, milords. We didn't understand what they were saying, either, so we got her up from the brig,&quot; he says.<br /> <br /> &quot;Anyways, what they said was this:<br /> <br /> [Eater of Entrails], determine if they are Rusemin. [Sabbie] told us so.<br /> <br /> Then the next replied with <br /> <br /> [Gnawer of Bones], Rusemin are (not),&quot; Enien says, pronouncing the brackets with crisp enunciation,&quot; Rusemin, though, that sounds familiar.....Oh, well. Oh, something you ought to know....&quot;<br /> <br /> As she is saying this, Pellias sees that a bundle that [Gnawer of Bones] was hefting over his shoulder is filled with writhing human shapes. There are also other towering figures amongst the trees, probably waiting for some signal.<br /> <br /> &quot;Watchers are slavers and hunters. If you can see them, you're probably already trapped,&quot; Enien says.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-29T18:34:34-07:00","id":101654,"title":"","content":"Pellias raised an eyebrow underneath his mask at the mention of trapped, more than a little perturbed by the idea that their attempt at setting up camp without much notice might be sidelined by immediate conflict. He looked to Jin and Amelia and the volunteers they'd taken with them before scanning back to the sack full of writhing human shapes.<br /> <br /> With a defeated tone, he sighed in an electronic buzz as he flicked a few switches on the rifle mounted on his back. &quot;Can we at least try to be a bit subtle with this?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-29T21:06:10-07:00","id":101728,"title":"","content":"The Watchers, especially the one kneeling over the Circle, look at Pellias and chortle; a horrific thunder of gnashing teeth. <br /> <br /> &quot;Tokonto, topalsoloth Lilitui ess, Todon buran jui?&quot; said [Gnawer of Bones]. <br /> <br /> &quot;Go ahead, [Small Man]. What can you stick do?&quot; Enien translated.<br /> <br /> Well, then? What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-30T22:12:35-07:00","id":102394,"title":"","content":"Choosing to not reply to this, Pellias taps a series of buttons on the wrist of his suit. &quot;I'm not sure how they're going to react to this,&quot; he said to the others present, &quot;but be prepared for a hostile reaction. If anyone is attacked, please retaliate with as much care to keeping this local as possible.&quot;<br /> <br /> Finishing his orders, he looked up to the Giant in front of him and smiled under his facemask. In an instant, he felt his suit power up and himself drop entirely from sight and essence detection. The gun slid off his back effortlessly as he rolled away to find a suitable location in the nearby foliage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-31T06:21:00-07:00","id":102588,"title":"","content":"Amelia grin underneath her helmet before giving the most simple of order &quot;kill them all no prisoners&quot;. She unsheathe her autoklaive the chain roar as it activate and she throws herself at the kneeling watcher in a vertical jump to better aim her attack to disembowel him. (Amelia Activate Panoptic fusion discipline for 3m and hungry tiger technique for 1m and attack with her autoklaive rolling 18 dice and getting <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4452557/\" target=\"_blank\">8 sux</a> with a base damage of 12L/2)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-31T10:51:32-07:00","id":102782,"title":"","content":"The giants are all taken aback by Pellias' magic trick, but what really gets their attention was Amelia's burst of movement. Amelia's blade slashes true, and the giant's guts are sprayed helter-skelter, as he falls. The other giants all tense up, ready for action.<br /> <br /> Roll for Join Battle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-31T14:35:40-07:00","id":102942,"title":"","content":"Pellias gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4453033/\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes </a>on JB.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-31T14:38:40-07:00","id":102943,"title":"","content":"Amelia as <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4453036/\" target=\"_blank\">4 successes</a> for JB.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-31T15:09:20-07:00","id":102959,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4453053\" target=\"_blank\">6 sux</a> for Jin Battle<br /> <br /> EDIT: My 'o' key was stuck... but this is too hilarious to change.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-31T16:32:48-07:00","id":102994,"title":"","content":"A'iight, You all go first, with Jin, Amelia and Pellias going in order. <br /> <br /> (Also, Jin battle, hahahaha. That's worth a 3pt stunt for everyone, even if unintentional)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-01T15:48:24-07:00","id":103684,"title":"","content":"(Of course Jin wins Jin Battle!)<br /> <br /> With his arms trailing faint streamers of crimson stardust, Jin leaps towards one of the Watchers. With the leap's low arc Jin hits the ground well before the giant, sliding towards it like a sportsman sliding towards a base. As he passes between the giant's legs, Jin swings both of his fists towards the giant's ankles. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Jin activates Horrific Wreath and makes a Punch attack on the Walker, rolling 18 dice and getting <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4454077\" target=\"_blank\">7 suxx</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-02T07:28:43-07:00","id":104028,"title":"","content":"Jin's strike lands true, and the Watcher clutches his bloody ankle with a shrill scream.<br /> <br /> Amelia's go next.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-05T11:01:12-07:00","id":106387,"title":"","content":"Amelia will use the fallen watcher as a step while she execute another jump to reach the head of the closest watcher with her autoklaive (Amelia rolls 21 dice and activate Hungry tiger technique and gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4457914/\" target=\"_blank\">9 su<u>x</u></a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-05T20:26:34-07:00","id":106685,"title":"","content":"(That's a good 1pt stunt, Magnusar)<br /> <br /> Amelia's slash cleaves a large chunk of the Watcher's jaw off, leaving a bloody lump hanging off by a veritable thread of muscle. The Watcher crumples at the attack, and you can see the other Watchers looking somewhat pensive as their warriors are brought low so easily.<br /> <br /> (Pellias' go next)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-05T22:47:01-07:00","id":106742,"title":"","content":"Smiling slightly as he watched the both Jin and Amelia have their fun, Pellias took a long look down the scope of <i>Maker </i>straight towards the (rather rude) Gnawer of Bones. Digging his invisible heel into the soil, he took a split-second decision to aim away from the tusked face and towards the arm holding the writhing sack of human forms. <br /> <br /> (Bah, dice gods hate me: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4458666/\" target=\"_blank\">5 suxx</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-06T07:20:35-07:00","id":106877,"title":"","content":"Pellias' shot cries out for a split second, and despite pulling to the left, he still hits the giant's arm. The giant clutches his arm, dropping the bag, and looks at the piles of meat several of his subordinates have become.<br /> <br /> &quot;Eies tohonbaras Eue [Sokararati Zeffa]!&quot; he roars, revealing a tattoo on his unshot arm, of a human-shaped being wielding a long pole. <br /> <br /> &quot;Hotos! Aes! Aes!&quot; another says, and Gnawer of Bones growls at him. The watchers all retreat into the bush, then.<br /> <br /> Jin's turn again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-07T14:30:33-07:00","id":107708,"title":"","content":"Unwilling to follow the Watchers in to the unfamiliar underbrush, Jin will investigate the dropped bag.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-07T16:34:47-07:00","id":107770,"title":"","content":"Jin unclasps the buckles holding the giant bag closed, and about a dozen humanoids pop out. They all possess gray skin, horns of various sizes and shapes on their heads, A tall, gaunt male figure appears to you, his large horns providing him more authority than his sickly form would otherwise suggest. In rough Realm, he asks, &quot;Are they gone? Are the giants gone?&quot;<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-07T19:06:22-07:00","id":107872,"title":"","content":"Pellias will try to follow the watchers through the bush until they either stop or go beyond say half a mile or so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T07:01:43-07:00","id":108172,"title":"","content":"Make a Perception+Survival roll at difficulty 3, Jotun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T15:10:36-07:00","id":108635,"title":"","content":"((Perception+Survival+Specialty(tracking) rolls out to <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4461645/\" target=\"_blank\">4 successes</a>)).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T20:22:16-07:00","id":108890,"title":"","content":"You manage to find the trail of blood, in spite of being mixed with mud and through various streams, Pellias. You muse that such beings, being so tall and able to apparently travel swiftly and silently, would be pretty terrifying. Assuming, of course, you weren't a god-king with supremely fine hunting instincts. You haven't caught up with them, but you can easily discern where they're going. However, a flash of light appears, and a buffet of wind beings to howl.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, no....<i>She's</i> coming,&quot; the one horned speaker from before, shivered, and the figures all huddle in the bag as best they can.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-10T15:30:31-07:00","id":110339,"title":"","content":"Pellias decides to remain unseen at this moment and begins to slink back to where the landing party was. Making a few important mental marks as to the trail he was following, he began to turn his attention to the odd wind that had appeared after the flash and whether it was &quot;heading&quot; towards the others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-11T09:15:05-07:00","id":110833,"title":"","content":"The shockwave of wind blasts through the clearing, and out of this maelstrom, steps a terrifying, a terrible, the most indescribable of beings. You see...a teenage girl. <br /> <br /> A teenage girl with her unruly pink hair held in place by twin braids, steps out into the clearing, looking around. at the landing party and the carnage they have inflicted. She then laughs a flutey chuckle, and smiles unnervingly. <br /> <br /> &quot;So, who is it that calls me? I am the Bodhisattva of murder, the slayer of virtue and vice, and the herald of the Grinding Wind who frees the burdened from themselves Was it all of you?&quot; she asks, hefting a weapon that at first glance, looks like a giant rusty jade nail.<br /> <br /> Well, now, what will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-13T07:45:19-07:00","id":112046,"title":"","content":"Amelia raise an eyebrow when the girl comes out of the forest, she expected a tyrant lizard but instead she got a pink flamingo. Oh well it will do she guessed before closing the distance between them she strike, coming from a low angle to better surprise and disorient her target (Amelia strikes with her autoklaive activating her first melee excellency to add 6 dice for a cost of 6 mote and hungry tiger technique for 1 mote for a total of 7 mote of peripheral essence , she rolls 24 dice and gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4467240/\" target=\"_blank\">7 success</a>) (I forgot to mention but she used a total of 12 mote of peripheral essence, she have 12 left in her pool and as a PDV of 8 right now)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 04-13-2014, 05:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-16T18:20:22-07:00","id":114447,"title":"","content":"The slash goes straight for the newcomer's neck, but a curious flower opens before Amelia's strike, as a series of arms erupt from the flower and guide the attack away, to cut off only a few pink hairs.<br /> <br /> &quot;I told you. I am the Bodhisattva of Murder. Such a weak attack won't hurt me. Now, who did it? Who called Scarlet Zephyr here?&quot; the girl asks, hefting her jade spear?<br /> <br /> It's Jin and Pellias' go if you're still interested in battling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-17T04:03:13-07:00","id":114643,"title":"","content":"Pellias stalked back towards where the landing party was located and was happy that he had kept his suit activated. He was a little less happy, however, that it appeared that the situation had escalated as it had. Whomever this Bodhisattva was, she was good enough to go toe-to-toe with Amelia. <br /> <br /> On the positive side, he mused as he settled over the scene from the brush, she seemed to be more interested in who summoned here (and Pellias recalled the tattoo the giant had shouted at before they'd scrambled into the jungle). For the time being, he felt it more valuable to keep an eye on the situation before acting.<br /> <br /> ((getting Predator vibes here. All we need is an Arnie-accented DB on staff!))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-17T22:04:37-07:00","id":115123,"title":"","content":"&quot;Stay down and stick together,&quot; Jin hisses to the recently liberated captives. He will do his best to interpose himself between them and the Titanic Exalt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-19T21:13:13-07:00","id":116328,"title":"","content":"Scarlet Zephyr will glide through the brush in the meadow, walking past Amelia. She caresses the Dawn Caste's face, and giggles. <br /> <br /> &quot;Such soft skin. You make yourself out to be a killer, and you have such a soft face. I like that.&quot; She smiles, fawning over Amelia.<br /> <br /> &quot;I know who you all are. Now, you won't tell me who called me here, so I'll have to make this a lesson. Tell me who I was called, and I won't have to murder someone in the next ten seconds,&quot; She says, scanning the meadow. <br /> <br /> The clock is ticking, what will you all do or say?<br /> <br /> (I'm not planning on an ACTUAL IRL ten seconds, just a measure of in-game urgency)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-24T04:23:09-07:00","id":118383,"title":"","content":"Amelia will gesture with her sword towards what is left of the watchers that she killed &quot;they tried to ambush us we retaliated and when they saw that they could not win I assume they called you here to kill us&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-24T09:06:01-07:00","id":118456,"title":"","content":"Scarlet Zephyr looks over the gore and chuckles, &quot; So it seems. I do not usually dwell upon the offal on the ground. But, when you point it out like that, It's hard to not notice. Well, I promised not to kill anyone, but now I feel bad....&quot; She hefts her lance, when a green hologram appears before. The hologram, a mature woman in robes, adjusts her glasses, and declares,&quot; Zephyr! Stop fooling around! Drvaspa has appeared! It's finally happening!&quot;<br /> <br /> Zephyr looks crestfallen at this command, and grumbles, at which the hologram barks at her to stop it, and disappears.<br /> <br /> &quot;It seems that I must be off. However, remember, You'll all realize the truth behind my words soon enough if you continue on your current course,&quot; She says, and runs off on the tops of the trees in a similar direction to the Watchers. Soon enough, you can hear the whispers of her cackling, and far-off screams.<br /> <br /> All of this, however, is pushed to the side of your mind as a golden flash appears in the sky.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ground Team! Ground Team! Did you see that?&quot; Hoshi asked over the radio.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-24T23:35:17-07:00","id":118974,"title":"","content":"Pellias remained in hiding as the young woman made her (confusing) exit, inwardly sighing at the revelation that the planet might not be quite as underdeveloped as he'd hoped. By the time she'd made her leap to the trees and it was clear that she was heading off, he took the time to throw a swing of his effort into the hearthstone mounted on his rifle.<br /> <br /> Sure enough, an immaterial <i>eye</i> shimmered in his essence-sight in front of him. He gave a nod to it as it flew off in the direction of Scarlet Zephyr, just in time for his attention to be taken up by the golden flash in the sky and Hoshi's excited chattering over the radio.<br /> <br /> ((spending a WP to make an <i>eye</i> and send it off to follow Zephyr))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-25T07:44:38-07:00","id":119103,"title":"","content":"Pellias' eye flies off, and about three kilometers from his position, encounters a huge pile of gore. It seems that Zephyr caught up with the stragglers of the band of Watchers you encountered before. Continuing on on her path (Her high speed makes it all but impossible to NOT notice where she's been in this thick brush), you travel for miles and miles before coming across a large cylindrical building, behind which are several other large buildings and what appear to be several gargantuan pitcher plants. The most noticeable feature, though, is the steam locomotive suspended above the complex of buildings. The conductor, a woman in a steel-trimmed uniform, pauses in midair, plucking something from her jacket and dropping it to the ground, before giving a glance in your direction, and returning to her odd vehicle and flying off to parts unknown. <br /> <br /> Your eye tries to get a better look at the complex, but when you get about a kilometer to it, the picture blanks out, replaced with a caricature of the robed woman from the hologram before. <br /> <br /> &quot;Entering a house before knocking? For shame!&quot; she repeats, waggling her finger.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, back at the meadow, Hoshi repeats his call, &quot;Landing Party? Landing Party! A steam locomotive just showed up in orbit, dropped to the surface, then flew off! I'm not just the only one to have seen this, am I? Oh! Hold on. Petty Officer Cynis Carmine is telling me one of the officers in Cryo-stasis is awakening. We'll drop them off at your current location.&quot;<br /> <br /> Half an hour later, another dropship touches down, out of which appears a flambuoyantly dressed person, alongside a gaunt dragonblooded man in a Gunstar uniform denoting him as one of the Science Division.<br /> <br /> &quot;Cynis Carmine, Sers. Petty Officer, Second-grade. I am here to escort Lord Wren to the front-lines following his awakening and briefing. If I may, I'd also like to take samples of the remains of the non-human life that the Landing expedition has encountered,&quot; he asks, &quot;We'll stay here, and if need be, the Expedition can use our craft as well,&quot; he says, saluting smartly.<br /> <br /> (Plaemask, you're now up)<br /> <br /> Well, what will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-25T11:39:19-07:00","id":119186,"title":"","content":"Officer Wren as they were hailed smiled charmingly and took a courteous bow to those present at the landing site. &quot;A pleasure to meet you all.&quot; The soulgem in Wren's forehead was a soft fuscha color, with the symbol of Saturn sitting upon the front face, marking them as a Chosen of that Maiden. Wren seemed very not martial indeed, especially grinning. &quot;Now, shall introductions come with a briefing? I may be of some assistance.&quot; He spoke, looking each person present in the eyes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-25T19:41:02-07:00","id":119516,"title":"","content":"Jin folds back his helmet, revealing his own Emerald Soulgem. Nodding towards his fellow Sidereal, he says, &quot;Jin, Secrets, Operational intelligence. Now, if you'll excuse me, I have an intelligence asset to exploit.&quot;<br /> <br /> Jin will approach the Rusemen, and will ask them what they can tell him about Zephyr and the Watchers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-26T21:44:05-07:00","id":120150,"title":"","content":"The Rusemin all look pensive, but their leader from before, the gaunt male with the large bull horns, speaks up again.<br /> <br /> &quot;Scarlet Zephyr is one of the other three Green Sun Princes on this planet. She's the attack dog of a monster sorceress named Sable Thesis Dream. I don't know where she's from, but it's not this planet. The only thing that's been on this planet have been the Watchers. I heard she's from some planet where they worshiped a giant statue which fed evil dreams into your head, or that she came out of a hole in the ground to eat bad children, All I know is, I saw a Watcher try to swallow her whole. They...never made that mistake again, and now she's worshiped like some sort of living curse to toss between each other. <br /> <br /> As for the Watchers? They're a race dedicated to the Hunger Blossom, unlike us, who were made by the Great Mother of the Sea. They live and thrive in forests like this, and they hunt and trap through guile and stealth. I don't think they expected you all to be so strong, either, lords,&quot; he said, bowing, as a blind Rusemin woman, her eyes covered with red bandages smiles unnervingly, and she looks straight at Amelia, Pellias and Wren.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey, Tavren, maybe they can help us rescue the princess?&quot; she asks, as Tavren glares at her.<br /> <br /> &quot;Quiet! Why would Green Sun Princes help us anyways? Not even Mother answers our pleas, and now the Princess AND Kankos are captured!&quot; he fumes impotently, tears forming in his eyes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-26T23:03:03-07:00","id":120192,"title":"","content":"&quot;They wouldn't happen to be at the complex with the pitcher plants, would they?&quot; he remarked in a buzz to the two louder Rusemin through his helmet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-27T16:39:14-07:00","id":120610,"title":"","content":"Tavren stares at Pellias, dumbfounded, but then regains his composure, and says, &quot;Yes, that is the place. That is where Sable Thesis Dream and the Princess are, I'm sure of it. Will you assist us, then, Lords? The Princess is of the Royal Bloodline of Ruse, and she'll be able to make it worth your efforts,&quot; he says, getting to his knees, as the others genuflect as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-28T18:29:51-07:00","id":121346,"title":"","content":"Though nobody was able to really see it through his armour, Pellias raised a sceptical eyebrow at the genuflecting group in front of them. Amongst the many hard-learned rules that he kept in his head, one was to never get too involved when knowing only half a situation. The Watchers that had attacked them had been obvious and simple to handle: aggressors that needed a direct show of force to avoid further confrontations. <br /> <br /> This proposed rescue, however, seemed a bit more sticky.<br /> <br /> He turned to the others and away from the crowd. &quot;The complex in question seems less than easy to get into, and certainly not unnoticed if we did try. One of my <i>eyes</i> got a bit of a rude awakening when it got too close; I believe it was this 'Sable Thesis Dream' herself that poked it out of existence.&quot;<br /> <br /> Kneeling down, he began to trace in the dirt a rough outline of the complex with the pitcher plants that he'd seen. &quot;With a bit of time and some surveillance, I reckon we might be able to plan around any defences. Other than the fact that it seems to be the most developed structure for quite some distance, however, I'm not sure of any concrete benefits we'd get out of trying a stunt like that.&quot; <br /> <br /> Standing up after finishing his diagram, he looked around for any feedback from the others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T07:41:35-07:00","id":121692,"title":"","content":"Wren watched the other Exalt deal with the Rusemen and then watched him draw out the diagram. &quot;That does sound reasonable.&quot; He spoke. He studied it. &quot;Would it help or not if there were a distraction for her to deal with? Or would you rather just going silently?&quot; He questioned Pellias.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T20:53:32-07:00","id":122178,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm wondering what benefit we get for poking that hornet's nest, frankly&quot; he remarked as he dusted his hands off. &quot;The locals seem eager for us to throw our resources and lives into the mix, but unless there's a reason to hold the complex, it doesn't fit in with the mission.&quot;<br /> <br /> Tapping the button on his collar, Pellias' faceguard telescoped back into his cowl and the look on his face was an unhappy wince. When he spoke next, he spoke in a low whisper to the others. &quot;The *cough* locomotive is also involved, or at least took the time to pass by the area we're talking about. Made a delivery of something to the ground and then bolted. Given the speed that vehicle moved, this site might not be quite as isolated as it appears&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T21:39:47-07:00","id":122188,"title":"","content":"&quot;Assistance from the natives would be very helpful in establishing a base,&quot; Jin points out, &quot;plus, we have the opportunity to remove multiple Infernals from the equation. If Master Wren and I play our cards right, the Primordials might not even notice they're gone. Even if we don't set up shop here, if we take the installation, we can gut it for useful resources for were we will. Seems like a risk worth taking to me.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T21:09:27-07:00","id":122925,"title":"","content":"After her encounter with Scarlet zephyr Amelia seems a bit off, while listenning to Wren introduce himself and approach him before giving a quick salute &quot;I am Commander Blitzfire, It's a pleasure to have you on board with us Mr Wren and I hope to see your skills in action soon ... Unless you die&quot;<br /> <br /> She listens to the rusemins before literally growling when Tavren mention her being an infernal, rage begin bowling in her vein and her eyes seem to get that look someone have when they are gonna kill someone or several. As she memorize Pelias map of the place her mind begins to analyse the different option from a tactical point of view &quot; Mr Jin and Mr Pellias both have good points but we need to know more about this place and people in it, Mr Pellias how close can you get to structure without getting spotted, we're gonna need a bit more Intel, I'm afraid &quot; Looking at Jin &quot;We need to kill them all anyway they know of our presence now but the pink haired girl is mine alone anybody got a problem with that ?&quot;<br /> <br /> Amelia calls Hoshi &quot; Mr Hoshi I want full sensor sweep of the region that Mr Pellias found throw every sensors, scanners, everything understood and gather a maximum of Intel from Miss Enien and have the strike force on high alert and ready to deploy with additionnal gunsozha commandos in full assault gear, Amelia out&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> She walk to Tavren &quot; I hope for you that this is not a trap of anykind or there will be consequences &quot; Looking back to the other shall we go save the damsel in distress and slay the Infernals ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-01T12:52:40-07:00","id":123365,"title":"","content":"Wren wore an entirely ironic serious look and bowed to Amelia. &quot;I should hope I live beyond my first half-century. I should hope to expect to live far beyond that.&quot; He then broke into a wide grin, knowing and mischevous.<br /> <br /> He listened to the debate between Jin and Pellias. &quot;I am afraid I agree with Amelia and Jin-even if not wise in the short term, enemies of that sort are better off in the 'assuredly dead' column, rather than free to harry us later in this venture as well as report our presence here to their masters. It serves us well to help them, rather than leave them to the Primordial's ah. Tender attentions, yes?&quot;<br /> <br /> He snorted at her comment to Tavren. &quot;Yes, you may lead the way.&quot; He made a small, social gesture of invitation to go on with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1148,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","user":"Palemask","date":". 05-01-2014, 03:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T11:50:23-07:00","id":123909,"title":"","content":"Amelia sigh &quot; It's obvious that you know nothing of warfare Mr Wren or you would have noticed that this was a figure of speech, we still need to make a plan or to agree to a solution either stealth or assault, but first let's come up with an exit strategy.The first rule of piss poor planning always have you exit before your entrance, any ideas ? &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 05-03-2014, 10:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-03T20:47:41-07:00","id":124957,"title":"","content":"&quot;Roger,&quot; Hoshi says over the radio, and for a moment, Amelia, Pellias and Jin get readouts of the complex, its structures and its layouts. The pitcher plants turn out to be truly massive in size, plants over three stories tall, and rooted into the bedrock, held in place by massive walls of concrete. However, after a minute, the information turns to white noise, and Zekka grunts audibly over the radio, until words appear out of the static.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\">&quot;Little Children. You shouldn't spy on others. I will take the giant's eyes and tongue as payment.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> With that, the radio goes dead, and Enien appears out of nowhere. With a flick of her wrists, the manacles fall off, and she dusts herself off. <br /> <br /> &quot;You all did a number on your ship-behemoth. The scanning activated the Defiler's automatic mental defenses, and now your behemoth's scanners and radio are hacked, playing tunes that probably are driving your weaker willed crew members mad. Good thing I was able to figure those out in the meantime, or you'd be stuck down here,&quot; she said cheerfully, as Tavren grows concerned.<br /> <br /> &quot;You're concerned about us leading you all into a trap when you can see the insanity and evil of this woman at all sides! She steals children, the weak and old to feed her minions and her garden of death, and even steals your ship, yet you're concerned that WE will lead you astray?&quot;<br /> <br /> Eneien hushes Tavren, and says,&quot; Now is the time to act, or not, to flee. These people obviously need your help, and even if this place isn't the best place, it would do a boon to your cause to remove them. I could get a small group within the complex, but to do so, I must ask you; would you be ready to step outside what you know?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-04T17:27:36-07:00","id":125410,"title":"","content":"There was a long pause before Pellias spoke up at what Enien had said. &quot;One question before I answer yours, oh tricky one. What does the locomotive have to do with all this?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-04T18:07:16-07:00","id":125435,"title":"","content":"Enien laughs, and says, &quot;Oh, she appeared? That puts a wrinkle on things. That was Drvaspa, one of the Yazatas, behemoth-goddesses who control Fate and Causality. She controls speed, thought, and is the conductor of the Starlight Express, that train you saw. It traverses the Spiral, delivering goods, messages and passengers to the Titans and their servants. That she didn't herself stop and deliver her cargo suggests she was delivering an exaltation shard. Either one of Sable Thesis Dream's minions or one of the Rusemin has exalted.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-04T20:38:20-07:00","id":125510,"title":"","content":"Amelia grits her teeth before talking &quot; So you're saying that there are what 3 to 4 Infernals on this rock... We'll have to kill him or her too, Miss Enien to kill my enemies and save my people up there I would be ready to face the cosmic scorpion himself so If you have a way to help us I will take it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-05T14:25:45-07:00","id":126139,"title":"","content":"Wren made a light, flowing gesture. &quot;Calm down, Amelia.&quot; He spoke in soothing tones. &quot;One thing at a time, shall we? We may have a rare chance with this-think about it. They just exalted, their loyalties may not be so firm-look at this fine individual after all.&quot; He gestured to the seemingly friendly Infernal. &quot;So why not approach the 'new' exalt neutrally? I'm sure if they raise a ruckus, we may be able to put them down but if they are amenable, that may be a potential ally. Gods know that akuma have been found in some unlikely places-why not the opposite? We may come across this new Infernal but it sounds like the facility is our immediate and preferred target.&quot;<br /> <br /> He looked like he was thinking. &quot;We could go in silently but a distraction may assist us. Throwing some timed explosives into the pitcher plants may be useful for covering our entry. The locals view them as odious, so why not?&quot; He laughed. &quot;But we ought to get there soon. We do not have the element of surprise on our side, sadly and this is home ground for our enemy, so we must compensate.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-06T10:07:43-07:00","id":126769,"title":"","content":"Enien nods at Wren, &quot; I agree. T'will be best to act sooner rather than later. However, the point still stands? Do you want me to take you there?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T17:45:41-07:00","id":128648,"title":"","content":"Pellias knelt down again over his diagram and scratched his chin roughly. He let his hand down and traced over the pitcher plants. &quot;One of my <i>eyes</i> got about a kilometre out before it was spotted. Remember, we're talking an immaterial globe the size of a fist or so rushing at the speed of a falcon and this sorceress was able to take it down instantly, no real warning. Damned surprising, but it does mean that she's paying attention, which means that she can't be putting as much attention elsewhere if she's worried about spotting objects coming into range&quot;<br /> <br /> He stood up and looked to Wren and the Enien. &quot;She's playing a reactive game, it looks like. Glib responses to us poking her nest, full retaliation. I say we keep upping things to her expectations then: overwhelm her from a distance if we can while some of us sneak in and see what they can do from inside. If either the sorceress or her defences can be taken down, the outside team can then rush in and support the infiltration team.&quot;<br /> <br /> Tapping his wrist, he called out to the landing team as a whole. &quot;Transmission silence wherever possible. We can't be confident who and who isn't listening anymore, so keep it face-to-face&quot; With that, he turned to a nearby support officer. &quot;Did we bring the long range weapons like we did on our last field trip?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T08:36:41-07:00","id":128983,"title":"","content":"A colossal man in jade body armor approaches Pellais with a collection of several guns and rockets.<br /> <br /> &quot;Corporal Ragara Geigar, Commander, Siege Division. Lady Airi packed us a tidy snack for just such an operation. We had fire pillar bombs, self propelled rockets that'll punch a hole in a behemoth's carapace, a few essence cannons, a man-portable lightning ballista, and this,&quot; he says, patting a weapon seemingly made of several tubes with numerous ventilation grills.<br /> <br /> &quot;This is a Smoke projector cannon, a weapon that'll transmute anything that its stream hits into its base elements. Pretty neat, eh? Just one thing, be careful where you use it. We can't be transmuting our own soldiers, 'n all.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T10:11:56-07:00","id":129059,"title":"","content":"Amelia approach the corporal with stars in her eyes &quot; I'll take that &quot; as she grabs the smoke projector cannon &quot; Well Mr Pellias this is your plan since infiltration mission are not really my area of expertise tell me where you want me to be ? Corporal do we have some of those mark IV anti-fortress charge ? &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 05-09-2014, 01:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T15:03:43-07:00","id":129285,"title":"","content":"Jin lays a hand on Amelia's shoulder, and gestures towards Corporal Ragara. &quot;Perhaps we should let the siege weapons expert take the shot?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T15:33:55-07:00","id":129312,"title":"","content":"&quot; Aaaaahhh I never get to use the fun stuff &quot; Amelia hesitantly gives back the cannon to corporal Ragara with a pouty face like a little kid that got scolded before shutting her helmet tight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T16:21:49-07:00","id":129371,"title":"","content":"Pellias looked off into space for a moment. He was torn: both infiltration and long-range hit-and-run tactics were well within his expertise, but he himself could only be on one team. He looked to Amelia and gave a serious nod. &quot;There's an unaccounted for in this plan, however. If the Murder-Queen Teen shows up, she's fast enough to cause problems to both teams. We may need... a third team to try and goad her into a long fight while the sorceress is handled. Probably one that starts as part of the outside firing team and only breaks off if the Bodhisatva shows. You think that if you don't get surprised that you could take her with a little support from the troops?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T16:28:37-07:00","id":129377,"title":"","content":"Wren let the warriors do their jobs, quietly observing and snickering at Amelia's disappointment. His battlefields tended to be... non-standard to put it blithely. He kept a wide smile as they readied, checking his finely manicured hands. Soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T17:09:58-07:00","id":129412,"title":"","content":"Amelia ponders for a few moment &quot; Yes I can take her on and nothing can get the jump on me but I'll engage her alone, It will distract me if we fight in a group against her and the infiltration team will need all the help it can get. I'll be with the firing team outside since I am not a bad shot with a disrupter rifle and I would suggest a sort of defensive line for the fire team as the giants will come to them once they start shooting&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T19:44:06-07:00","id":129536,"title":"","content":"Pellias looked to Jin and gave another nod. &quot;How are you for infiltration? If we can, I'd like to be able to shut her defences down somehow.... thinking explosives... but she might get in the way and I'm not confident in my abilities to keep any sorcery at bay.&quot; He looked to Wren, whose reputation was faintly recalled but whom with Pellias had no experience fighting or working with. &quot;And Wren... where do you see yourself fitting into this?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T22:02:20-07:00","id":129618,"title":"","content":"Enien smiles, and says, &quot;Very well, then. Jin, Pellias, and I will infiltrate the compound. However, this leaves Commander Blitzfire and Commander Wren by themselves. Is this acceptable?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T23:06:16-07:00","id":129644,"title":"","content":"In response to Pellias, Jin shrugs, &quot;Passing fair. At least by Sidereal standards.&quot;<br /> <br /> Enien's suggestion is acceptable to Jin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T12:17:25-07:00","id":130062,"title":"","content":"&quot;It sounds acceptable to me.&quot; Wren stated to Enien. &quot;I am not a warrior, really. Not of that kind.&quot; He was a passable martial artist for his age and status, but it was far from his talents.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T20:08:20-07:00","id":131441,"title":"","content":"&quot;Acceptable&quot; he said curtly. &quot;If we're going to do this, quicker seems better. I don't think the <i>Zekka </i>will sit as it is for too long&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T21:03:04-07:00","id":131521,"title":"","content":"&quot;Very well,&quot; Enien says, &quot;If you have shaping defenses, I would use them now,&quot; she says, and peels back a layer of reality, and motions for the others to enter. Once everyone is inside, she enters herself, and closes the layer of reality behind her. Once inside, you find a reality unlike anything you've ever seen. Light flows from below, through wispy veins of sound, and you're surrounded by effervescent clouds of faces, eyes, and noses that all whistle a maddeningly familiar tune that you cannot place a name to. Following along Enien, the scenery shifts to that of a sunny meadow. Except that the sun is a cardboard cutout of the Tyrant Sun, and the grass is dried seaweed cut into the shape of grass. A small turkey waddles, by, save that its body is made up of a human hand outstretched. In the center of this scene is an blonde beauty, a Fae as one can see by her speckled skin and her leonine tail, and you can see that she is in the process of putting on a sailor fuku. When she sees you, she jumps, startled at you intrusion, and then reddens.<br /> <br /> &quot;Don't tell, and please don't judge me,&quot; she says, leaving you to your own devices. Finally, Enien halts, and motions for you to follow. She pushes forward, and a door opens in front of her. You now find yourself in a room of concrete. A terminal is on one wall, and pipes cover the ceiling. You seem to have made it inside.<br /> <br /> (Distraction team)<br /> <br /> Returning to Carmine's dropship, you appraise him of the situation, and he frowns.<br /> <br /> &quot;This changes things considerably. My team and I will rendezvous with the original landing zone party. Feel free to make use of our ship, &quot; he says.<br /> <br /> Explaining the situation to the pilot, and with Tavren's direction, you are flown to a valley of small bushes and sunny skies, a vast difference from the twilight you are now acclimated to. In front of you is Pellias' compex, a massive structure, surrounded by a concrete fence. Sure enough, gigantic pitcher plants are its most defining feature, providing much of the backdrop to the cylindrical main tower.<br /> <br /> Nodding to you, Airi's team of siege engineers begin to unload their payloads upon the structure, which are in turn intercepted by shimmering ripples of Essence. <br /> <br /> &quot;D-dammit, a projection screen,&quot; Airi mutters, pulls out a pair of binoculars, and then frowns.<br /> <br /> &quot;You might want to see this,&quot; she says, handing the tool to Wren and Pellias.<br /> <br /> A man, in perfectly pressed robes, and with immaculately coiffed hair, has climbed to the side of the outer wall, along with a platoon of Watchers. He raises a megaphone to his mouth, and his voices rings out.<br /> <br /> &quot;Will you please stop shooting at us? What do you all want?&quot; he asks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T12:38:41-07:00","id":132624,"title":"","content":"Amelia look's strangely calm despite the setback of the force field &quot; Miss Airi options please we have to take it down by all means &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T15:06:29-07:00","id":132819,"title":"","content":"After waiting a moment, half expecting some crazy klaxon alarm to go off the moment they truly stepped into the complex, Pellias began to scan through his visor. The last thing he wanted to do at this point was get through whatever outer realm they'd passed through unchanged (<i>Am I unchanged?</i> he thought for a split moment) only to bungle it at the get-go. Of particular interest was the opposite terminal, but experience had taught him that booby-traps weren't always baited with the most important feature of a room.<br /> <br /> (Essence-Sight scan of room: Perc+Awareness+2 bonus from suit = <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4498699/\" target=\"_blank\">8 successs</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T07:52:28-07:00","id":133740,"title":"","content":"(Distraction team)<br /> Airi digs into her pack, and pulls out a silver rocket with scribed Old Realm across it's body.<br /> <br /> &quot;Titan-slayer bullet. We only have three of these, but they're Hell on anything that relies on Essence for structure,&quot; she says, and loads it into her cannon. She fires it with adroit accuracy, and the screen shatters, the rocket narrowly missing hitting the dandy on the outer wall. He sighs, and pulls out a bow made of silver wood.<br /> <br /> &quot;You have put this on yourself,&quot; he calls, and fires a brass arrow, which leaves his bow, but doesn't hit anything you can see. Hell, you don't even know where it fell. However, at that, several sections of ground rise before you, revealing gun turrets of various sizes. They all turn on your position, and open fire.<br /> <br /> (Complex Team)<br /> <br /> The scan of the room reveals that the essence flow that is powering the terminal is coming from down below. However, something in the walls is preventing further analysis at this juncture. However, the terminal bursts into life, as a video appears on it. Sitting side by side is the robed woman in glasses from before and a new face; a regal looking young Rusemin woman in purple robes. Despite her noble looks, she is visibly uncomfortable sitting beside this woman.<br /> <br /> &quot;Welcome one and all! I'm your hostess, the incomparable genius, Sable Thesis Dream! Today on this illustrious Haomaday, we've got a right excellent crowd for the Run! About a hundred contestants will make the transit through the Gauntlet, and we'll see if any are capable of gaining that August position of Green Sun Prince! We're already blessed by the presence of that Lord of Putrescence, the Floudering Raffelsia, Furfulu. Also, I am joined by the sixth daughter of the House of Ruse, Princess Icthya Pisce! Princess, do you wish to say a few words?&quot; the robed woman says energetically.<br /> <br /> &quot;E-everyone, please do your best. Take it slow and steady, and please be mindful of your surroundings at all times,&quot; the Rusemin princess says, bowing.<br /> <br /> &quot;You heard it here, folks! Take it slowly and steadily! More to come as the Run commences on Level J4!&quot; the Infernal chuckles, winking at the camera.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T03:12:11-07:00","id":135170,"title":"","content":"<i>Seems like this place comes with its own distractions</i> Pellias thought as he watched the terminal play out the insane announcements. Satisfied that it was not obviously trapped, he walked up to it and began to look for the various input devices open to him without too much breaking-in. <i>Hopefully while the fun is going on, we can steal a map off this thing</i><br /> <br /> ((What sort of a terminal are we looking at here? Keyboard and screen? Big sirens hanging off of it? Last thing Pellias wants to do is alert the sorceress to their presence while he monkeys about. Incidentally, what sort of exits are we looking at in this room?))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T06:34:14-07:00","id":135299,"title":"","content":"(The Terminal itself is a keyboard and what you'd think of as an LED screen attached to the wall. The exits are the door to the immediate right of the terminal, and an air grate in the corner of the room. However, said grate probably wouldn't accommodate a Lawgiver IN power armor. Just saying.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T17:52:21-07:00","id":135956,"title":"","content":"Pellias gingerly takes a few stabs at the keyboard, avoiding specific commands and trying to get a feel for the system setup. While he was aware of the need to be quick given that the outside team was likely already engaging, this wasn't the time for rookie mistakes.<br /> <br /> (Doing a &quot;look before you leap&quot; perc+larc:<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4500839/\" target=\"_blank\"> 5 successes</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T20:11:00-07:00","id":136143,"title":"","content":"The familiar startup noises of Portal 8 plays, and you find yourself on a home menu. The usual icons of &quot;Start&quot;,&quot; Select&quot;, &quot;A&quot;, and &quot;<a href=\"http://youtu.be/R22zSrpeSA4?t=1m46s\" target=\"_blank\">Dennis</a>&quot; are present. You also find the Network function in the lower right corner. Hm. That ought to be interesting...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 05-14-2014, 10:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T20:47:08-07:00","id":136160,"title":"","content":"<i>Alright, no more time to waste. Here goes....</i> he thought as he began to tap away on his armpiece and bring up insertion lines of the <i>Maker's Lockpick</i> code that he could use. It was time to get an overlay map of where they were and any location of traps they could avoid. As convenient a distraction as the &quot;Gauntlet&quot; was to the sorceress, or appeared to be, it also meant that there was more than just their operation in play and they needed to do this as unnoticed as possible.<br /> <br /> He owed it to those on the outside to get them in as soon as he could.<br /> <br /> ((Int+Larc+ 3 successes using larceny excellency for 6m: 4 + 3 (excellency) for a total of <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4500973/\" target=\"_blank\">7 successes</a>))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T05:07:30-07:00","id":136556,"title":"","content":"(Amelia has surprise anticipation method Dietaku does it help or ?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T07:31:23-07:00","id":136687,"title":"","content":"(Infiltration team)<br /> <br /> (That was worth a 1 die stunt, Jotun)<br /> <br /> You search through the menus, until you find a living map of the complex. You're on level K-Z, the lowest level, while the projection room, where the main network terminal is,(And presumably where Sable Thesis Dream and the Princess are), is at the highest section of the tower. You can also see the route that the &quot;Gauntlet&quot; takes is a looping spiral around the central tower, with one detour...Seems like something or someone has been cordoned off in on of the taller sections. Wait, is that movement?<br /> <br /> (Roll Perc+Awareness)<br /> <br /> (Distraction Team)<br /> <br /> That would help, Magnusar. With Amelia's warning, the Distraction team manages to avoid the hail of bullets. For now, at least. Roll Join battle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T14:47:53-07:00","id":137212,"title":"","content":"His eyes darting between the map in front of him on the screen and the miniature version being stored in his suit-arm and on the screen of his visor, Pellias' attention takes a momentary shift to the distraction of movement in the room with them.<br /> <br /> ((Perc+Awareness+2 suit bonus = <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4501841/\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes</a>))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T14:54:31-07:00","id":137215,"title":"","content":"&quot;Perhaps we should release this?&quot; Jin asks Pellias, tapping the screen where the cordoned area is, &quot;It might be willing to help us if we let it go. If not, then at least it might get their attention, draw some heat from our comrades.&quot;<br /> <br /> Jin also gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4501860/\" target=\"_blank\">six successes</a> to notice anything in the room, as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","user":"Noodle","date":". 05-14-2014, 05:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T18:25:48-07:00","id":137453,"title":"","content":"(Distraction Team) <br /> Still waiting on a Join battle, you two.<br /> <br /> (Infiltration team)<br /> <br /> You both notice that the &quot;Dennis&quot; icon shifts its position on the screen, and begins to appear larger, as if moving towards you. Suddenly, the icon, appearing to blot out the rest of the screen, reaches out, and swats at Pellias. What pulls itself out of the screen is a green and black copy of Sable Thesis Dream with the number &quot;03&quot; on its head.<br /> <br /> &quot;Unknown Entities sighted. Identities unknown. Data accessed. Interlopers match Essence-rhythms of interlopers from prior cyber-attack. Engage? Unit-03, proceeding.&quot; it says breathlessly, assuming a feral stance.<br /> <br /> What will you do?<br /> <br /> (Some <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AIMDilzrFjc\" target=\"_blank\">thematic music</a> for you)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T19:44:01-07:00","id":137629,"title":"","content":"Without much hesitation, Pellias draws one of his sidearms and shoots the screen and terminal, unloading white heat into its boards with a practised fluidity. &quot;We got enough to start on&quot; he says over his shoulder to Jin as he assumes a martial stance. &quot;Let the games begin&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T20:56:13-07:00","id":137655,"title":"","content":"(Infiltration Team)<br /> <br /> Very well, roll join battle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T21:04:05-07:00","id":137658,"title":"","content":"(JB roll of <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4502237/\" target=\"_blank\">7 successes</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T07:10:24-07:00","id":138010,"title":"","content":"Jin also gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4502479/\" target=\"_blank\">7 sux</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T07:10:36-07:00","id":138011,"title":"","content":"Wren was a fair bit surprised at the firing, sighing and then preparing himself. It was time to get serious, after all.<br /> <br /> (Join battle: Three <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/193282\" target=\"_blank\">successes</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T14:22:07-07:00","id":138394,"title":"","content":"<br /> Amelia gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4503233/\" target=\"_blank\">6 sux</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T21:01:41-07:00","id":138866,"title":"","content":"(Infiltration team)<br /> <br /> Very well, you both act concurrently, then Dennis, then Enien.<br /> <br /> (Distraction Team)<br /> <br /> The turn order is Amelia, the Robed Dandy, Wren, and then the Watchers and guns.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T13:04:10-07:00","id":139662,"title":"","content":"Amelia grunt &quot;So you want to play rough !!! Okay let's play, Miss Airi use the smoke projector cannon on these turrets and the rest take cover and keep shooting at the pitcher plant do not hit the main structure&quot; She shoulders her long Disrupter and fire (Amelia activates Panoptic Fusion discipline for 3 motes and Trance of unhesitating speed for 8 motes and gets 4 attack at her full dice pool against the dandy and Suprise anticipation method cost 1 mote for a total of 12 motes of peripheral Essence used) ( Dietaku did we get to recover any essence on the way ?) (Amelia's attack <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4504101/\" target=\"_blank\">1</a> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4504104/\" target=\"_blank\">2</a> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4504104/\" target=\"_blank\">3</a> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4504107/\" target=\"_blank\">4</a> with a base damage of 7L / Piercing )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T18:47:28-07:00","id":140133,"title":"","content":"&quot;Aim high,&quot; Jin coms to Pellias, before ducking down and making a low sweep kick towards Dennis' legs. <br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4504462/\" target=\"_blank\">7 success</a> for the kick, with a base damage of 14B. <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4504465/\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a> to impose a coordinated attack penalty to Dennis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-17T20:31:15-07:00","id":141193,"title":"","content":"(Distraction Team)<br /> <br /> (I assumed you have topped off Essence pools, Magnusar)<br /> <br /> The first three shots bounce off a hidden bubble of power, and the dandy laughs, until he's grazed by the last. He screams, and clutches his face. <br /> <br /> &quot;You! How dare you wreck my sublime face! ME! Flawless Acacia! Oh, how DARE you!&quot; he squeals, until, just as abruptly he began, he stops, preens his hair, and then begins to dance. He dances a short dance, repeating the mantra &quot;Kai-yan volento, volento, Mocchto, Mocchto.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that, his entourage of assembled Watchers double over, twisting into terrible shades.<br /> <br /> Wren's turn.<br /> <br /> (Infiltration Team)<br /> <br /> Jin's attack connects, and the satisfying crack of broken bone comes with his solid kick. However, instead of falling, she stands in place, floating at the same height that she stood.<br /> <br /> What will you do, Jotun?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-18T05:54:09-07:00","id":141473,"title":"","content":"Pellias unloads a double-shot combo into the upper area of Dennis with his drawn blaster, a fluid motion borne of years of practice married supernatural guidance and body. It wasn't until he took a lightning-shift of weight back on one leg and drew his rifle out like a ribbon, too fast for a normal human. <br /> <br /> The two shots barely had time to echo before the slick and almost silent SHOOK of the <i>Maker's Golden Stare</i> went off like a small star exploding in Dennis' front.<br /> <br /> (Doing a three part flurry, two with the pistol and one with the rifle, making usage of my free switch with Dance of Bow and Blade to let the big rifle shot finish things off:<br /> <br /> Blaster 1 (6L): (-3 flurry) + (2 Acc) + 10 =<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4506127/\" target=\"_blank\"> 4 successes </a><br /> Blaster 2 (6L): (-4 flurry) + (2 Acc) + 10 = <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4506128/\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes</a> <br /> Orichalcum Godcannon 3 (11L/3) : (-5 flurry) + (4 Acc) + 10 = <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4506129/\" target=\"_blank\">5 successes</a> )<br /> <br /> ((apologies for the pause, unexpectedly hectic weekend with no long periods to sit down with my material)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-18T10:18:39-07:00","id":141678,"title":"","content":"Sweetsong Wren made simple motions, his soulgem glowing dimly as he activated a charm-he had no distance weapons and so he took a defensive tack. They now had a name. Time it right... 5m spent for Joy in Adversity stance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T09:48:34-07:00","id":143617,"title":"","content":"(Distraction Team)<br /> <br /> Alright. The watcher-shades all rush forward, and assault Amelia. They attack her with claws and clubs, but Amelia's Orichalcum armor protects her from their aggression. However, a sudden calm, and Wren notices a large shape, like an saffron egg, if the chicken was the size of a house, hovering over Amelia. The egg's surface ripples and two massive arms burst forth, swinging at both Amelia and Wren.<br /> <br /> &quot;Miss me, Love? Mistress Dream gave me this present because I was such a <b><i>good</i></b> girl! This. Is. The <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Archemizer</span>!&quot; a familiar teenaged voice calls out from the egg.<br /> <br /> Airi then fires the Smoke Projection Cannon at the floating super-weapon, and after several seconds, the weapon doesn't seem to be having any effect. <br /> <br /> &quot;Kyahahahaha! The <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Archemizer</span> is made up of several Metodies! No magical shaping attack will work on it! Its form is its own design!&quot; Zephyr laughs, as the egg transmogrifies into a large muscular humanoid shape whose face is an abstract mask. <br /> <br /> (Amelia is struck with an unexpected attack (From Zephyr's Thousandfold Typhoon Hand) with a base success of 1 after Hardness and a damage of 17B. What will you do?)<br /> <br /> The guns begin to ring out once more, but only hit a few of the Dragonblood soldiers. <br /> <br /> Amelia's go next.<br /> <br /> (Infiltration Team) <br /> <br /> Dennis is struck down by Pellias' shots, and with a strange, electric liquid bleeding from her perforated body, she falls over and lies still before dissipating into Essence.<br /> <br /> Enien opens the doors gingerly, and is then buffeted by a blast of wind, as the sound of a voice singing,&quot; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qgUfIAnBNwI\" target=\"_blank\"> Can you feel my voice? Can you feel my soul? No matter how far apart, I'll always be with yooooou~&quot;</a>.&quot;<br /> <br /> Enien then looks to Pellias and Jin, and says, &quot;Something large and moving at high speed. Some sort of war machine?&quot;<br /> <br /> What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T12:31:43-07:00","id":143787,"title":"","content":"Amelia quickly recover from the blow before standing in front of the Archemizer feeling the essence flow in her body.<br /> <br /> &quot;I had hoped I would see you again Zephyr oh yes you stayed in a corner of my mind always present for the short time we where apart do know why ? Because you're like me you love to kill, blood is calling you just as it's calling me and now your blood is calling me with a soft voice almost whispering in my hears to kill you. You introduced yourself but I didn't allow me to correct that. I am Amelia Blitzfire chosen of the dawn and your little Hellstrider WILL NOT PROTECT YOU FROM ME !!!!!! &quot;<br /> <br /> Amelia's voice seem to be distorted as the great dragon that reside in her soul appears emerging from the bonfire of essence around her,standing proud and terrifying as her anima flares to full totemic. Grabbing the Maker's Edge with both hands Amelia leap into the air before performing a front flip to add more power behind her blow as she strike at the hellstrider.<br /> (Amelia spends 10 motes from her Overdrive pool to add 9 dice to her attack roll and activate Hungry tiger technique rolling 27 dice and scoring <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4508507/\" target=\"_blank\">12 sux</a> with a base damage of 12L/2 also her PDV is now at 10 with her anima banner active)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 05-20-2014, 03:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T16:08:12-07:00","id":143932,"title":"","content":"(Distraction Team)<br /> <br /> &quot;Eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeh? Love to kill? I don't love to kill. Murder is my duty. The duty of one who has achieved Enlightenment and knows Truth. Humans, Dragon Kings, Rusemin, Santaegos, Alaun, Mezzeren, Krrteff? They all war and fight, kill and peck at the dirt in their ways, ignorant to the Truth. This is my mission. To slay the unthinking, unliving masses, to provide them with release so they may be given another chance. A chance to achieve transcendence and know the Truth. That is my duty, and one I share no love for. Do you know what humans are made of? Meat, guts, and offal. They smell terrible and taste even worse, but the Wind commands, and I obey...&quot; Zephyr says, as Amelia lashes out at her, striking true. However, she still stands, as the viscous body of the <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Archemizer</span> rebuilds itself. <br /> <br /> &quot;That is why I picked you. You are most in need of my ministrations,&quot; Zephyr says, licking up the blood from the gash that Amelia delivered to her through the Hellstrider's feedback wires,&quot; Now come at me with your so-called &quot;Killer's Instinct,&quot; you animal!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Now, now, Zephyr, don't play with people. They can't understand your words, let along what you're trying to tell them. They're no Meta-Theologians, after all,&quot; Flawless Acacia says, hopping on the <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Archemizer</span>'s back. He lets loose another arrow, which disappears as well.<br /> <br /> (Wren's turn)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T21:34:54-07:00","id":144110,"title":"","content":"(Infiltration team)<br /> <br /> Looking outside, you find a large corridor with a large rolling door on one end, several doors parallel to your own, and an elevator. What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T21:39:31-07:00","id":144138,"title":"","content":"Jin will search for the exact source of the noise. If it is indeed a war machine of some kind, it may help take some of the heat off the Distraction team. <br /> <br /> Jin rolls Perception+Awareness, getting <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4508914/\" target=\"_blank\">7 sux</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T22:20:20-07:00","id":144176,"title":"","content":"Though he was feeling like he was just warming up after shooting down Dennis, Pellias had to pause for a moment when Enien opened the door to the buffet of wind. &quot;Part of the gauntlet, I wonder?&quot; he mused as he looked to Jin, the voice lingering in the air. &quot;Something we can turn to our advantage, hopefully&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T08:07:35-07:00","id":144480,"title":"","content":"(Infiltration Team)<br /> The exact noise that you heard; the song being sung, has long since vanished. However, you can hear something garbled, like a person's voice coming from behind the rolling shutters. <br /> <br /> Enien shrugs, &quot;I've never met this Sable Thesis Dream, so I can't say. If we were in the South, I would be of more help. Sorry, though,&quot; she mumbles, and begins to look around herself. She finds a terminal folded into the wall, nearby the elevator.<br /> <br /> &quot;We can go through the elevator there, or follow this corridor,&quot; She says, pointing to where the noise left,&quot; And that will take us outside into the path of the Gauntlet, as it seems to be on this map. Or, we can go up the stairs, through there,&quot; Enien finishes, pointing to the shutters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-21T22:33:11-07:00","id":145320,"title":"","content":"&quot;Elevator is no good; being trapped with no exits isn't something I want to encounter right now.&quot; He looked to Jin and, though unseeable, gave a smile. &quot;Looks like we get some exercise&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Ready for a little excitement and action?&quot; he said to Enien wryly as he fixed his rifle back and switched to the more manoeuvrable sidearms.<br /> <br /> ((had a FF7 Shinra tower flashback here....))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T08:44:34-07:00","id":145686,"title":"","content":"(Truth be told, I've never played FF7. I just have it from the INTERNET in general all the important bits (Cloud cross-dressing, Aeris dies, Sephiroth is an alien clone, etc, etc, etc, etc.) and kinda rolled with it. I always wanted to play it, but never really had the means to do so, lacking a PSX.)<br /> <br /> Opening the shutters, you find yourself in a large room. This one, however, dwarfs the corridor you were in, a massive football stadium-sized space with three war machines standing before you. The first is a red-jade armored beast, with eyes that follow you around the room, and possess wicked claws. The second is an unearthly figure seemingly made out of writhing worms, and the third in a gold and black figure with fog billowing out of its body at random intervals. The sound you heard earlier is a humanoid torso off this last machine, a woman seemingly fused to the warstrider, humming a meandering tune. She waves to you with a hand with far too many fingers, continuing on her strange tune.<br /> <br /> After marveling at the sight before her, Enien turns, and says,&quot; Something's here.&quot; At that, a rat scurries out of the machinery linked to the three Hellstriders, and, after pausing and taking in the newcomers, shifts seamlessly into that of a man.<br /> <br /> (Kelsyk, your'e free to act now)<br /> <br /> (Infiltration team)<br /> <br /> It's Wren's turn to act.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T16:10:37-07:00","id":146141,"title":"","content":"Quick question, would Jarsiln be able to recognize Enien as an infernal?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","name":"kelsyk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T16:28:32-07:00","id":146149,"title":"","content":"Not intrinsically, I don't think, although he could probably recognize her uniform. (No one has offered new clothing, after all :/)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T17:07:38-07:00","id":146173,"title":"","content":"The dark brown fur of his rat form vanishes as the Jarsiln Shifts to human. In its place is pale skin covered in simple silvery lamellar armour and a pair of metallic bracers on his arms. Along his back is strapped a large metal boomerang, which is quickly unstrapped and held ready for battle.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well this is unexpected, few people notice me when I'm small.&quot; His tone is friendly, even joking but his expression never wavers from wary curiosity. As he looks over the people in front of him, his eyes linger on one power armoured figure. &quot;You seem familiar somehow. Who are you?&quot;<br /> <br /> (I had a background point left over and it was suggested I get solar bond. If you don't mind Jotun I will designate Pellias as Jarsiln's solar mate. Also where are the rules for the elemental core your character has?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","name":"kelsyk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T23:42:07-07:00","id":146464,"title":"","content":"Wren looked up at the changing form, figuring out what to actually do with it. He took a dancer's stance and launched himself at it, a small smile on his face. How close could he get? Could he manage his small technique?<br /> <br /> ((<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/196008\" target=\"_blank\">One success</a>))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T08:05:38-07:00","id":146743,"title":"","content":"(Distraction Team)<br /> <br /> Wren manages to leap onto the <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Archemizer</span>, but he now has the terrible problem; he's now hanging onto a machine made up of corrosive, transmutive elementals. That's probably not good.<br /> <br /> (Roll Sta+Resistance)<br /> <br /> The shades then resume their assault, Alas, they're no more effective than they were before, and don't even hit. The guns fare no better, doing no damage to the DB troops.<br /> <br /> (Amelia's turn)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T13:14:05-07:00","id":147054,"title":"","content":"(<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/196139\" target=\"_blank\">No successes</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T16:43:33-07:00","id":147287,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm Valiar Jin,&quot; Jin replies, &quot;Assigned to the Gunstar Defense Line General Staff, Intelligence Division.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Your armor looks familiar to me. You're a Void Hunt Shikari, aren't you?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T22:04:00-07:00","id":147581,"title":"","content":"(Distraction Team)<br /> <br /> Ouch. Wren's hands and feet burn with agony as they touch the Thien-To of the <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Archemizer</span>'s body, and as his robes brush up against it, they, too begin to steam, with strange glowing veins beginning to etch their way up and about his person. However! He can feel his limbs grow new strength and vigor in spite of this pain. In fact, were this a game with such a growth mechnic, you could say they &quot;Leveled up.&quot; <br /> <br /> (Wren takes 2B damage, but he gains an internal bonus of +1 to any and all rolls involving his arms and legs, as the Thien-To has transmuted away some of his weakness. Also, his robes have become Exceptional-level equipment. )<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T10:53:33-07:00","id":147969,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yes sir. I think I have heard of you before. Chosen of Secrets, or was it it Endings. I don't remember which. I'm Jarsiln, I was sent to scout ahead of the <i>Radical Mendicant Zekka'</i>s mission. I assume that is you guys. I though there would be more of you.&quot;<br /> <br /> As he spoke, Jarsiln slowly relaxed a bit, but did not put away his weapon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","name":"kelsyk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T14:35:36-07:00","id":148138,"title":"","content":"<i>What is this fool doing he's gonna get kill I better wrap this up quickly</i> <br /> <br /> Amelia doesn't even waste one tenth of a second when her feet touches the ground she start moving running at the hellstrider passing between it's legs and jumping in the air to get to archer as she unleash two vicious strike with her chainklaive and giving a descending third strike at the hellstrider a she passes over it.<br /> <br /> (Amelia unleash a flurry of three strikes two against the archer and one at the Archemizer, so if I remember correctly the first as a 3 dice penalty, the second 4 dice penalty and the third as a 5 dice penalty. First attack scores <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4512684/\" target=\"_blank\">13 success </a>!? o.O Second attack scores <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4512686/\" target=\"_blank\">7 success</a> and finally the third attack scores<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4512688/\" target=\"_blank\"> 7 success </a>too she also attvates Hungry tiger technique for all three attacks at a cost of three motes of peripheral essence)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T22:41:41-07:00","id":148401,"title":"","content":"&quot;What were you planning on doing with these?&quot; Pellias said sharply to Jarsiln as he gestured to the three war machines and selectively failed to answer his identity to the shapechanger.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-25T07:09:05-07:00","id":148677,"title":"","content":"&quot;I wasn't planning on doing anything with these at the moment,&quot; replied Jarsiln as he waved a hand at the Hellstriders. &quot;As I said earlier I was sent to scout the area. Sabatoge isn't my mission, or my area of expertise.&quot;<br /> <br /> Jarsiln paused a moment looking at Pellias, &quot;and you didn't answer my question: who are you?&quot;<br /> <br /> (If we decide this is our first meeting then you can introduce yourself, if it isn't our first meeting then perhaps you got new/changed the look of your armour since our last meeting or you weren't wearing it that time.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","name":"kelsyk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-25T13:42:28-07:00","id":148915,"title":"","content":"(Distraction Team)<br /> <br /> Flawless Acacia puts up in his hand to protect himself, and Amelia's strikes causes a spray of sparks as her autoklaive breaches his shield bubble. A moment of tense silence, and then Flawless Acacia's arm explodes into a bloody stump, The one swing Amelia takes at the <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Archemizer</span> is quickly batted aside by the rippling sheathe of Thien-To that comprises its body. <br /> <br /> Acacia doubles over, clutching the stump of his arm, says, &quot;I leave this to you, Zephyr&quot; and melts into shadow, which glides off. <br /> <br /> Zephyr cackles, and a stream of smaller, human-sized limbs sprout out of the hellstrider's body, grabbing at Wren. Zephyr's clinch attempt rolls 10 successes(!). What will Wren do?<br /> <br /> (Wren's turn.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T04:26:48-07:00","id":149308,"title":"","content":"&quot;Pellias'&quot; he said tapping away on his wrist panels, fingers moving through a small-scale map of the complex, and began to shimmer slightly as his camouflage went through a prep cycle. &quot;We're team 'Need to Go Before Our Friends Get Overwhelmed', and we're recruiting. Great to meet you Jarsiln; since you've scouted, how about giving us a hand putting some targets to these maps we've downloaded? Security stations and defence systems sound like a good start...&quot;<br /> <br /> He began to gaze down his rifle sights at the vital-looking points of the armours, in particular the singing figure and the following eyes. &quot;Anyone want to try to use these, or should we put a few dents in some key places before we move on?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T10:49:47-07:00","id":149529,"title":"","content":"To be honest, that kind of burning earns a screech of agony. Sidereals are known as sublimely talented at not being where they don't want to be-unfortunately, Wren was in a bad spot and full well knew it. The dodge charms he has are not useful and he knew he had a quite slim chance of avoiding them. He knew he could not avoid all of the hands coming for him, yet... he could not give up. He moved quickly, in spite of his disadvantage-here it came!<br /> <br /> (<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/196828\" target=\"_blank\">Two successes</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T16:00:08-07:00","id":149768,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well, they would put some pretty big dents into things,&quot; Jin says, &quot;I'm for using them.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T16:13:53-07:00","id":149777,"title":"","content":"(Infiltration Team) <br /> <br /> &quot;I hate to break you two up from your discovery of friendship and love,&quot; Enien says, quietly to the others, &quot;But we have company.&quot;<br /> <br /> A trio of figures, similar to the Dennis-03 Pellias gunned down are floating in midair. <br /> <br /> &quot;Confirmed, confirmed. Unit-03 is inactive. Awaiting body repair,&quot; One, with a large &quot;02&quot; on their forehead.<br /> <br /> &quot;Affirmative. However, new data confirms Hypothesis; that prior attacker is a Solar Exalt. Essence patterns in line with known data. Proceed with Level 4 Charm access. Permission granted?&quot; another asked, with a large &quot;04&quot; on her head.<br /> <br /> &quot;Permission confirmed. Administrator permission granted. Sweep level and proceed with caution. Grant permission to activate Distinctive Empirical Neural Network Information Sentry-01?&quot; Dennis-05 asks.<br /> <br /> &quot;Negative. Administrator comments,&quot;What the Hell are you thinking? Proceed with given units,&quot;&quot; Dennis-02 responds. The trio then begin to float around, looking blankly in all directions. They haven't noticed you yet. What will you do?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T16:23:31-07:00","id":149790,"title":"","content":"(Distraction team)<br /> <br /> Wren makes a great leap, but his ankle is grabbed by one of the myriad of hands, and he is dragged into the gelatinous body of the <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Archemizer</span>. There is stuck for the time being, half submerged into the hellstrider.<br /> <br /> &quot;Now, I have a proposition for you, Solar. Drop your pretty sword, and I'll let your friend go. Or I can show you what being crushed under ten tons of Thien-To looks like,&quot; Zephyr calls, as the Dragonblooded unit behind Amelia pauses, unsure if to continue firing and risk hitting Wren or to do ask Zephyr asks.<br /> <br /> (Well, Magnusar? What will you do? Alternatively, will Wren pull some shenanigans, Palemask?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T16:32:48-07:00","id":149795,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Noodle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/60177-ic-exalted-gunstar-to-boldly-go?p=149768#post149768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Well, they would put some pretty big dents into things,&quot; Jin says, &quot;I'm for using them.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>(Dag-burn Ninja-Sids. I didn't see that post.)<br /> <br /> Alright, then, Tough Boy, what 'Strider are you going to board?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-27T09:18:39-07:00","id":150425,"title":"","content":"Jarsiln glanced quickly between the Hellstriders and the incoming figures, before looking back at the group.<br /> <br /> &quot;I was never trained to use those things,&quot; Jarsiln quietly whispered. &quot;I can try to distract them while you gets suited up, but you'll have to hurry. I don't like the idea of facing down multiple oppenonts who's abilities I'm not sure of.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","name":"kelsyk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-27T15:04:01-07:00","id":150840,"title":"","content":"&quot;And why would you want me to surrender you said you were gonna murder me not a minute ago&quot; She would never say it out loud but Amelia is far too proud to surrender.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-27T16:52:15-07:00","id":150888,"title":"","content":"Wren honestly shrieked when he ended up half-buried in Theion-To. His hair hung and he looked 'down' at the strider. One thing his teachers had taught him when teaching him martial arts was 'don't assume you have an advantage over an opponent'. Even a kicked dog will bite and even a puny human can do something to those who seem greater-such was the distance between himself and the Infernal.<br /> <br /> And so he began to pray and trace the Greater Sign of Saturn upon the Archemizer. From elsewhere came a very large, very angry, very hot and fast steam deva. He hoped that he wouldn't get hit, in any case or he was likely dead. He went limp, exhaustion overtaking him at the exertion.<br /> <br /> (Activating Chains of Adorjan as per agreed on deviations-5 damage for three turns. <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/197209\" target=\"_blank\">Two successes on Paradox dice</a>.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T08:32:18-07:00","id":151320,"title":"","content":"(Whelp, that's a 3 die stunt thar, Palemask. Also, you got me to check my MoEP: Infernals, and I've been writing it wrong all this time. It is indeed Theion-To. Geez, I feel sheepish now.)<br /> <br /> &quot;I like you, Dear Golden Flower, and I'd hate for this to end so soon. After all, I--&quot; Zephyr managed, before her captive began his rite, and a great steaming mass surrounds the <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Archemizer</span>.<br /> <br /> Baprath the Devourer, elder god of Smoke, one of Autocthon's first creations, a powerful tool of cleansing and rebirth, his vapors boil the Metody-flesh of the hellstrider, and Zephyr's cries of confusion and pain ring out like a clarion-call, dropping Wren out of harm's way. Under the strain of the assault, the hellstrider wheezes, and finally evaporates, unable to withstand the touch of Baprath. out of the clearing smoke, though, is an unusual sight.Scarlet Sephyr stands there, surrounded by a cycle of moving pictures and the faint glow of a halo about her head.<br /> <br /> The pictures tell of a young girl on a distant planet, whose parents died of plague. On their windswept planet of hard rock, the girl was treated with deference and respect, a holy woman in training, whose eccentricities were tolerated due to the power she wielded in dealings with God and Daeva. However...<br /> <br /> A pale, towering figure of stunning masculine beauty; the Alabaster Effigy of Glamor, appeared on her planet, and demanded that the natives build a tower to His magnificence. The girl, with no one to defend her, was taken as a slave for the construction. There, the girl saw her neighbors suffering greatly, and gave them the mercy of release from their pains. This brought her higher and higher up the tower until she was face to face with the Effigy. Impressed with her tenacity and beauty in spite of her years of turnoil, the Effigy offered her a new opportunity.<br /> <br /> &quot;Become my Champion, and I will make this planet a paradise the likes of which you can only dream.&quot;<br /> <br /> The girl responded by tearing off the jade nail that held the capstone in place, and leaping off the tower as it collapsed. However, instead of dying terribly, the Wind grabbed her, and granted her the Exaltation due to her holiness.<br /> <br /> &quot;You done marveling at my past? The Mandala of Hermit's Life has some embarrassing side effects,&quot; Zephyr says, wiping the blood off her brow,&quot; I will concede defeat today, but know this, Love; you'll face my ministrations sooner or later.&quot; she then leaps off, running off into the sky. With the disappearance of both their commanders, the shades slink off, leaving the battlefield.<br /> <br /> The Distraction Team is victorious! What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 05-30-2014, 12:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T17:18:33-07:00","id":151836,"title":"","content":"(Infiltration Team)<br /> <br /> Alright, then, Kelsyk, what will you do to distract the DENNISes?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T17:44:06-07:00","id":151863,"title":"","content":"As Amelia see Zephyr walks away in the sky she feels kinda empty it's not a real victory to her but at the same time she feels happy they will see each other again and then they will fight and then she will see if Zephyr is what she claims to be.<br /> <br /> <i>We'll see each other soon I hope.</i><br /> <br /> She grabs Wren and pull him in behind cover as he still a bit woozy she passes one of her underneath his shoulder as she drags him back to heir line.<br /> <br /> &quot; You heard that Wren I think she likes me and I think I beginning to like you, that was some trick you pulled there&quot;<br /> <br /> As she rejoins Airi and the DB Amelia hope that the others have had better luck but she as a job to do and they need that distraction.<br /> <br /> &quot; I want heavy fire on those pitcher plant and destroy those turrets OPEN FIRE !!! &quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 05-28-2014, 09:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T11:48:48-07:00","id":152743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/60177-ic-exalted-gunstar-to-boldly-go?p=145686#post145686\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The second is an unearthly figure seemingly made out of writhing worms</div> </div> </div> </div>Jin is going to get into this one. He rolls <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4517471/\" target=\"_blank\">5 successes</a> for Wits+Lore to attune to the 'Strider, and <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4517475/\" target=\"_blank\">5 successes</a> again for the Wits+Ride to get the feel for it's movements and controls.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T12:55:20-07:00","id":152862,"title":"","content":"(Distraction team)<br /> The Dargonblood team opens fire, blasting the wall and the pitcher plants, and after blasting the outlying pitcher plants, an explosion rocks Airi, and she collapses, blood streaming from her face.<br /> <br /> (Infiltration team)<br /> <br /> Jin succeeds in finding the cockpit of the hellstrider, and after climbing abord, succeeds in attuning to it, as a starmetal probe writhes around and aettles on his head. An electric feeling runs down his spine, as the screens before him blink on with the words &quot;Neural connection established. Tannicks Online&quot;<br /> <br /> With that, a projected image of Sable Thesis Dream appears, and says, &quot;Hello, Zephyr. This is the Tannicks Swift Siege Weapon Hellstrider. I know how much you liked Tannieh Gan Edam, so I made this in honor of your....girlish fascination with it (I wish you'd clean up your models, but...) The Tannicks, much like Tannieh, can assume any form of any weapon you can imagine, with the neural connection allowing for instant thought assumption and recognition. However! I forbid you from activating the Starlight Dragonfly,&quot; she says, pointing to a blinking button on your left,&quot; At least on-planet. I can't be arsed rebuilding this place should you wipe it off the map. Again. So, have fun! I made this for you, after all!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 05-29-2014, 03:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T10:58:23-07:00","id":154018,"title":"","content":"&quot;Okay, distraction it is.&quot;<br /> <br /> As Jin moved towards the Hellstriders Jarsiln shifted into his spirit form and bounded away from the others. Once he had moved some distance away, he began to rattle machinery and make as much noise as he could to attract the Dennises attention.<br /> <br /> &quot;I really hope the others get those machines running quick, because if I have to use plan B it is really going to suck for me,&quot; Jarsiln thought to himself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","name":"kelsyk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T11:38:40-07:00","id":154063,"title":"","content":"Wren made vague motions. &quot;Ah, lovely.&quot; He murmured. &quot;We all have gifts, Amelia and next time I'm screaming like a mortal and jumping for cover.&quot; He smiled and went wide-eyed and pale at Airi's sudden bloodiness. &quot;Oh, in the name of the Maidens-&quot; He walked wobbily over to her, checking her over.<br /> <br /> (<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/197962\" target=\"_blank\">Medical diagnosis: two successes</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T15:33:12-07:00","id":155244,"title":"","content":"<i>A great where did this came from</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Keep firing, Wren you stay here with them I'm going in. Now that the defenses have been breached we need to keep attacking, keep bombarding the place. Fire a few shots at the main building but only low level payload nothing that will bring the place down for another 2 minutes than fall back to the transport, get ready to come in and await my orders If I do not give news in 20 minutes come in gun blazing no quarter understood ? &quot;<br /> <br /> Amelia giving start running towards the base.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 05-31-2014, 06:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T18:23:05-07:00","id":155336,"title":"","content":"Lowering his sidearm as Jin began to move towards the Mechs was quickly followed, as if on queue, by a reflexive shift to essence-invisibility as the security entities named the DENNISes entered. The shapeshifter making a run into visual obscurity was all the heads-up that Pellias needed; if Jin was going to try this gambit, what precious little time that could be allowed would be useful. <br /> <br /> Moving away from the Titanic-exalt, Pellias padded quickly to a vantage point on one side of the hanger. He felt a pang of exhaustion to come as an <i>Eye</i> whirred off his side and into existence, quickly moving towards the area where the sounds in the room were being created and engaging in what paltry evasive manoeuvres it could summon.<br /> <br /> ((creating an immaterial <i>Eye</i> as both a visual aid and a distraction to the DENNISes. I like to think of it as a tiny rodeo clown about to be gored for the greater good))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T22:12:09-07:00","id":155452,"title":"","content":"(Distraction Team)<br /> Wren can see that Airi is alive and breathing, but she's got a number of cuts on her head, and she is suffering from a concussion. Good thing she's an Exalt, otherwise she may have lost a few pounds, haha!<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, Amelia finds herself at an opening in the outer wall made by the bombardment, Peering down, she can see a marshy swampland below, with the ruined pitcher plant bulbs all round her. The chirping of insects and various other swamp noises surround her. Wait, what is that...keening?<br /> <br /> (Infiltration team)<br /> Jarsiln's distractions bring all the DENNISes down on the machines he's rattling, as they float over, and bisect the devices with lances of emerald light, like a chef serving up choice cuts of ham.<br /> <br /> However, with the emergence of the Eye, 02 pauses and says,&quot; Essence Patterns match Lawgiver who destroyed 01's body. Engage?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Confirmed. Exterminate with extreme prejudice,&quot; 04 replied, and the Eye was pierced by the same emerald lance of light.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-01T16:57:38-07:00","id":156088,"title":"","content":"(My character likley wouldn't know but I am curious. It is mentioned that something special had to be done to prevent the primordials from tracking the Gunstar based on prayers of people inside it. Could they track the prayers offered to other gods if the prayee was outside the Gunstar?)<br /> <br /> &quot;Note to self: rattle then move, don't keep rattling,&quot; Jarsiln thought to himself as the debris of from the machinery fell down around him. Jarsiln took advantage of the distraction provided by the Eye to creep away to a different bit of machinery, this time not rattling any of it. Once there he paused to observe the DENNISes and determine where their attention was. &quot;I hope they get those Hellstriders working soon, because I may not get so lucky again.&quot;<br /> <br /> If a stealth roll is required during this move:<br /> 10, 7, 3, 2, 5, 7, 5, 2, 8, 7 = 5 success","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","name":"kelsyk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T11:51:18-07:00","id":156794,"title":"","content":"Wren took a moment to care for his comrade, staunching the flow of blood and taking measures against the concussion-she'd heal fast, but it would be faster and safer with a bit of treatment. &quot;Here we go, Madame Airi.&quot; He spoke soothingly, a tired smile on his face. He let Amelia go and focused on treating Airi for the time being-once he was done, he stood up, shaky.<br /> <br /> &quot;A soft place to faint would be nice.&quot; He smiled jovially, laughing lightly, facing others about him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T17:25:19-07:00","id":157113,"title":"","content":"(You got 6 successes, Kelsyk, as the 10 is 2 successes. Also, it is within the Titans' power to notice the prayers, but probably won't notice any you do make. Yet.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">At least you hope not, Mortal. The Caravan of Balloons is onto your misdeeds.</span>)<br /> <br /> (Infiltration Team)<br /> <br /> The DENNISes pursuing Jarsiln pauses, and look around. They seem to have lost your scent. They gather together, and begin chattering to one another again.<br /> <br /> (Distraction Team)<br /> <br /> Wren has managed to stop Airi's wounds, and she begins breathing soundly, as if in sleep.<br /> <br /> &quot;We got her, Commander,&quot; Ragara Geigar says, &quot;You can rest up now. We'll hold the line.&quot;<br /> <br /> A medic offers Wren some pills for his exhaustion, while Amelia notices that the wailing is getting nearer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T18:20:08-07:00","id":157171,"title":"","content":"Taking a few tentative steps n the Tannicks, testing out its balance and motion. Zeroing in on the clustered DENNISes, Jen grins wolfishly, flexing the war-machines fingers in anticipation. <br /> <br /> He will wait a few moments, hoping that they take Pellias' bait. If they do (or don't do anything for a bit) he will leap out at them, and attempt to smash them with the 'Strider's massive fists unawares. He gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4522552/\" target=\"_blank\">10 successes</a> to attack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T18:36:26-07:00","id":157191,"title":"","content":"(Infiltration team)<br /> <br /> The attack takes the DENNISes completely by surprise, and smashes poor Unit-02 into the nearby wall. She falls to the ground, coating the wall in blood, oil and a strange, crackling clear liquid.<br /> <br /> Alright, Gents, Ladies and Ladies who dress as Gents: IT'S JOIN BATTLE TIME!<br /> <br /> (Some thematic <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t3uP-mzLR9A\" target=\"_blank\">battle music</a>.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 06-02-2014, 09:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T00:38:27-07:00","id":157605,"title":"","content":"Pellias felt a little sting of fatigue as another <i>Eye</i> bit the dust all too quickly; <i>'That being said,'</i> he thought as he watched Jin smash one of the security entities into the wall <i>'a fine distraction it turned out to be'. </i>Staring down the scope of his rifle, he breathed out to steady himself for what he hoped would be a quick fight.<br /> <br /> ((a paltry 3 <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4522862/\" target=\"_blank\">successes</a> on the JB roll))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T06:35:13-07:00","id":157773,"title":"","content":"(Join battle: 6, 2, 3, 4 = 0 success)<br /> (Since I want to stay concealed do I need another stealth roll?)<br /> <br /> Jarsiln took advantage of the distraction affored by the Hellstriders attack to shift back to human form and ready himself for battle.<br /> <br /> &quot;No more running and hiding, it's time to serve some righteous justice to these servants of the Primordeals,&quot;Jarsiln thought to himself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","name":"kelsyk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T09:24:24-07:00","id":157934,"title":"","content":"(You're fine. You rolled pretty well last time, so you maintain your stealth, Kelsyk.)<br /> <br /> Noodle, we need a JB roll, man.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T09:47:07-07:00","id":157971,"title":"","content":"Jin gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4523274/\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T10:11:13-07:00","id":157986,"title":"","content":"Alrighty, then.<br /> <br /> Enien then strikes a stance, parting the wild horse's mane, as she seems ready to parry or evade any attack as a flowery aura of love seems to emanate from her. <br /> <br /> The battle order is Pellias/Jin concurrently, then Enien, then Kelsyk, then the DENNISes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T11:41:27-07:00","id":158079,"title":"","content":"Jin leaps up with the 'Strider, aiming a downward elbow-strike towards the nearest DENNIS. As he falls, he shouts, &quot;Glorious Divine Seer: Ministerial Judgement Fist!&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Not taking any Stunt dice into account (I seriously doubt that that merits any) Jin gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4523388/\" target=\"_blank\">5 successes</a> to attack. Oh, well. I can't have good dice luck all the time; the pattern spiders might get PO'd at me.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T11:46:25-07:00","id":158082,"title":"","content":"Wren accepted the pills with gratitude, finding a corner to meditate in. He took deep breaths, pushing out all thought, all emotion. In. Out. Focus on prana. He slowly focused from the bottom to his feet to his head, slowly relaxing every muscle in his body. Breathe in. Breathe out. Thus his rest went.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T17:56:22-07:00","id":158461,"title":"","content":"Taking the advantage of both his essence-invisibility and preparation, Pellias began to scope out the unwounded DENNIS not targeted by Jin and took a silent breath in before pushing out entirely, his whole body still as he lined his sight on the security entity that was about to feel the <i>Maker's Golden Stare</i>. <br /> <br /> ((taking the opportunity to do some aiming until the DENNISes get to act. Will be firing on Jarsiln's turn just before the DENNISes act, taking whatever 2-3 die bonus comes out on that tick))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T07:36:25-07:00","id":159029,"title":"","content":"<i>Something tells me this is not a good better proceed with a little bit of caution.</i><br /> <br /> Amelia looks around trying find who or what is wailing but is going to continue into the ruined pitcher plant but at a slower rate avoid hazards.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T11:48:35-07:00","id":159235,"title":"","content":"(Infiltration Team)<br /> The Tannicks' attack bounces off a bubble which shimmers briefly. However, as Pellias lined up his sights, Enien leaped up and grabbed the DENNIS, taking her wrist, and transferring into a bear hug.<br /> <br /> &quot;I love you,&quot; she says, patting the monster's head, as the DENNIS' face reddens.<br /> <br /> (Pellias' aim gets 3 dice, and you and Jarsiln now act simultaneously)<br /> <br /> (Distraction team)<br /> <br /> Amelia climbs down, certain to get closer to the wailing, as she comes across a pair of Rusemin. One was a young woman with blood streaked across a clearly broken leg, along with a small child which was missing his left arm. The pair were huddling, trying to get away from a trio of animals which could only be desribed as what would happen if a koala and an alligator decided to force evolution. The fearsome creature at the head of their pack grinned, baring its teeth menacingly, as another chewed on what you assume was the child's arm.<br /> <br /> In addition, the wall in front of you begins to rumble. <br /> <br /> Meanwhile, the pills work as intended, and Wren dozes off, <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T16:02:33-07:00","id":159425,"title":"","content":"From an uninteresting corner of the room, a small star suddenly seemed to pop into being in an instantaneous flash and sail towards the DENNIS being grappled by Enien. The wrist-to-bearhug motion, the chaos around the room... all taken into account for a single perfect, surprise shot with only the quiet and stillness of the ignored corner of the room left in its passing.<br /> <br /> ((<i>Maker</i> shot, adding 3 die from 1st excellency for a total of an even 20: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4524908/\" target=\"_blank\">10 successes</a> to <i>burninate</i>/hit))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T18:19:05-07:00","id":159579,"title":"","content":"(Infiltration Team)<br /> Pellia's shot flies true, and buries itself in the DENNIS' back. She looks at Enien with a face of utter betrayal, as Enien only continues to pet her head.<br /> <br /> (Jarsiln's go, Kelsyk)<br /> <br /> (Distraction team)<br /> The Rusemin turn to you, crawling as best as they can.<br /> <br /> &quot;Help us,&quot; They plead to Amelia.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T18:59:55-07:00","id":159592,"title":"","content":"Amelia will place herself between the beasts and the rusemin and quikly strike at the pack leader with her autoklaive (standard attack with <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4525028/\" target=\"_blank\">8 sux</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T12:11:08-07:00","id":160130,"title":"","content":"Jarsiln's eyes narrowed as the Hellstrider's attack bounced off the DENNIS.<br /> <br /> &quot;Defenses should be down, time for me to strike.&quot;<br /> <br /> Jarsiln eyed the target as he concentrated, gathering his essence and preparing to strike. As his essence gathered he shaped it and directed it as needed; it poured into his limbs overcoming their natural limits of speed and strength. He held the essence only for an instant, just long enough throw his weapon at the DENNIS.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Attack:<br /> 3 First Dex Excellencies to improve the attack<br /> 2, 10, 8, 5, 5, 8, 6, 10, 10, 6, 5, 2, 3, 4, 7, 5, 6 = 9 success<br /> <br /> Damage:<br /> 1 First Strength Excellency<br /> Total: 9L + successes<br /> <br /> Sky-Cutter:<br /> (Dex + Thrown to catch, difficult 2) 6, 6, 2, 7, 4, 8, 5, 4, 6, 9 = 3 success<br /> (Would my Thrown speciality apply here, I pass any way but am curious?)<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","name":"kelsyk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T16:22:15-07:00","id":160351,"title":"","content":"(Infiltration team)<br /> <br /> (Yes, it counts, Kelsyk. The roll concerns Sky Cutters, so it is relevant.)<br /> <br /> The attack strikes the cuts into the DENNIS' torso, spewing that familiar crackling fluid, but is otherwise fine. The free dennis converges on Enien, slicing into her arm with an emerald laser, slicing it off with one motion. Enien falls to the ground on her backside, cradling her arm.<br /> <br /> The other DENNIS turns to Jarsiln and lashes out with a sudden whip of rubbery goo. It hits with an accuracy of 7 Successes, and would deal +6L damage. What will you do. <br /> <br /> (Jin's turn)<br /> <br /> (Distraction team)<br /> <br /> Amelia's attack sliced the beast into cutlets, as its fellows look on and then run. The pair of Rusemin look on with pure gratitude.<br /> <br /> &quot;Thank you ever so much!&quot; the woman says,&quot; We're part of the Gauntlet, and came from there,&quot; they say, pointing to down the slope you're on.<br /> <br /> At that moment, a green pillar of light blasts down, and out of it walks a cadre of electric figures followed by a pale man in giant armor.<br /> <br /> &quot;Lord, this seems to be the West. We seem to have come down to Sable Thesis Dream's labs,&quot; one of the figures says, pulling out a large cylinder that opens in half to several screens. The Dragonblooded soldiers finger their weapons, as Wren is woken up by Geigar.<br /> <br /> &quot;Sir, we seem to have a problem. Maybe you can lend us some insight?&quot; he asks.<br /> <br /> (Exthalion, you are free to act now)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 06-05-2014, 08:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T17:15:39-07:00","id":160391,"title":"","content":"I thought that the DENNIS Jin attacked and the one grappled by Enien were different. I intended to attack the one not be grappled, assuming that the grappled DENNIS is being taken care of by Enien and Pellia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","name":"kelsyk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T17:27:54-07:00","id":160403,"title":"","content":"So you did. My apologies. I redid that entire bit. Also, one of the DENNISES attacked you, kelsyk. What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T17:53:35-07:00","id":160416,"title":"","content":"When you say &quot;hits with an accuracy of 7 Success&quot; does that mean his attack roll produced 7 success (in which case my dodge of 8 beats his attack) or do you mean he got 7 successes above and beyond me defense (in which case I let my armour absorb the blow since I lack a perfect defense)?<br /> <br /> Just making sure I understand what has happened so far. Three DENNISes arrived, one was smashed by Jin's first attack (my interpretation of your description was that it is dead), one was grappled by Enien and shot be Pellias, and the last one negated Jin's second attack then was hit by me. The DENNIS I attacked ignored me to attack Enien and free the DENNIS she was grappled to. The newly freed DENNIS then turned and ignored the immediate target, Enien, and attacked me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","name":"kelsyk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T07:14:39-07:00","id":160775,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>kelsyk</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/60177-ic-exalted-gunstar-to-boldly-go?p=160416#post160416\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When you say &quot;hits with an accuracy of 7 Success&quot; does that mean his attack roll produced 7 success (in which case my dodge of 8 beats his attack) or do you mean he got 7 successes above and beyond me defense (in which case I let my armour absorb the blow since I lack a perfect defense)?<br /> <br /> Just making sure I understand what has happened so far. Three DENNISes arrived, one was smashed by Jin's first attack (my interpretation of your description was that it is dead), one was grappled by Enien and shot be Pellias, and the last one negated Jin's second attack then was hit by me. The DENNIS I attacked ignored me to attack Enien and free the DENNIS she was grappled to. The newly freed DENNIS then turned and ignored the immediate target, Enien, and attacked me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry about not getting to this earlier, my internet cut out last night.<br /> <br /> When I say hits with an accuracy of 7 successes, I mean DENNIS rolled 7 successes on their accuracy roll, so it wouldn't get past your Dodge DV. If it had, then, yes, you probably could have soaked it easily enough.<br /> <br /> I am slightly embarrassed by this entire combat. Making the trio all the exact same has made it difficult for me at times to differentiate between them, which is partly what happened. Your assessment of the action is correct, and hopefully we can clear this up.<br /> <br /> What may make this more clear is to understand that the DENNISes are all one Pyrian behemoth. They're operating entirely on their own threat assessment and command given as though they are gospel, even if it may not be. Thus, when Enien's arm was cut off, in the DENNIS' mind, she was no longer a threat, and not worth pursuing further. She had not exhibited any ranged attacks or extensive Essence use. Clearly she had been neutralized.<br /> <br /> On top of this, however, I don't want this to become an NPC-fest of the NPCs acting against one another. I was trying to engage you all in this fight, and keep things interesting. I admit, it probably was a bad move to have them attack you just after you pointed out a gaffe of mine, as it made it seem like I'm out to get you. Such is not the case. I really appreciate all of you and your willingness to join my game, and I hate it myself when my GMs assume a &quot;You versus me&quot; attitude, so I try my best to not come off as this way. I was just trying to make sure everyone was &quot;involved,&quot; so to speak.<br /> <br /> So! to keep things clear.<br /> <br /> Unit-01: (Unknown)<br /> Unit-02: DEAD<br /> Unit-03: DEAD<br /> Unit-04: (Formerly clinched by Enien, wounded by Pellias, just failed to attack Jarsiln)<br /> Unit-05: (Heavily wounded by Jarsiln, wounded Enien)<br /> <br /> In short, I apologize for the muddiness of my storytelling, and any misunderstandings that may have arisen therein.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 06-09-2014, 10:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T10:36:52-07:00","id":160936,"title":"","content":"IC:<br /> Jarsiln blinked in suprise as the newly freed DENNIS completely ignored the nearer target to attack him. He was not, however, suprised enough to miss whip of goo trying to hit him. With a slight twist he was out of the whips line of attack.<br /> <br /> &quot;Too slow,&quot; Jarsiln thought to himself, &quot;and I don't think I will give you the opportunity to try again.&quot;<br /> <br /> OOC:<br /> I though that the DENNIS Pellia hit was the one being grappled, based on your description of &quot;Pellia's shot flies true, and buries itself in the DENNIS' back. She looks at Enien with a face of utter betrayal, as Enien only continues to pet her head.&quot;<br /> <br /> My RPG background is mostly Living Forgotten Realms with GMs who are actually aiming for TPK so a GM's attitude of &quot;GM versus Player&quot; is fairly routine for me, at least in terms of combat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","name":"kelsyk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T19:38:25-07:00","id":161347,"title":"","content":"Jin will, a gently and quickly as possible, pick Enien up with his 'Strider's left hand, attempting to interpose the bulk of the war-machine between the DENNIS's and the wounded Infernal. <br /> <br /> (Jin is taking a 'Defend Other' Action, targeting Enien)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T06:01:55-07:00","id":163487,"title":"","content":"Amelia advance to the rusemin and quikly evaluate the situation<br /> <br /> <i>I need to take them somewhere safe or the beasts will come back to finish them of but without medical attentions they will probably die from blood loss if I leave them alone I need to get them to the medics but the rest of the team is still inside come on Amelia think... </i><br /> <br /> &quot; Dammit &quot; Amelia will help the rusemin and take them to a safer place someplace a bit out of reach from the beast before heading back to the entrance to the gauntlet.<br /> <br /> (Sorry I didn't post earlier I've been a bit busy)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T17:42:44-07:00","id":164244,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>kelsyk</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/60177-ic-exalted-gunstar-to-boldly-go?p=160936#post160936\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">OOC:<br /> I though that the DENNIS Pellia hit was the one being grappled, based on your description of &quot;Pellia's shot flies true, and buries itself in the DENNIS' back. She looks at Enien with a face of utter betrayal, as Enien only continues to pet her head.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>D'OH.jpg<br /> <br /> Sorry this took so long, Gents.<br /> <br /> (Infiltration Team)<br /> <br /> Jin gently picks up Enien, who proceeds to spit up a glowing bluish-purple goo and rubs it on the stump of her ruined limb.<br /> <br /> Pellias' turn next.<br /> <br /> (Distraction Team)<br /> <br /> Alright, then, Magnusar. Roll (Perception+Awareness) to find suitable hiding spots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 06-11-2014, 12:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T20:51:15-07:00","id":164382,"title":"","content":"(Perception+Awareness) <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4530587/\" target=\"_blank\">5 sux</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-09T23:40:46-07:00","id":164561,"title":"","content":"Seeing Enien lose her arm caused a sympathetic flash of pain, despite his conflicted issues with her previously, but it quickly paled in comparison to the outrage Pellias' emotions experienced when the remaining security entity lashed out at Jarsiln. He'd slunk only so far to prepare for his next assault when his muscles tensed, feeling a mix between fury and concern for the shapechanger.<br /> <br /> Hissing like an angry animal in an electric buzz that hung in the air, he quickly drew his rifle and pumped all his anger and concern into the familiar mechanism of the <i>Maker</i>. When he exhaled the rage in a steadying breath, it came out as three angry stars streaking through the air in an impossible choreography. DENNIS 04 needed to die.<br /> <br /> ((Trance of unhesitating speed for 3 attacks for 6m:<br /> 1: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4530672/\" target=\"_blank\">5 successes </a><br /> 2: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4530673/\" target=\"_blank\">9 successes</a><br /> 3:<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4530674/\" target=\"_blank\"> 7 successes</a> ))<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-10T22:52:03-07:00","id":165662,"title":"","content":"(Wow. Jotun. That was really evocative. That's a 2 die stunt there, Also, Jarsiln gets a point in Solar Bond. If there was &quot;Lunar Bond&quot;, I'd give it to Pellias...<br /> <br /> Yeah, Pellias has a point in Lunar Bond, now, too. Yeah. that happened.)<br /> <br /> Pellia's initial shots are pushed aside by an invisible bubble, but the second two struck true, blasting DENNIS-04 into pieces.<br /> <br /> (Jarsiln's turn)<br /> <br /> (Distraction Team)<br /> <br /> Amelia finds a small maintenance alcove, and pushes the Rusemin into it. They ought to be safe for now. The Rusemin mention that the Gauntlet started back and upwards from their current location. You couldn't miss it, were it not for the walls in front of you, you could get there in a few minutes, but Kankos went in there, and a light exploded, and then the walls shot up, and they couldn't get him out. They recommend trying the rope bridge; a series of cables hanging overhead, connected to a series of pillars tat leads parallel to the path the Rusemin just described.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 06-11-2014, 06:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T19:17:23-07:00","id":166449,"title":"","content":"&quot;I was right, you didn't get the opportunity to try again,&quot; Jarsiln thought as he watched the DENNIS get blasted apart. &quot;Jin seems to have her, I never did get her name, now I just need to give that last thing something else to think about.&quot; Jarsiln's eyes narrowed as he quickly scanned the area. He nodded as a plan formed in his mind, &quot;provide a nice visible distraction and get myself between the wounded and the attacker.&quot;<br /> <br /> With the plan in place Jarsiln launched himself into a sprint, heading towards the DENNIS. As he approached he hurled his weapon, hoping he had calculated its rebound correctly. Just before he reached the DENNIS Jarsiln shifted his momentum from the floor to the wall, going up and over his target. As he landed on the other side he raised his hand to catch the now returning Sky-Cutter.<br /> <br /> Attack: 10, 5, 1, 3, 9, 4, 7, 9, 7, 2, 8, 1, 3, 7 = 8 success<br /> <br /> Athletics+Dex to wall-run (if neccesary): 6, 10, 8, 8, 8, 2 = 5 success<br /> <br /> Dex+Thrown to catch Sky-Cutter: 9, 10, 6, 4, 8, 5, 7, 1, 5, 6, 7, 2, 9, 4 = 7 success","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3025,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","user":"kelsyk","date":". 06-19-2014, 04:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","name":"kelsyk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T15:43:45-07:00","id":167296,"title":"","content":"Amelia thanks the Rusemin for the directions and began her ascension to the rope bridge with haste taking every possible shortcuts, trying to gain back the time she used to help the Rusemin the more time wasted the more danger the crew of the Zekka was exposed to danger. (So Amelia haul ass to the bridge)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-12T21:54:06-07:00","id":167560,"title":"","content":"(Infiltration team)<br /> The Sky cutter roars at the DENNIS, halted by the invisible barrier that it possesses, until that, too, is shattered, and the Sky Cutter buries itself into the DENNIS' face. Slicing deeply, it flies back to Jarsiln's hand, where he catches it deftly. <br /> <br /> (The Infiltration team has won! What will you do now?)<br /> <br /> (Amelia)<br /> <br /> She finds herself suspended over much of the ringed section of the complex you are in. The pitcher plants lie below you, both whole and ruined ones. One of note, though, lies in the sealed off section, where a Rusemin man with short horns and a scowl that could melt iron, is literally stewing in the juices of the plant. He doesn't seem to be hurt by the experience, though, or at least, his anger is distracting him from it. Who knows?<br /> <br /> If she were to continue on, Amelia would find the initial starting point of the Gauntlet, as denoted by several signs and a termainal casting holograms of the color commentary by both Dream and the Princess. The Princess is visibly sickened by Dream's pithy descriptions of her fellow Rusemin being devoured, mauled or killed by various and sundry environmental hazards, but she remains quiet, pursing her lips. <br /> <br /> (Wren)<br /> <br /> Still waiitng on your reply.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-14T08:58:55-07:00","id":168970,"title":"","content":"<i>This looks important</i> <br /> <br /> Amelia will go down to the pitcher plant with the frowning Rusemin on it to take a closer look as it is strange that he would stay there to stir this thing while bombs are falling on the place. she tries not to frighten the Rusemin as she approach him <br /> <br /> &quot; What are you doing here ? And what is in there ?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-15T10:47:10-07:00","id":169917,"title":"","content":"(Amelia)<br /> <br /> &quot;What am I doing here? I've been trapped! Those beflorgled Exalts have me in here after this flashing green light hit me, and I decided I had enough. I smashed one of the packs of toothbeasts to paste, and I saved my bestest friend, Capreen, from them. Then these walls came up, and I was tossed into this pitcher plant by some pink haired baido. Gorram, I am so pissed right now!&quot; he fumes, the fluids around him bubbling, as a faint green tongues of flame suffuse his body.<br /> <br /> &quot;The name's Kankos, by the by,&quot; He says, &quot;Tell me, is Capreen around? He's a tall thin bloke, got horns like a gazelle on him.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T16:36:46-07:00","id":171179,"title":"","content":"Jin will pop the hatch to his new 'Strider, and will ask Enien if she's okay (with Celestial exalted, you can never be sure how sever an injury actually is...)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T18:06:43-07:00","id":171248,"title":"","content":"Wren had fallen asleep quickly, but he woke up in a ponderous amount of time, rising up. &quot;Alright. I'm ready to get to work.&quot; He spoke softly, smiling slightly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1148-palemask","name":"Palemask","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T03:55:27-07:00","id":171536,"title":"","content":"Pellias, having overheard the pre-battle chatter from the DENNISes, opted to take the extra moment to lay a few extra shots from a sidearm into various sensory organs (or remnants thereof) on the downed security entities.<br /> <br /> Satisfied that the DENNISSes weren't about to get up, he turned with a concerned look towards Enien. &quot;How's she doing?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T09:29:57-07:00","id":171697,"title":"","content":"(Wren)<br /> <br /> Wren wakes up to his Dragonblooded subordinates fingering their weapons, as a handful of electric figures stand around a tall man in armor. The figures are all surrounding one of their number with a brass trinket.<br /> <br /> &quot;We're in the far West, Milord. Somewhere on the fringes. We're definitely on the right planet, though, where those Gunstar folks are. Sraosha's predictions are never wrong, you know,&quot; the electric figure with the trinkets says to the armored man.<br /> <br /> (Exthalion, you may now join in)<br /> <br /> (Infiltration team)<br /> <br /> Enien laughs, &quot;I'm fine, now. I had to apply some salve. I think you might want to turn around, though. Things might get unsettling if you're not ready for it.&quot;<br /> <br /> The stump of her arm then blossomed with new bones, ligaments, and finally, muscles and skin, all arising out of the blue-purple goop she applied to the wound. As this finished, and she began flexing her newly recreated arm, her caste mark: a moebius strip comprised of a dragon with eight wings, along with her anima banner, a scintillating tree-shaped aurora of color that burned your eyes to look at for too long. <br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, that's good. So, what will we do now?&quot; she asks.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T17:27:26-07:00","id":173378,"title":"","content":"<i>So this is the newly exalted infernal interesting he has potential to make a great ally.</i><br /> <br /> &quot; Hmm I see so your new family has decided to make you behave through labor typical. I do not know your friend but some of your people have sent me and others to rescue the princess and slay the witch you can join me if you wish or you can stay here but I do not wish to give you false hope your friend maybe dead.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T20:23:08-07:00","id":173571,"title":"","content":"(Amelia)<br /> <br /> &quot;Did they now? That's nice,&quot; Kankos says, his fiery anima cools for a moment, &quot;I would also suspect that Capreen isn't quite as dead as you might imagine. He has a nasty habit of not quite dying. Would you mind helping me out?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T03:09:05-07:00","id":173915,"title":"","content":"Gesturing to the DENNISes on the ground, Pellias took a quick scan of the room. &quot;We're noticed by now, that's for sure, but surprise isn't necessarily gone. We've taken out the security fairly easily minus er.... *he gestured to Enien's regrown arm*... but this is all just revealing more of ourselves. We get back on track, take anything useful&quot; he said as he pointed to the mech that Jin had crawled out of, &quot;and keep going. The outside team isn't about to let down their effort, and neither should we&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T13:32:07-07:00","id":174509,"title":"","content":"<br /> IC:<br /> Jarsiln was glad that Enien seemed to be alright, but his eyes narrowed when he spotted her caste mark. His hand twitched slightly as he suppressed the reflexive urge to attack.<br /> <br /> Jarsiln's mind raced with the possibilities of the situtation, &quot;if an Alchemical can turn evil and become Apostate, then perhaps an Infernal can choose to be good. Or this entire group of exalt has turned to the service of the Primordeals. Either way I will have to be on my guard.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I am all for withdrawing for now, but we will have to return. This place is far too dangerous to leave intact.&quot;<br /> <br /> OOC:<br /> I have added a proper description to my previous post to replace the quick one I did before.<br /> <br /> Concerning Jarsiln's knowledge from his time here before the others arrived:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> How large is the facility? What is the feasibility of destroying it from the inside with the Warstriders? How failed Gauntlet runs did Jarsiln see before the subject succeeded in exalting, and how many has he seen since (to possibly give him some idea of how far along the experiment is)?<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3025,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","user":"kelsyk","date":". 06-19-2014, 05:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","name":"kelsyk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-19T16:57:23-07:00","id":174699,"title":"","content":"&quot;It is good for the soul to believe that, and harmful to the body to rely on it. Our first order of business is to understand the situation. We must achieve contact with the planetary lord, and establish independent sources of information, the Gunstar's get have subverted leadership before.&quot;<br /> <br /> He looked around the area for a moment and continued to himself, &quot;I had hopped for a more barren world, the people are the ones who always end up hurt no matter how these things end.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T08:43:22-07:00","id":176038,"title":"","content":"&quot; I don't have a problem with that but I have my own mission to accomplish but yes I will help you and you will help me in return, but we need to move speed is crucial &quot; <br /> Amelia doubles back to the rope bridge and continues on the way she was before hopefully with Kankos.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-21T10:08:20-07:00","id":176097,"title":"","content":"(Jarsiln)<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> The facility is approximately three cubic kilometers in size. The actual complex you are in is about three hundred meters tall, and from what you've seen and gleamed from your tentative forays into the public infonet, you could see that the construction of the manse is largely indestructible from conventional means. However, should one destroy the hearthstone room, the widespread power system feedback ought to destroy or render the entire place inoperable. <br /> <br /> There have been six Gauntlets, apart from the one that's happening right now. Jarsiln has seen the last three, and the one that actually succeeded was the one right before this one.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> (Distraction team)<br /> <br /> The electric figure bows to Iereniel, and says, &quot;Of course, Lord. The Planetary Lord is one Sable Thesis Dream, a Defiler currently employed by the Prince of Repugnance, Kurteur, Seventh Soul of Metagaos. Kurteur sought to create a temple-planet to himself, but I have heard that she has co-opted the project into some sort of Exaltation factory. After all, who would care about the deaths of such Rusemin vermin? Although....Perhaps those soldiers could help?&quot; the Attaman says, turning to the Dragonblooded soldiers.<br /> <br /> &quot;You there, could you direct us to Sable Thesis Dream?&quot; the Attaman asks, as the soldiers turn to Wren.<br /> <br /> (Amelia) <br /> <br /> Amelia lowers a nearby cable, and drags Kankos out. He wipes himself off, and he sighs and shrugs.<br /> <br /> &quot;Who am I to argue with a pretty girl? Lead the way,&quot; he says. They reach the starting point of the Gauntlet, and a hologram appears before them.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, so you survived. As to be expected of a Neptune Caste Titanic Exalt.But, can you survive this, I wonder?&quot; the hologram of Sable Thesis Dream pushes her glasses up her brow, and then disappears.<br /> <br /> Then, the surrounding area goes black, and both Amelia and Kankos feel hemmed in, as though in a casket barely large enough for them. Pain and fear begin to creep up their bodies, and shooting pain lances out of their skeletons, as a single thought echoes through their minds.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&quot;KILL YOU&quot;</span><br /> <br /> They then hear a piercing feral scream. Something very bad is coming.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T17:11:26-07:00","id":177464,"title":"","content":"Rare are the times when Amelia feels fear but when she does she likes it, because it means that it's gonna be glorious and bloody, Amelia give Kankos a little smile and a few words before she closes her helmet and ready her sword.<br /> <br /> &quot;Brace yourself there newbie this is gonna get fun&quot;<br /> <br /> She begin to walk inside the gauntlet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 06-22-2014, 08:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-23T21:50:25-07:00","id":178641,"title":"","content":"Alright, Magnusar. Roll for Join battle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T07:25:30-07:00","id":178915,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#2f2f2f\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Join Battle roll </span><a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4547183/\" target=\"_blank\">4 sux</a><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> <br /> (Can we see anything or is it still pitch black ?)</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-24T16:10:38-07:00","id":179308,"title":"","content":"The Darkness retracts, revealing where you are, save that you can see a green and black woman with a large '01&quot; on her forehead. Blood is weeping from her eyes, and a look of pure rage is cast upon her face.<br /> <br /> (Turn order is Amelia, DENNIS-01, Kankos)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T03:41:29-07:00","id":179562,"title":"","content":"((I believe that infiltration team is heading further on the path to the sorceress, as per the OOC thread))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T08:24:46-07:00","id":179728,"title":"","content":"[[That's my votes for it, yeah]]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T12:53:30-07:00","id":179971,"title":"","content":"<i>01 huh ? it does not look very though but I like the look she has in her eyes.</i><br /> <br /> &quot; Oh don't look at me like that I feel all tingly inside now &quot;<br /> <br /> As soon as the last word leave her mouth Amelia moves in sudden burst of movement crossing the distance between her and DENNIS in an horizontal jump almost a golden blur her autoklaive roar the tip rake the grounds as she approach her enemy. As she close in she unleash her attack upward sending dust and debris into the air, before turning on herself to attack a second time this time the strike is horizontal and aims for the spine, holding it with two hand to put as much force behind it as possible trying to jam it in its flesh to let the chain rip her apart as it turn at high speed. <br /> <br /> (Amelia unsleah a flurry of two attacks at the creature the first attack is at 13 dice and scores <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4548628/\" target=\"_blank\">8 sux</a>, the second is at 12 dice and scores <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4548630/\" target=\"_blank\">2 sux</a> !? o.O amelia aso activates dipping swallow defence for one mote)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-25T17:04:27-07:00","id":180182,"title":"","content":"(Infiltration Team)<br /> Alright, then. You ascend the stairs, with the Tannicks compacting itself into a small box about the size of a suitcase when Jin sought to go through the door. On the next story, you come across a large network or gardens, with smaller versions of the pitcher plants you found.<br /> <br /> If you continue up further, you'll find a single room with a single large plant in the center of a massive room. In the center sits a small cupola, from which you can all feel a massive amount of power emanating from. The plant rustles even thought there is no wind, but then lays still.<br /> <br /> (Amelia) <br /> Amelia's two attacks bounce off the skin of the monster, who cups her hands over her face and screams. She flicks some of the spilt blood at Amelia, which transforms into wicked daggers midflight. She attacks with 9 suxx and 6 suxx respectively. What will Amelia do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T06:53:57-07:00","id":180760,"title":"","content":"Well the first attack hit even with dipping swallow defense with a threshold of two success but the second is blocked thanks to a second activation of dipping swallow defense for an additional two motes of peripheral essence for a total of 4 motes spent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-27T19:45:28-07:00","id":182443,"title":"","content":"'<i>Explosives may have been a good idea</i>' thought Pellias as they made it to the centre of the garden. It occurred to him that the defences up until then had been fairly light; no guards apart from the DENNISes, no checkpoints.... no traps, really. He couldn't help but feel a little like an insect of some sorts being drawn into a trap to be eaten like he'd seen at the menagerie back home. <br /> <br /> &quot;Intel&quot; he whispered to Jin. &quot;What do you make of this?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-27T22:31:25-07:00","id":182632,"title":"","content":"(Amelia)<br /> <br /> The first attack does 2L damage. Kankos' anima begins to surge, as his veins bulge, and his eyes become bloodshot. <br /> <br /> &quot;Come get some,&quot; he mutters with a fanged grin, and Amelia feels blasted with a humid heat, even within her armor. <br /> <br /> (It is now Amelia's turn)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-27T22:59:12-07:00","id":182650,"title":"","content":"Jin gazes about the room, looking at the strange plants once. Activating Telltale Symphony for 5m, Jin closes his eyes focusing on the flowing arias, chiming suites and banging marches of essence...<br /> <br /> He gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4551416/\" target=\"_blank\">4 successes</a> on his (Int+ Occult roll). If needed, he gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4551417/\" target=\"_blank\">5 successes</a> on a (Int + Lore) roll to interpret the information's greater significance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-28T20:39:18-07:00","id":183454,"title":"","content":"(Infiltration)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L7SkrYF8lCU\" target=\"_blank\"> Jin hears a cacophony of chewing, gnashing teeth, that slowly evolves into a resonant melody that is strangely erotic in it's underpinnings</a>. The underlying essence is undeniably that of Metagaos, the Thousand-Tooth Blossom.<br /> <br /> The pitcher plant begins to rustle further and faster than before. What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-29T13:59:11-07:00","id":184067,"title":"","content":"(Wren)<br /> <br /> (Still waiting for your response to Iereniel's appearance, Plaemask)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-29T15:50:18-07:00","id":184150,"title":"","content":"IC:<br /> Jarsiln looked around the garden with a combination of curiosity and trepidation. Despite his experiences since started his infiltration he still did not feel fully comfortable around plants or natural environments, his default view of how the world should be still based on the twisting mechanical corridors and chambers of the Gunstar.<br /> <br /> As he gazed around the room he muttered to himself, &quot;things look so different when your a mouse.&quot; He paused a moment before speaking normally, &quot;It might just be the different perspective, but I don't even recognize this room from my time in this place.&quot;<br /> <br /> Jarsiln was startled as the pitcher plant began to rustle, having to suppress the reflexive urge to shift to his spirit form and seek cover.<br /> <br /> &quot;I know I don't have much experience with plants, but are they supposed to move around on their own like that?&quot;<br /> <br /> OoC:<br /> Is this part of the gauntlet one that Jarsiln has visited before? Does he have any information on this area that could be useful?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/60177-ic-exalted-gunstar-to-boldly-go?p=180182#post180182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Infiltration Tea)<br /> You ascend the stairs, with the Tannicks compacting itself into a small box about the size of a suitcase when Jin sought to go through the door.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait, so Jin is just carrying the Warstrider around as a suitcase? [Joking]Did I miss the part where it said that Warstriders are actually giant inflatable balloons?[/Joking] We really need to get that technology for ourselves. Forget using high essence Alchemical's as ships, lets all just carry battleships /armouries/fortresses/Gunstars/etc around with us.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3025-kelsyk","name":"kelsyk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-02T02:39:22-07:00","id":186140,"title":"","content":"Seeing the rustle grow in intensity, Pellias gave an inward sigh and began to prep his weapons again. The next time, he reminded himself, he was going to bring explosives... big ones. Hopefully though, finishing off whatever efforts the sorceress was throwing in the face of increasing adversity would restore the <i>Zekka</i>, or at least allow them to get onto that particular problem without worry of being further complicated by Sable Thesis Dream's tricks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T10:48:02-07:00","id":193788,"title":"","content":"( Amelia is now at 2 bashing and 2 lethal damage and at -2 penalty but she gains 12 motes of overdrive essence from damage)<br /> <br /> Amelia will maneuver herself to flank 01 with Kankos but she does not attack yet instead she will try to find some sort of weak spot on the creature <br /> (she activates panoptic fusion discipline for 3 motes of personal essence, Amelia as 16 mote of personnal essence left and 8 of peripheral left)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.c